window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5201,"title":"Chapter 5201: Closer","paragraphs":["Ye Jian didn’t reject the female soldiers’ approach. She didn’t put on airs because of her contempt in the past. She smiled and answered whatever the female soldiers asked. She was extremely amiable.","Li Xiushui patted her chest and whispered to the others, \"I’m finally at ease now. She doesn’t hold grudges.\"","God knew how anxious she was today. She was afraid that Ye Jian would bring up the past. She tried to speak a few times, but her heart wasn’t so anxious.","Fang Xin, who didn’t speak much, lowered her head and rubbed her calf that was hurting from the male soldiers’ kick. After a while, she pursed her lips and said softly, \"She’s not that kind of person. You’re thinking too much.\"","If Lieutenant Ye really wanted to calculate, she wouldn’t have helped them so much today. She didn’t take the past to heart at all.","\"Yes, yes, yes. You’re right. Lieutenant Ye isn’t someone who takes revenge.\" Li Xiushui, who was pressing her shoulder with one hand and twisting it back and forth, smiled. Seeing the figure surrounded by their comrades, she leaned close to Fang Xin’s ear and whispered, \"I was really proud just now. Ye Jian didn’t lose to the five of them. Hehe, why do I feel like I was the one who won instead?","\"She’s so cool. If I were a man, I would want to woo her too. Do you think we can be as good as her one day?\"","Fang Xin would not talk about topics like this anymore, but when asked if Li Xiushui could be as good as Lieutenant Ye one day, Fang Xin thought about it seriously for a while and shook her head honestly. \"No, it’s very difficult.\"","Li Xiushui was a little disappointed. \"That’s right. With her shooting speed, she can match the speed of two people. Who can achieve that? I suspect that even Captain Lei can’t do it.\"","\"You’re not bad either.\" Seeing Li Xiushui’s look of disappointment, Fang Xin comforted her dryly. She wasn’t good at speaking, so she couldn’t think of any other way to comfort Li Xiushui.","Li Xiushui couldn’t help but raise her eyebrows. \"That’s true. I’m not bad either. If I’m not as good as Lieutenant Ye in basic training, I have to surpass her in technical training. A two-year veteran can’t lose to a half-year recruit.\"","Fang Xin, who had been lowering his head, finally raised her head and looked at her comrade. She wanted to say something, but she didn’t know how to. Forget it, they would be training together in the future anyway. She would know who was stronger then.","Lieutenant Ye... How could such a powerful person like her be easily surpassed? If they worked hard, Lieutenant Ye would work hard too.","Just now, when Li Xiushui said that she felt as if she was the one who won when Lieutenant Ye won the battle, Fang Xin actually felt the same. All the female soldiers were beaten up by the male soldiers until they couldn’t resist and were forced to retreat step by step. Only Lieutenant Ye didn’t let the male soldiers gain the upper hand. When a few male soldiers said that they were beaten up by Lieutenant Ye, the female soldiers felt smug about it.","No one had thought that Lieutenant Ye would surpass them one day. They were still surrounding her and asking her how she did it. Fang Xin wanted to hear it too. She moved closer silently so that she could hear more clearly.","Although they lost, the female soldiers were still very interested to hear Ye Jian talk. The male soldiers were the same. When the squad leader came over and saw the smiles on the female soldiers’ faces, she felt a little better.","The female soldiers were all beaten up. As the squad leader, she didn’t feel good. Captain Lei could tell that she was in a bad mood, so he called her over to talk to her at the last minute. The conversation made her feel better. She adjusted her expression and said gently, \"All of you are surrounding Ye Jian. At least make some space for her to sit.\"","\"Ah, we forgot. It’s all our fault for being too excited...\" Before she could finish her sentence, the female soldier felt the pain from her injuries. The female soldier who spoke was in so much pain that tears welled up in the corners of her eyes."]},{"number":5202,"title":"Chapter 5202: Counter Kill","paragraphs":["Ye Jian hurriedly held her. \"Don’t move. Sit down slowly. Where does it hurt? Let me take a look.\"","Back in the military school, she was always in charge of taking care of the students in her class. After leaving the military school, she took over the establishment of the all women special forces unit and had to take care of the female soldiers. Now that she saw that the female soldiers were all injured, she naturally wanted to take care of them.","Her concern made some female soldiers feel uncomfortable. Ye Jian didn’t mind how she treated her in the past and even cared about them. A female soldier dragged her painful feet and walked to Ye Jian’s side. She bowed deeply and apologized, \"I’m sorry, Ye Jian! I was wrong in the past. I’m really, really sorry.\"","Ye Jian, who was caught off guard, didn’t expect a female soldier to bend down and apologize to her. She jumped in fright and hurriedly held the female soldier. She pulled her to sit down. She simply told them to leave those things in the past and that they didn’t need to feel burdened over it. They also didn’t need to bow to her and apologize.","She felt awkward seeing them bow to her so suddenly.","A smile flashed past Captain Lei’s eyes. Ye Jian, who had just graduated from university, was about the same age as the female soldiers, but she was much more mature. With her around, the female soldiers would gradually calm down.","Everything was heading in a good direction. He believed that in the near future, this group of female soldiers would definitely become the elites of the military unit.","Small Head, who was focused on checking if the male soldiers who were beaten up by Ye Jian had any broken bones, strode over. When he saw Captain Lei staring at Ye Jian, who was surrounded by the female soldiers, he smiled and said, \"Captain, why don’t we learn from Ye Jian’s counter-attack just now? That move was impressive and awesome. It was a lethal counter-attack. It’s quite suitable for us.","\"We just need to increase our agility. Just now, after a few small tests, even the most flexible in the unit, Plum, couldn’t do it in one go. But we found the trick and practiced it. We should be able to do it.\"","Small Head was quite confident in himself and his comrades.","As for Captain Lei, he felt that learning that move would be very difficult.","It wasn’t that he wasn’t confident in the male soldiers, but a man’s physique was inherently hard. It was really difficult for the male soldiers with hard muscles to complete Ye Jian’s snake-like movements.","He glanced at Little Head, who kept having fantasies. Sighing, he persuaded him earnestly, \"Small Head, we should be more realistic. Not all counter-killing moves are suitable for everyone. Some moves can be used by male soldiers but not by female soldiers. Some moves can be used by female soldiers but not by male soldiers.\"","\"Captain, do you mean that only female soldiers can do that move? That’s impossible.\" Small Head didn’t believe it. He was full of fighting spirit now. How could he let someone rain on his parade? \"I’ve already grasped the trick. As long as I try and practice more, I’ll definitely succeed.\"","Definitely? How could he be so sure?","How stupid was this kid to train his waist to be flexible at this age? Also, he had to train his leg strength too. Fine, since he wanted to try, as the captain, how could he dampen the enthusiasm of his soldier? Captain Lei had to support him fully.","\"Okay, you can learn it. Let’s see if the female soldiers or the male soldiers will be the first to pick up this move. This move focuses on agility and leg strength. If you want to learn it, you have to train your legs first. I won’t be making iron boots. In the future, when you run, just tie sandbags around your legs.","\"How about this? Set a time with the female soldiers to see who can complete Ye Jian’s move within the stipulated time. The loser will be at the mercy of the winner.","\"Let’s see who wins and who loses so that you won’t give up immediately after realizing the difficulty of the task.\""]},{"number":5203,"title":"Chapter 5203: Bleed And Not Cry","paragraphs":["Small Head really felt that it wasn’t a problem. He nodded and agreed without thinking. \"Okay, I’ll go over and talk to them now.\" He had just taken a step forward when he quickly retracted his leg. He smoothed out his wrinkled air force camouflage training clothes. Small Head then glanced at the female soldiers who had just caught their breath and asked his captain, \"The female soldiers were beaten up badly by us male soldiers tonight. Are you still going to let them train overtime as punishment?\"","During the day, they carried out an armed cross-country run for 30 kilometers. They returned to the team at 5:00 pm and ate at 5:30 pm. They only rested for about an hour before the training at 7:00 pm. Then, their captain trained them directly. Now that they had lost, they still had to train for an extra hour. No matter how one looked at it, it was a little tragic.","Captain Lei glanced at the veteran who doubted his rules. His lips, which had turned purple due to exposure to the sun for many years, formed a sneer so cold that it caused Small Head’s heart to pound. \"Do you think my words have become nonsense?\"","\"You’re the boss. You have the final say. What I said just now was bullsh*t. It’s all bullsh*t,\" Small Head replied with a straight face. He was the captain’s sidekick and would always follow the captain’s footsteps. He would never go astray because... he didn’t have the guts to go astray.","It was time for the female soldiers who had been enjoying themselves for half a year to get on their feet. This was now the right time, the right place, and with the right people. With the captain taking action, their good days were over!","The battle just now wasn’t a decision made at the last minute by the captain. He had already instructed the male soldiers when the female soldiers went for a 30-kilometer cross-country run. He told them to arrange for a 3v1. They would fight however they fought normally. They didn’t have to show mercy. This wasn’t supposed to be a fake fight.","The captain had been making preparations for a long time. Who would dare to disobey him?","They didn’t know what a fake fight was. They really didn’t!","One against three... To be honest, the male soldiers couldn’t bear to treat the female soldiers that way. They didn’t dare to be ruthless.","In the end, however...","This group of female soldiers was ruthless. They exerted all their strength the moment they started fighting. The male soldiers deliberately went easy on them for the first time. In the end, they really fought.","Although the female soldiers spoke gently, they were quite strong when they were angry. Small Head touched the corner of his mouth that was hit by a female soldier’s fist. He could even taste blood when he licked it.","As the faint iron taste spread in his mouth, the courage in his body was stimulated. Small Head narrowed his eyes, revealing a glint. He looked as if he had discovered his prey.","It would be interesting if the female soldiers were ruthless.","If they were weak, the male soldiers couldn’t be bothered to practice with them.","The 15-minute break was over. Those who should be checked had all been checked. They were bloody and wounded, but no bones were broken.","Captain Lei felt that it was a pity. After gathering, he frowned and asked the male soldiers fiercely, \"Who showed mercy just now? Step up!\"","The male and female soldiers stood facing each other. Captain Lei stood in the middle and spoke as usual, \"There’s not even one broken bone. Did everyone eat their meals today?!\"","None of the male soldiers stepped forward. They didn’t show any mercy, but they didn’t really intend to beat the female soldiers to death either.","If they really wanted to beat the female soldiers to death, there would be a few with broken necks, let alone bones.","The female soldiers, who were still in pain, felt that the male soldiers hadn’t shown any mercy. It was already one against three. Did they show any mercy? Not at all!","However, if the captain felt that the male soldiers had shown mercy, no one would dare to refute him. If even the male soldiers didn’t dare to step up, they wouldn’t have the guts either. They would just accept it obediently!","\"I don’t think you’ve experienced the feeling of bleeding and not crying tonight. The male soldiers didn’t go all out during their first fight against female soldiers today and failed to meet my requirements. All of you, give me an extra hour of off-aircraft training tonight!\""]},{"number":5204,"title":"Chapter 5204: Integration","paragraphs":["The training ended at 9:00 pm. If one hour was added to the training, it would end at 10:00 pm. Compared to Ye Jian’s past training, one hour of extra training was much more relaxing.","At 10:00 pm, the female soldiers, who had been tired for the entire day, could finally help each other back to the dormitory to rest. The squad leader realized that Ye Jian didn’t return to the dormitory with them. She turned around and looked behind them, but Ye Jian was nowhere to be seen.","The squad leader lowered her eyes slightly. The guesses she had during the day got stronger.","The deputy squad leader pushed open the dormitory door. Lu Hui, who was the first to enter, lay on the ground and said weakly, \"You guys go ahead. I want to rest for a while. Don’t bother me.\"","From the training ground to the dormitory, she had used up the last of her strength. Her body was like jelly now. She could only lie down and not stand up.","Everyone was about the same. When they saw Lu Hui lying down and deflating one by one, they decided to lie down together. When the deputy squad leader saw this, she wanted to lie down too!","She lay down and let out a long sigh of satisfaction. It was so comfortable that she wanted to sleep.","The lights were snow-white and bright. Three people were lying horizontally on the clean cement floor, and four people were lying vertically. Within three minutes, Tang Liyin was sleeping soundly.","Lu Hui, who was sleeping beside her, turned her head and sighed. \"Did she get hit the least? Is she hurting at all? I’m in so much pain that I can’t sleep.\"","\"Don’t talk and I’m sure you’ll fall asleep within five minutes,\" Guo Cui said in a weak voice. Her body was in pain. She was so tired that she couldn’t open her eyes. She just wanted to sleep.","\"Ye Jian isn’t back. I can’t sleep.\" Lu Hui, who didn’t want to move, glanced at the empty upper berth. \"I still want to have a chat with her.\"","The deputy squad leader, who was resting with her eyes closed, said, \"There must be something that needs to be dealt with. Don’t wait for her. You can wash up after resting. Sleep early and rest well.\"","\"Close your eyes and sleep while you wait. Stop talking. It’s noisy,\" Li Xiushui said vaguely. Her eyelids became heavier and heavier. In the end, she fell asleep.","Ye Jian, who came back around 12:00 am, gently pushed the door open and entered. Then, she closed it gently. Just as she took a step, she lowered her gaze and looked at the ground where several sounds of breathing could be heard. They... were all sleeping on the ground.","The autumn night in the southwest was cold. If they lay on the cold cement floor, wouldn’t they catch a cold the next morning?","She tiptoed closer and bent down to nudge the female soldier who was sleeping at the outermost corner. She didn’t know who it was, but she had to wake her up first.","She pushed her twice, but the female soldier didn’t wake up. Instead, Ye Jian heard her muttering in a low voice.","\"Bet... I’ll win...\"","It was Lu Hui’s voice.","Even in her dreams, she wanted to win the bet.","Ye Jian didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. She nudged Lu Hui again. \"Lu Hui, don’t sleep on the floor. You’ll catch a cold. Get up and sleep on the bed.\" She nudged Lu Hui at least six times before she woke up.","Lu Hui, who sat up from shock, saw a black shadow squatting beside her. She couldn’t help but shout, \"Who is it?!\"","Ye Jian smiled and said, \"Were you frightened? Why are you all sleeping on the ground? Hurry up and go back to bed. Be careful not to catch a cold.\"","Lu Hui heaved a sigh of relief when she heard the familiar voice. She rubbed her eyes and yawned. \"I’m too tired, and I’m dirty. How can I climb into bed?","\"You just came back? What time is it?\"","\"Yes, I just came back. It’s past midnight,\" Ye Jian replied in a low voice and nudged the next person awake.","Lu Hui shook her stiff shoulders before waking her comrades up. \"Why are you being punished by Captain Lei so late at night? That shouldn’t be the case. We should be the ones being punished.\"","She didn’t expect Ye Jian to come back late because of the intensive training.","\"That’s not it. I went for training.\" Ye Jian didn’t hide anything and spoke casually. Lu Hui, who had been sleeping so soundly just moments before, didn’t react in time. She replied in a daze and nudged Guo Cui awake. She then took off her clothes and climbed onto her bed.","They were all very sleepy in the middle of the night. They didn’t ask Ye Jian why she returned to the dormitory so late. They took off their clothes, closed their eyes, and fell asleep.","It wouldn’t be too late to talk about it at dawn."]},{"number":5205,"title":"Chapter 5205: Quiet","paragraphs":["The next morning, when Lu Hui woke up, she saw that Ye Jian had washed up and pushed the door open. After saying ’good morning’, she seemed to have thought of something. Her eyes widened as she shouted in shock, \":-Lieutenant Ye, did you say something very important to me last night?\"","Early in the morning, the dormitory became lively because of Lu Hui’s energetic voice. It was not time to gather yet. The female soldiers, who had already woken up, sat up with bright eyes. What important matter? Why didn’t they know?","They only remembered that last night, Ye Jian came back quite late and woke them up. They were so tired that they took off their clothes and went to bed with their eyes closed. They didn’t have any impression of what happened after that.","Ye Jian, who was used to waking up early, put down her toiletries and smiled at Lu Hui, who could still remember what happened in the middle of the night after waking up. She raised her eyebrows and revealed a playfulness that Lu Hui and the rest had never seen before. \"I don’t think I said anything important.\"","That was right. Ye Jian only said that the ground was cold and asked them to go back to bed to sleep. Nothing else happened.","\"What important things were said? Why don’t I have any impression of it? Lu Hui, did you remember wrongly?\" Li Xiushui asked. She really didn’t know what had happened.","They were in the same dormitory. Was Lu Hui the only one who knew what happened?","Tang Liyin smiled too. \"I don’t know either. Lu Hui, did something happen in your dream? For instance, were you beaten up by male soldiers in your dream?\"","Fang Xin, whose bed was under Ye Jian’s, got up silently. She folded her clothes as she listened carefully. She thought for a moment and remembered that Ye Jian didn’t say anything special.","\"You definitely said something important! I’ll have to think about it.\" Lu Hui got up from the bed and nimbly made her bed. In a short while, she had folded the quilt into a square \"tofu block\". It was so angular that it was obvious that she had put a lot of effort into learning how to properly fold quilts.","Soon, the other female soldiers got up one by one. They arranged their ’tofu blocks’ and smoothed out their bed sheets. Li Xiushui, who had smoothed out her bed sheets until there were no wrinkles, sighed. \"After entering the military unit, my OCD was satisfied. In the past, when I was studying, I liked to line up the towels, toiletries, buckets, and washbasins in a straight line. Unfortunately, the arrangement would only last three seconds before they were messed up. Later, my father said that my illness would definitely be cured in the military unit, so I came.\"","She looked around the dormitory and saw that everything was arranged in a straight line. Li Xiushui felt her mood lift.","The military unit was indeed a paradise for obsessive-compulsive people. Even the buns in the cafeteria were placed neatly like bricks. No matter how you looked at it, it was comfortable.","Lu Hui was still thinking about what Ye Jian said last night. She wasn’t prepared for Li Xiushui to change the topic, so her train of thought was interrupted. She couldn’t remember what important thing Ye Jian said last night.","She was sure that Ye Jian did say something back then. She was just too sleepy and didn’t take it to heart.","Seeing that she was still pulling her hair and forcing herself to remember, Guo Cui got down from the top berth and smiled. \"With your memory, you might not be able to remember it even if you pull out all your hair.\"","\"Let’s think about what tricks Captain Lei will play today and be mentally prepared. If we get beaten up like last night, we’ll be paralyzed in less than a week.\"","The topic was a little heavy. The female soldiers, who had been chatting and laughing just now, instantly became quiet."]},{"number":5206,"title":"Chapter 5206: Winning Each Other","paragraphs":["Thinking about last night’s 3v1, Lu Hui shivered. \"It’s probably considered a light punishment to be paralyzed, right? I’m worried that other than Lieutenant Ye, all of us will come in vertically and leave horizontally. Although I’m already prepared to sacrifice at any time, I prefer to sacrifice on the battlefield rather than be beaten up by the male soldiers.\"","The deputy squad leader, who had been smiling and listening to her comrades, looked at Lu Hui helplessly. \"Don’t worry, Comrade Lu. You won’t be sacrificed. You’ll definitely be discharged.\"","The deputy squad leader clapped her hands and said to her comrades who had woken up and were preparing to wash up, \"Let me say a few words about last night’s fight. First, we have to understand our current identities and what we might face in the future. Second, we have to have a proper attitude. We can’t allow any negativity or evasion. Third, don’t think that you’re too weak. With Ye Jian around, we have to have confidence in ourselves. We have to believe that one day, we’ll press the male soldiers to the ground and beat them up.","\"Fourth, Ye Jian came back late last night because she was training. How could she win against the male soldiers? How could she achieve her current results without her own hard work?","\"If we can learn from Ye Jian, it won’t be difficult for us to defeat the male soldiers. The most important thing is whether we can endure hardships like Ye Jian. After the day and night training, we’ll train until midnight.\"","This time, the dormitory was even quieter. They couldn’t even hear their own breathing. Everyone seemed to have been struck in the head. They were dumbfounded, and their emotions were complicated.","Gulp...","Some of them swallowed their saliva, and an audible sound was heard.","Additional training until midnight...","Their careful gazes that were full of worship flew sideways to Ye Jian, who was standing at the back. Was she made of steel? She could still train despite training till the point of exhaustion during the day and at night? How did she do it?","Only then did Ye Jian, who was standing at the back, realize that as it turned out, the deputy squad leader heard what Lu Hui asked last night and what she replied. She looked up and met the deputy squad leader’s gaze. The deputy squad leader winked at her. She seemed to be sending a message to Ye Jian.","Then, she smiled and said, \"Lu Hui said that she forgot something very important. I think it should be this. Isn’t that right, Lu Hui?\"","Lu Hui, who was standing in line, replied loudly, \"Yes, deputy squad leader!\"","Knowing that Lieutenant Ye came back at midnight after additional training, she really felt that she should kowtow and apologize to her.","Ye Jian smiled. The deputy squad leader wanted to stimulate the female soldiers again. In the future, she would be named by the squad leader, deputy squad leader, and Captain Lei to stimulate the female soldiers from time to time. That was how she was going to be their whittling knife.","After entering the airborne force, her very existence was to stimulate the female soldiers. There was nothing wrong with being named from time to time. When the female soldiers were stimulated, they would work harder to learn. They wouldn’t dare to let their guard down and let themselves become a joke.","They would stimulate each other, motivate each other, and win.","Soon, everyone in the female soldier class knew that Ye Jian had been training until midnight last night. They were so shocked early in the morning that they had to hold their jaws to prevent them from dislocating.","The deputy squad leader saw her comrades’ shocked expressions when they looked at Ye Jian. The smile in her eyes widened. \"I know that all of you want to surpass the strongest soldier because you’re unwilling to fall behind.","\"Now, Ye Jian has become the strongest soldier among us female soldiers. Do you still have the confidence to surpass Ye Jian?\""]},{"number":5207,"title":"Chapter 5207: Competing","paragraphs":["The deputy squad leader asked the female soldiers if they had the confidence to surpass Ye Jian. At the same time, she asked herself if she had the confidence. She just knew that she would definitely work hard and leave no regrets.","After asking the female soldiers and herself, the deputy squad leader smiled and asked Ye Jian, \"Ye Jian, do you think they can surpass you?\" She blinked lightly. Ye Jian needed to understand what she meant.","\"I feel that it’s difficult based on the current training,\" Ye Jian replied seriously and analyzed the reason. \"My training is twice as intense as theirs. I complete every day’s training with double the training. They’re taking one step while I’m taking two steps. I doubt they’ll be able to surpass me at this rate.\"","She understood the hint in the deputy squad leader’s eyes instantly. Her answer made the deputy squad leader secretly happy.","The female soldier, who said her knees were a little weak, suddenly felt the pressure of two mountains weighing on her when it was previously just one.","They had only taken one step, but Ye Jian had already taken two steps. In the long run, Ye Jian would walk farther and climb higher, leaving them far behind.","Just thinking about it was terrifying.","The expressions on the female soldiers’ faces disappeared. The deputy squad leader knew when to stop. She couldn’t hurt them too much. She should push them forward at an appropriate time. Ye Jian was only this cooperative because of Captain Lei’s instructions.","This was good. With her around, they could see how big the gap was. Only then would they know how to work harder.","\"Think about what I said. It’ll be an unrealistic dream to surpass Ye Jian if you don’t do anything different. Alright, go wash up.\"","They had to gather at 5:30 am. It was 5:20 am now. They had to hurry.","As they dispersed, the deputy squad leader looked at Ye Jian gratefully and nodded slightly to express her gratitude.","When they reached the bathroom, Lu Hui went to Ye Jian’s side to confirm her guess. She was probably afraid that she wouldn’t be able to withstand the continuous blows, so she braced herself and asked, \"Lieutenant Ye, can you answer my question honestly? Were you always... training when you came back late in the past? Were you training with the male soldiers?\"","Ye Jian, who was washing her face with water, raised her head and wiped the water from her eyes. She smiled and replied without answering directly, \"Guess.\"","\"If I could guess, I wouldn’t have asked.\" Lu Hui pouted. She was almost leaning on Ye Jian now. \"Did you really go for training with the male soldiers?\"","The smile on Ye Jian’s face got deeper. She could see through Lu Hui’s thoughts at a glance. Lu Hui was just too embarrassed to say it directly. It seemed like Lu Hui had suffered a huge blow yesterday night. She knew how to be cautious now.","\"Yes. Do you have any other questions? I can answer them all at once,\" Ye Jian replied. Her dark eyes glinted as she looked at Lu Hui. At that moment, Lu Hui felt that Ye Jian’s clear eyes had seen through all her thoughts. She averted her gaze unnaturally.","Forget it, she wouldn’t hide anymore. Lieutenant Ye must have seen through her thoughts. If not, she wouldn’t have said that she could answer all questions in one go.","Thinking about this, Lu Hui didn’t feel awkward anymore. She asked openly, \"Is the training targeted at professional skills?\"","At this moment, the sound of water was diffused so that Ye Jian’s reply could be heard better.","\"That’s right. I’m from the army. I’ve never come into contact with the training of airborne soldiers. Naturally, I have to focus on professional skills training. So...\" After washing up, Ye Jian patted Lu Hui’s shoulder. Seeing that her expression was getting stiffer, Ye Jian was very satisfied. She said slowly, \"So, you have to be prepared.\"","Prepared for what?","Prepared for Ye Jian to surpass her in professional skills!"]},{"number":5208,"title":"Chapter 5208: Real And Fake","paragraphs":["The female soldiers who were listening secretly looked at each other. Their shoulders trembled, and they could see the fear in each other’s eyes. No way! Could it be that Ye Jian would really use half a year to surpass veterans like them?","\"Retreat, retreat. I’m afraid I’ll faint if I continue listening.\" Li Xiushui touched Tang Liyin, who was standing there in a daze. The two of them quickly picked up their toiletries and left the bathroom as if they were being chased by a ferocious beast.","Fang Xin slowly closed the tap. She pursed her lips and looked at Guo Cui beside her. She raised her chin slightly, asking if she wanted to go out with them.","Guo Cui nodded. She wrung out the towel and left with Fang Xin. When she came out of the bathroom, she saw Li Xiushui and Tang Liyin standing outside. When they came out, they raised their hands and pointed in front. The four of them tacitly carried their toiletries to the corner in front to talk.","The bathroom was designed with three rows of taps. Ye Jian was in the left row while Guo Cui and the rest were on the right. Their backs were facing each other. Li Xiushui and Tang Liyin were at the front. Now that the four of them had left, only Ye Jian and Lu Hui were left.","Lu Hui’s face froze. She pulled the corners of her mouth forcefully and revealed a smile that was uglier than crying. \"It can’t be. It’s only been... half a year. But... you’ve even surpassed me in professional skills?\"","She realized that when she talked to Ye Jian these few days, she was always stuttering!","Ye Jian smiled mysteriously. \"I don’t know. Maybe I’ve surpassed you guys, or maybe I’m still at the bottom. After all, you’re all the top soldiers in your old military units. No matter how hard I work, I was only given half a year.\"","\"That’s all I can think of. I’ll definitely keep an eye on you during the professional skills training in the afternoon! Lieutenant Ye, I won’t give in to you just because you’re a lieutenant.\"","Lu Hui, who was not discouraged or afraid of blows, was still very confident in herself.","The deputy squad leader, who had finished washing up, met the squad leader. There were still a few minutes, so the two of them stood in a corner of the corridor and talked. The deputy squad leader told the squad leader about Ye Jian’s training last night. The squad leader smiled and sighed. \"Yesterday, I suspected that Ye Jian would secretly go for training every night. I was right. She had never missed a night training session. I admire her for persevering.","\"She’s been pretending for half a year. After returning from the exercise, she stopped pretending. Deputy, what do you think it means?\"","The deputy squad leader didn’t even think about it and said in a low voice, \"This means that Lieutenant Ye’s technical training has reached a level where there’s no need to pretend anymore. Yesterday, when Captain Lei mentioned Lieutenant Ye, his words were filled with admiration. You can tell from Captain Lei’s attitude that it’s very likely that Lieutenant Ye used only half a year to reach the standard of our airborne soldiers.\"","The squad leader nodded. \"That’s right. There’ll be technical training today. We’ll see if it’s as we guessed.\"","The deputy squad leader suddenly laughed. The squad leader smiled and asked, \"What are you laughing at?\"","\"I’m laughing at the troublesome Lu Hui. I’m afraid she’ll receive another blow today.\"","The squad leader couldn’t help but laugh when she thought of the bet. \"That’s right. It might be a bigger blow than yesterday. Our two military units have the same basic training, so Lu Hui can still accept it if Lieutenant Ye is better than us in that regard. But if Lieutenant Ye surpasses us in technical training, I’m really worried that Lu Hui will be so shocked that she’ll want to kill herself.\"","\"Lu Hui’s mental fortitude is quite strong. She’s able to admit her mistake voluntarily. I hope she can maintain a good mentality during today’s training.\"","The whistle blew. The squad leader and deputy squad leader didn’t discuss further. They brought their teams out. The deputy squad leader saw Guo Cui and the other three running out of the corner of the fire escape corridor. The four of them quickly returned to the dormitory without noticing the deputy squad leader."]},{"number":5209,"title":"Chapter 5209: Facing","paragraphs":["Lu Hui and Ye Jian heard the whistle and rushed out of the dormitory. They even met Guo Cui and the other three. Lu Hui thought that they had gone down early and asked in surprise, \"Huh? Didn’t you go out early? Why are you still holding your toiletries?\"","\"We talked for a while,\" Guo Cui explained as she quickly walked past them. She put down the toiletries and rushed out again.","As for what they talked about, Guo Cui didn’t mention it.","Lu Hui muttered, \"Isn’t it tiring to talk while carrying your toiletries?\" Without asking any more questions, she quickly followed Ye Jian downstairs.","From today onward, she would stick close to Ye Jian and not move an inch. She would also follow closely during the training at night. It was just that... she didn’t know if Ye Jian would agree to let her follow her closely.","The morning training started. Behind the male military depot, the female soldiers stood in front and Captain Lei stood at the front. At 5:30 am, the female soldiers started the cruel training that they had never experienced before. Their days when they were scolded by Captain Lei also began.","In the morning, they ran five kilometers at a uniform speed and frog-jumped for 300 meters. They also did 100 push-ups and 100 squats with weights. They practiced horizontal bars one to five and parallel bars one to five. This was the most basic training that they had to complete in the morning.","Before this, the female soldier could only run five kilometers at a uniform speed, frog jump for 300 meters, and do 100 push-ups. There was nothing else.","After the first round, a female soldier fell from the horizontal bar. If the male soldiers below hadn’t reacted quickly and caught her, she would have gotten injured early in the morning.","\"You don’t even have the strength to hold up the horizontal bar. Do you think you can carry guns on the battlefield? Do you know where your strength comes from? Eat more and train more! You pamper yourself like a noble lady every day, but you can’t do that with me. As long as you’re not dead, train!","\"Why are you remaining crouched for so long when you’re doing squats? Get up!\"","\"Where’s your jumping ability! You can’t even jump before sandbags are tied to your feet. Will you only be able to squat on the spot after sandbags are tied to your feet?\"","During the first morning’s basic training, the female soldiers saw how demanding Captain Lei’s training was.","They had witnessed his scolding skills. At first, they felt awkward when he scolded them, but later, they calmed down.","As for Ye Jian, Captain Lei went around her a few times but didn’t find any problems. Even his dark expression improved.","When the female soldiers were scolded, the male soldiers were scolded too. It was not embarrassing to be scolded together.","After breakfast, there was training for close combat, resistance to falls, and bare-handed combat skills. The female soldiers who were thrown by the male soldiers felt like they were living in hell. They hugged, carried, kicked, and fell... They experienced all kinds of falling techniques.","Fortunately, everyone had undergone dizziness-resistant training. Otherwise, they would really be dizzy from the constant falling.","Small Head pointed out that he wanted to undergo combat training with Ye Jian. The two of them fought secretly. They fought back and forth until Captain Lei even started to enjoy the show. Real combat should be like this. It was exciting and fierce!","Seeing the female soldiers being thrown around by the male soldiers, Captain Lei felt as if there was a bomb stuffed in his chest. If he was provoked a little more, it would explode.","The sharp whistle blew. It was urgent and ear-piercing. One could tell that Captain Lei was in a bad mood.","\"Everyone, stop.\" His voice was as loud as thunder.","There seemed to be thunder and rain. The female soldiers, who were covered in dust, felt their hearts sink.","They knew how they performed just now. When facing the male soldiers, they were like new recruits. They were forced into a flurry by the male soldiers’ ruthless moves. It would be strange if Captain Lei wasn’t angry."]},{"number":5210,"title":"Chapter 5210: Rise","paragraphs":["Captain Lei didn’t scold the female soldiers this time. He suppressed his anger and took a deep breath. He shouted, \"Ye Jian, Small Head, step out!\"","\"Yes!\"","\"Yes!\"","The two of them ran from the line to the front and stood at attention.","\"Watch carefully, female soldiers. Next, the two of them will demonstrate. Watch carefully!\" After Captain Lei finished speaking, he took a step back. Ye Jian and Small Head prepared themselves. When Captain Lei blew the whistle, the two of them clenched their fists tightly. Their gazes were fierce like two ferocious beasts confronting each other.","The demonstration started. It started with close combat, resistance to falls, and bare-handed combat skills. It was so exciting that the female soldiers couldn’t take their eyes off the scene. They even secretly learned how Ye Jian dealt with Small Head’s fierce moves.","After the demonstration ended, Captain Lei’s expression improved a little. He glanced at the female soldiers coldly and saw that they were trembling in fear.","In the past, they felt that they weren’t bad. They took the training arranged by the male soldier instructors very seriously. They would spar with each other from time to time, and they felt quite good about themselves.","Unexpectedly, after facing the male soldiers, they were no different from weaklings. They realized that what they thought was not bad was so weak that they couldn’t withstand a single blow from the male soldiers. They even suspected that their two to three years of military career was just a joke.","They had been strict with themselves and worked hard to improve. Why were they so weak in the end?","What was the reason?","Captain Lei didn’t continue reprimanding the female soldiers. They still had a foundation. Unfortunately, they encountered the soldiers he trained. If the special reconnaissance soldiers didn’t have much ability, they should be ashamed of the term ’special forces’.","\"What is combat? It’s what you saw just now! I don’t care how you trained in the past. From today onward, if your combat training is still like playing house, I have my ways to deal with you!\"","The female soldiers who had seen how powerful Captain Lei was knew that he wasn’t just mentioning it casually. He meant what he said.","\"You’re now a member of my Special Reconnaissance Team. You’re a special reconnaissance soldier. You have to start all over again. From today onward, you need to be stricter with yourself. You can’t let your guard down at any time. If you can’t even deal with this, what right do you have to stand here?","\"I can see that you have a good foundation. However, you still have more room for improvement and greater potential. The chiefs hope that one day, you can become true special reconnaissance soldiers. As the captain, I hope that you can integrate into our big team as soon as possible. We’ll go through mountains of swords and seas of flames together. You will not be inferior to any male soldiers!\"","Captain Lei knew how to give a sweet carrot after a stick.","The female soldier with a serious expression listened attentively and remembered everything Captain Lei said. Yes, they were definitely not inferior to any male soldiers. They would definitely do it!","Just like Ye Jian!","\"Squad leader of the male soldiers, teach the female soldiers well! I want to see their results in half a month!\"","\"Yes.\"","\"The squad leader of the female soldier class!\"","\"Here!\"","\"Keep an eye on the female soldier class and arrange your training time! Give me a surprise half a month later! Can you do it?\"","\"Yes!\" the squad leader replied loudly. In that case, she would bring the female soldiers to learn from Ye Jian and use the night to strengthen their training!","The squad leader was confident, and so were the female soldiers. Ye Jian was confident in them too.","In the following basic subject training, every female soldier completed it quite well. There was no gender difference in the training ground."]},{"number":5211,"title":"Chapter 5211: In Progress","paragraphs":["At 10:00 am, they finished all the basic training. It was time for no less than eight hours of professional training—parachute training. Even a powerful male soldier had to complete eight hours of parachute training every day. Sometimes, there was more.","The female soldiers were waiting for professional training. They couldn’t wait to know if Ye Jian had really surpassed them in everything.","After a night of calming down, the female soldiers weren’t as shocked by Ye Jian’s strong return as yesterday. It took them more than half a year to accept the previous Ye Jian, but it only took them one day to accept the strong return of Ye Jian.","There was a short 15-minute break after the basic training ended. Ye Jian picked up the military canteen beside her and drank a few mouthfuls. While she was still screwing the cap back on, Captain Lei sent a soldier to talk to her.","Ye Jian patted the dust off her body. Then, she followed the male soldier and walked toward Captain Lei.","Not far behind her, Guo Cui retracted her steps and said, \"I’m one step behind the captain again.\"","\"Then forget it.\" Fang Xin retracted her footsteps before Guo Cui. She didn’t want to look for Ye Jian in the first place, but she couldn’t reject Guo Cui.","Wasn’t it more suitable to drag Lu Hui along to look for Ye Jian? That was what Fang Xin thought, but she didn’t say it out loud.","Guo Cui sat down too. \"Yes, I won’t look for her now.\"","Fang Xin looked at her comrade who seemed to have something on her mind. She shook her hands nervously and opened her mouth a few times. Her voice was a little nervous as she asked softly, \"Actually... I don’t know why you’re looking for Lieutenant Ye. I just don’t understand.\"","Afraid that Guo Cui would blame her for being nosy, Fang Xin hurriedly explained, \"I don’t mean anything else. I just want to know why you’re looking for her.\"","Like her, she felt that they had nothing to do with Lieutenant Ye.","Guo Cui knew that Fang Xin didn’t have any other intentions. Seeing that she was anxious, she patted the back of her hand and said gently, \"I’m looking for her to talk about tonight’s training. After it ends, it’ll be noon. It’ll be difficult for us to find Ye Jian during the afternoon break. We can only use this time to talk to her.\"","\"I see...\" Fang Xin smiled shyly. Her voice wasn’t as nervous as before. \"I thought you wanted to bet with Lieutenant Ye again.\"","Guo Cui laughed softly. Fang Xin was reserved, and even her voice was delicate. \"Haha, only Lu Hui would make a bet. I won’t do the same. Do you think that Lu Hui will lose?\"","\"Lieutenant Ye is quite powerful. I feel that Ye Jian won’t lose.\" For the first time, Fang Xin voiced her opinion. Her facial expression turned a little serious. \"My old squad leader is a very powerful person. No obstacles can stump her. The current Ye Jian looks even more powerful than my old squad leader.\"","Guo Cui looked at Lu Hui with ’pity’ in her eyes.","They came out of the bathroom early in the morning. She, Fang Xin, Li Xiushui, and Tang Liyin went to the fire escape and chatted for a while. Ye Jian personally admitted that she came back in the middle of the night after additional training. It was not impossible for her professional skills training to surpass all the female soldiers.","Only Lu Hui still held out hope.","The 15-minute break was over. The male and female soldiers gathered again and entered the eight-hour parachute training. The female soldiers’ gazes landed on Ye Jian unconsciously. Would Ye Jian continue to be powerful?","The off-plane drop shooting training started. As the name implied, they needed to complete the target shooting during the drop."]},{"number":5212,"title":"Chapter 5212: Neither Respects The Other","paragraphs":["There were dozens of simulated planes on the training ground. They were ten meters tall. The male and female soldiers grabbed the ropes and landed vertically from the simulated planes. Because they needed to shoot, all the soldiers chose to descend. It depended on who was faster, whose posture was the most standard, and who could complete the target shooting immediately.","They shot with a pistol. The target was an object that was hiding on the ground. The shooting needed to be completed during the descent process. Very soon, gunshots sounded in the empty training ground. Dozens of figures in air force blue camouflage uniforms descended vertically from ten meters in the air.","There were still three people in front. Now, it was Lu Hui’s turn. She looked at Ye Jian who was standing beside her. She saw that Ye Jian was looking up at the figure that was landing in front of her. She suddenly shouted in a low voice, \"Lieutenant Ye, let’s start the battle. I don’t care if you have learned it or not.\"","After all, she was a veteran who had been in the military for two and a half years. If she really lost, her old comrades from the Aerial 18th Division would definitely beat her to death. For the sake of the Aerial 18th Division and her own dignity, she couldn’t lose. She mustn’t lose!","Ye Jian was looking up at the male soldiers who were descending from the ten-meter simulation plane. Suddenly, she heard Lu Hui speaking. She tilted her head and saw that Lu Hui was full of confidence. Ye Jian smiled slightly. \"Okay, I’ll work hard to win you too.\"","If she didn’t win, Captain Lei and Commander Kong would probably be disappointed.","Lu Hui was full of fighting spirit. When she learned that Ye Jian trained alone until midnight every night, she was indeed frightened. However, she wasn’t a coward. She wouldn’t admit defeat until the final result was known.","She raised her chin slightly and replied proudly, \"It takes one to know one.\"","Ye Jian was amused by her appearance. Lu Hui didn’t want to lose and wanted to win. However, there was always a winner and a loser. Ye Jian couldn’t be the loser.","In that case, Lu Hui was the one who would lose.","Soon, it was Lu Hui’s turn to ’board’ and complete the vertical shooting landing. She had always been very confident in her professional skills. It wasn’t that she had a good sense of self-esteem. It was just that her standards were good.","After the rope was buckled, Lu Hui dived out of the ’cabin’ at her fastest speed. Then, she fired her gun at three points on the ground.","After three consecutive shots, her head was quite close to the ground. If she continued rushing down, her head would definitely explode.","She retracted her strength and turned her body. Her legs instantly landed on the ground, completing the off-air vertical shooting training.","The entire process showed how deft and agile she was. The entire rope was pulled straight out of the ’cabin’ in a straight line. The figure that landed on her feet didn’t sway for a moment before stabilizing herself. She then quickly released the rope and ran back to wait.","Lu Hui, who completed the vertical landing in a standard posture, made the male soldiers secretly say, \"Good.\"","Ye Jian and Lu Hui were not in the same simulation plane. When Lu Hui ran back to the lineup, Ye Jian was running to complete the training. The two of them exchanged glances and saw the confidence in each other’s eyes that they would win.","Ye Jian already knew how powerful Lu Hui was. However, Lu Hui didn’t know how capable Ye Jian was.","Lu Hui, who had returned to the lineup, heaved a sigh of relief. Then, she adjusted her breathing. Her gaze landed on the figure that was quickly climbing up the ten-meter simulation plane.","Lu Hui wasn’t the only one staring at Ye Jian. The female soldiers below, including the female soldiers who had finished their training, couldn’t help but look over. They had already entered professional skills training. Lieutenant Ye... had she surpassed them?"]},{"number":5213,"title":"Chapter 5213: A Definitive Loss","paragraphs":["Soon, Ye Jian entered the simulation plane. Captain Lei pulled the lock and asked with a smile, \"How is it? Do you have the confidence to win them? Lu Hui’s drop was not bad. The soldiers from the Aerial 18th Division are indeed good.\"","Ye Jian took the lock and lowered the protective measures. Then, she adjusted the belt to a suitable position and replied calmly, \"If I don’t have the confidence, I wouldn’t show my hand so early. Since I’ve shown my hand, I’ll naturally win.\"","She wanted to return to the Xueyu unit as soon as possible. How could she allow herself to lose?","\"Haha, you’re confident! Commander Kong and I will wait for your victory. Are you ready?\" Captain Lei tightened the buckle on Ye Jian’s body and carefully checked if it was secure.","Ye Jian opened her hands and accepted the final inspection. She replied loudly, \"Report, I’m ready.\"","She appeared at the cabin door, leaned over, and stood upside down. Then, with a whoosh, she fell vertically. She was fast and stable. One look and you could tell that her standard was top-notch.","The female soldiers widened their eyes and looked at Lu Hui. A thought flashed past their minds. Lu Hui would definitely lose!","Lu Hui rubbed her chest and sighed at her closest comrades. \"Don’t look at me. I know what you’re thinking. This is just the beginning. There’s still other training. I won’t admit defeat until the last second.\"","All of them had the same look in their eyes. They were all certain that Lu Hui would lose. Alas, this feeling was very unpleasant.","Bang, bang, bang...","Three consecutive shots were fired at the ground targets, completing the shooting and ending the first round of vertical shooting training. Ye Jian turned over, planted her feet firmly on the ground, and pulled out the rope to return to the line.","Guo Cui felt her breathing gradually calming down as Ye Jian ran. Lieutenant Ye wasn’t just better than them in the basic training. She was better than them in the professional skills training.","Everything had just started. There were more surprises waiting for them.","She whispered, \"Let’s be mentally prepared. There will be more surprises waiting for us.\"","Fang Xin didn’t reply. Her eyes were bright as she stared at the figure running over. Unknowingly, she had already clenched her fists.","Her old squad leader once said that as long as other people could do it, they would definitely be able to do it as long as they worked hard. Lieutenant Ye changed from the army to the air force. In just half a year, her professional skills exceeded theirs even though they had been at it for more than two years. In that case, would she become more powerful if she worked as hard as Lieutenant Ye?","The squad leader and deputy squad leader had already guessed that Ye Jian’s technical training might surpass the female soldiers. Before the technical training started, they were already mentally prepared. Hence, they were much calmer.","However, even though the two of them were mentally prepared, Ye Jian’s performance in the various technical training subjects still shocked them. No matter which training it was, Ye Jian was able to complete it easily. Not to mention the individual tactical training, no one in the female soldier class could surpass her.","When it came to tactical training, they needed to cooperate. The chemistry between her and the male soldiers seemed to have been tempered thousands of times. There was no awkwardness at all. It was impossible to tell that she was an army soldier.","At night, she recited various methods of handling special situations, and her speech was so fluent that it was like a book was placed in front of her, and she was reading it without any pause in between.","For three consecutive days, Ye Jian was far ahead with the highest scores in her class. It was not until Captain Lei told the female soldiers personally that Ye Jian had completed the same training as the male soldiers and completed the skydiving training in the five main subjects that Lu Hui knew that she had lost completely."]},{"number":5214,"title":"Chapter 5214: Only Her","paragraphs":["The night was dark. The thin night mist enveloped the huge military camp. Captain Lei stood at the front of the line after they had finished their training for the day. His sharp gaze swept past the female soldiers who had their heads lowered. His deep and cold voice stabbed into the female soldiers’ hearts like knives.","\"You think that you’re so great and that you’re outstanding enough. However, you don’t know that there are people who are more outstanding than you and work harder than you!","\"Ye Jian only used half a year to surpass you, who are from the air force. In that time, she had twice as many missions as you, trained twice as long as you, and worked many times harder than you.","\"In half a year, she surpassed all of you and reached the level of a male soldier. Her tactical training even exceeded that of a male soldier. Yet, Ye Jian doesn’t think that she’s outstanding enough and has more room for improvement!","\"What about you? Do you think you can surpass Ye Jian and the male soldiers in half a year? I don’t think anyone dares to think so.\"","No one would dare to think that they could surpass a soldier with more than two years of military service and good comprehensive abilities within half a year. The female soldiers didn’t dare to, and neither did the male soldiers.","If Captain Lei hadn’t told them, they wouldn’t have believed that Ye Jian only used half a year to surpass them. They would have suspected that Ye Jian was actually an airborne soldier before this.","They had always thought that they were not bad, but compared to Ye Jian, the gap between them was like heaven and earth.","In the past, they rejected and treated Ye Jian coldly because they didn’t want her to stay. They were thinking about how to let Ye Jian leave, but Ye Jian secretly put in twice as much effort as them. At that moment, the shame and anger in their hearts reached their peak. They felt as if they had been slapped dozens of times. They were embarrassed and in pain.","\"I believe that you won’t be willing to be left behind. You must want to prove that you can do it too. I’ll give you a chance to prove yourself. As long as you’re not afraid of hardships or fatigue and can persevere to the end like Ye Jian, I believe that you’ll be as outstanding as Ye Jian a year later. You’ll be even more outstanding than you are now! Do you believe that you can do it?!\"","He didn’t dare to say that they could be more outstanding than Ye Jian because one year later, Ye Jian would’ve improved further.","After three days of training, Captain Lei was very satisfied with the resilience of the female soldiers. In addition, Ye Jian’s outstanding performance stimulated this group of female soldiers deeply. Even though they were tired, their voices were louder than ever. The tighter they were pushed down, the stronger the rebound.","As expected, the female soldiers needed to be pushed. The effect was obvious!","He believed that after harsh training, this group of female soldiers would definitely achieve good results.","If they were given one year, this group of female soldiers would definitely be reborn.","In the sky above the sports ground, the female soldiers’ voices echoed for a long time. They could do it! A year later, they would definitely be as outstanding as Ye Jian. They would definitely be more outstanding than they were now!","With Captain Lei’s reminder from time to time, Ye Jian wanted to finish learning and return to her team as soon as possible. She really wanted to return to her team as soon as possible. The Xueyu unit was her military unit. It was her home.","After disbanding and returning to the dormitory, Ye Jian stepped into the dormitory. Lu Hui, who was following closely behind, immediately closed the door. Right on the heels of that, she pushed Ye Jian’s shoulder with both hands from behind. Tonight, she had to do something big!","When Guo Cui saw this, she pursed her lips and smiled secretly. Li Xiushui and Tang Liyin coughed repeatedly. There was a teasing look on their faces."]},{"number":5215,"title":"Chapter 5215: Outright","paragraphs":["Fang Xin blinked. She seemed to have thought of something and quickly went to the deputy squad leader’s side. She smiled too. She knew what Lu Hui wanted to do.","Three days of training was enough for the female soldiers to clarify the truth. It was also enough for Lu Hui to know that she had lost. Now, she no longer felt that she, a soldier who had been here for more than two years, was stronger than Ye Jian. Even if she lost, she had to lose fair and square!","Caught off guard, Ye Jian took two steps to the back. She turned her head and glanced at the female soldiers standing on both sides. From their expressions, she knew what Lu Hui wanted to do.","She turned around and placed her hands on Lu Hui’s shoulders. There was a smile in her clear black eyes. \"I know what you want to do. There’s no need to kowtow. I can accept your apology.\"","Seeing that Ye Jian had guessed it, Lu Hui, who was not shy to begin with, became more direct. \"That won’t do. Soldiers have to keep our word.\"","\"I think that as soldiers, it’s beneath our pride to kneel casually for a bet. After realizing our mistake, we have many ways to reflect on ourselves. We don’t have to choose the most unyielding method.","\"Even if you fulfill your promise by kneeling and apologizing today, you would’ve lost your pride. This is a very stupid thing to do.\"","The deputy squad leader said, \"Ye Jian is right. It’s fine to make mistakes, but it’s unacceptable to lose the pride of a soldier.\"","Lu Hui frowned and looked at Ye Jian intently. \"Ye Jian, I know that you’re looking out for me. Although you’re right, I made such a ridiculous bet because I looked down on you. That’s why I made the bet without any scruples. I know that kneeling is beneath the pride of a soldier, but I want to teach myself a lesson. From now on, I want to remember not to underestimate my enemy at any time.\"","She would teach herself a lesson that she would never forget in her entire life. She would remember it and never do it again.","Her attitude was especially sincere. Ye Jian could feel her determination to admit her mistake through her eyes. Even though she knew that kneeling was not honorable, Lu Hui still insisted on paying for her mistakes and decisions. Ye Jian admired Lu Hui’s honesty.","She smiled and said, \"If you really want to kneel down to show your sincerity in apologizing, I think you can choose another more sincere way. For example, follow me closely during training in the future. You’ll do whatever I do. How about that? Are you afraid?\"","\"That’s right, Lu Hui. I feel that this is good. In the future, you can train with Ye Jian. I feel that it’s not bad.\"","\"Just listen to our advice. Don’t kneel. You’re in the wrong, and so are we. How about this? The few of us will bow to Ye Jian and apologize. How about that?\" Li Xiushui suggested.","The deputy squad leader felt that Li Xiushui was right. As the deputy squad leader, she was also in the wrong. \"That’s right. Since we need to admit our mistake, let’s admit our mistake together. As the deputy squad leader, I need to reflect on myself and apologize to Ye Jian first.\"","\"Yes, yes, yes. I’ve wanted to apologize to Ye Jian for a long time.\" Tang Liyin nodded quickly. She was in the wrong too. It was just that... she was too embarrassed to say it. Alas, she was awkward and shy. She was also afraid that Ye Jian wouldn’t accept her apology. The more she thought about it, the less courage she had to stand up."]},{"number":5216,"title":"Chapter 5216: Peace","paragraphs":["In the end, the deputy squad leader took the lead and apologized to Ye Jian. Ye Jian, who always thought that she had a part to play, accepted the female soldiers’ apology before bowing deeply to apologize to them.","That was because she was in the wrong in the past.","As she bent down to apologize, a few female soldiers rushed over to help Ye Jian up. Lu Hui even said, \"No, no, no. If you bend down to apologize to us, I’ll panic. Also, aren’t you bowing too much? I’m so anxious that I want to bow to you again!\"","\"In the end, we competed to see whose waist is more flexible and whose forehead will hit the ground first.\" Ye Jian’s sudden teasing stunned the female soldiers for a moment. Then, they couldn’t help but laugh.","Lieutenant Ye from the army... They really liked her current appearance.","In the past, Ye Jian... Well, they still didn’t like her.","Li Xiushui sighed. \"It’s like a dream. It’s unreal. Ye Jian, will you suddenly change back? To be honest, if you change back to the original Ye Jian, I won’t like you even if you’re a lieutenant.\"","Everyone agreed with her. The deputy squad leader’s expression was tense. She was afraid that Ye Jian would turn back into the original Ye Jian in the next second.","Ye Jian’s heart ached for them. How much trauma had she caused them in the past?","She said seriously, \"You don’t like the Ye Jian of the past. Actually, I hate the Ye Jian of the past too. If not, I wouldn’t have trained with all my might. I hope that I can stop being the person I hate as soon as possible.\"","The female soldiers laughed softly. The atmosphere was harmonious and friendly. They were no longer as cold as before.","The sentinel blew the whistle. The female soldiers who had been training for the entire day went to bed. The next day, before the sun rose, a line of white appeared at the horizon. A new day of training would start.","It was late at night in the southwest of the country. The surroundings were silent, and danger was everywhere. On the other side of the earth, the internal strife in Libya that lasted until 1997 had already affected the entire country.","In 1997, the government was formed. In 1999, internal strife broke out again. At the end of 2003, the government controlled less than one-third of the country’s territory. In the autumn of 2005, internal strife in Libya plunged the entire country into deep trouble.","The country sent peacekeepers to Libya to stop the conflict and restore peace.","Xia Jinyuan would arrive at the end of July this year. There were seven members of the Xueyu unit accompanying him. If nothing went wrong, he could return to the country at the end of November.","It was 11:30 pm in China and 4:00 pm in Gothagar, the largest city in Libya. A military bulletproof armored vehicle drove through the streets with almost all the buildings destroyed on both sides, heading south of the city. A group of dark-skinned children from Libya chased after the armored vehicle, shouting something.","A few reporters carrying camera equipment came out of the ruins and saw a group of children chasing after the armored vehicle of the peacekeeping forces. A male reporter held a handful of candy in his hand and chuckled at the children. He stretched out his palm. Under the sunlight, the candy paper in his palm was colorful and beautiful."]},{"number":5217,"title":"Chapter 5217: Wife vs Single Man","paragraphs":["The children who lost the vehicle shouted and ran toward the male reporter.","In the vehicle, T6 retracted his gaze from the observation window and said to Xia Jinyuan, who was resting with his eyes closed, \"Another group of foreign reporters has come. They take a few photos outside the battlefield and a few photos of the ruins, as well as of people from the Libyan army. Just like that, they complete a report from the war zone. Then, they’ll gain reputation and benefit.\"","There were a total of eight people in the armored vehicle. The driver was White Crane, who was proficient in the language of six countries, including the language of a large ethnic group. He looked outside and said calmly, \"They’re all doing their jobs. Do you expect them to die? Don’t be so angry. You’re already a married man. Why are you not mature at all? You’re still such a hothead.\"","This year, on May 1st, T6 Wu Yue and An Jiaxin held their wedding. The Xueyu unit sent three representatives, including White Crane.","T6, who was hugging his gun, raised his long leg and kicked the back of the driver’s seat. \"Shut up. My relationship with my wife is very good. She loves me. What’s the matter? Are you jealous?\"","\"You’re really blind. I’ve been jealous since your wedding. Did you only realize it now?\" White Crane replied with a cold expression. Even his voice was a few degrees colder. The temperature outside was 36 degrees Celsius, and the temperature in the vehicle was dropping rapidly.","T6 smiled proudly. \"I don’t care if you’re jealous. It can’t be helped. I already have a wife. How can a bachelor like you know how good it feels to have a wife? Are you jealous? Well, I don’t mind.\"","\"Just you wait! I’ll definitely find a prettier woman later,\" White Crane, who came from a scholarly family in Jiangnan, replied angrily.","T6 smiled even more slyly. \"I don’t care. Also, it’s uncertain if you can even find one.\"","He hit the nail on the head and pointed out the crux of the problem. White Crane sat to the side and looked at the captain who was holding his helmet to cover his face. \"Q King, you should at least make a sound. T6 is stabbing us bachelors in the heart again!\"","The sun was hot outside, and it was stuffy in the armored vehicle. Xia Jinyuan, who was sitting in front, took off the blue helmet that covered his face, revealing an extremely handsome face.","He looked at White Crane, who had lost the battle and was asking for external help. Then, he looked at T6, who had gotten married and was starting to forget his comrades. He thought for a moment and turned his head to the side. He said to T6, \"The sun has been hot recently, and I’m a little irritable. As a man, don’t mention your wife and show off in front of me. If not, don’t blame me for not warning you in advance if you get hurt by my temper.\"","T6 was different after getting married. He acted like a halfwit every day, afraid that his comrades didn’t know that he had gotten married.","There were less than 200 people in the company, and he had been publicizing it for more than half a year!","T6, who wasn’t threatened at all, chuckled. \"You can continue being jealous. I’ll talk to G3. We’re both married, so we have something in common.\"","G3, who was pretending to be asleep, pretended that he didn’t hear anything and started snoring, indicating that he was asleep and wouldn’t get involved.","It was better not to do such things that made people jealous and hate him. He might be beaten up one day. T6 was young and didn’t understand. G3 was a few years older than him, so he was afraid!","T6, who couldn’t find an ally, decided not to provoke the six bachelors in the vehicle anymore. Tsk, tsk, tsk. Forget it. He would be merciful.","In the car, the intercom suddenly rang."]},{"number":5218,"title":"Chapter 5218: Save Or Not","paragraphs":["A call from the main channel was not a good thing. It usually meant that something major had happened. White Crane quickly entered the public channel so that all his comrades in the car would know immediately.","The car drove slowly on the dilapidated street. Xia Jinyuan, G3, and the other members of the Xueyu unit stared coldly at the surrounding environment as the car drove. In this city where people needed to bring guns on the streets, they needed to keep a clear mind at all times. If not, they might become victims. It might not be safe even if they were sitting in a bulletproof armored vehicle.","Even if they were driving a tank, they might encounter an anti-tank missile.","A week ago, the Italian peacekeeping team went on a patrol. An anti-tank missile equipped with a long-wave infrared fuse was fired from the ruins on the side of the street. It directly hit the tank in front, which exploded on the spot. The soldiers and deputy commander were all sacrificed. Another armored vehicle was blown up by the airwaves, causing three people to be seriously injured. Two of them were slightly injured. They were still lying in Hospital Without Borders. The Chinese team hadn’t heard anything about them.","Even if there had been a sacrifice, they probably wouldn’t be informed.","There was news from the main channel. Three reporters from Wanhai and two British reporters had disappeared after entering the war zone. The last location was shown to be an underground cafeteria in the South District. It was only eight kilometers away from the war zone a few days ago. The authorities of Wanhai contacted their country and asked for help to find the missing Wanhai reporters.","\"Since the British reporters are missing, wouldn’t it be easier to ask the British peacekeeping forces for help to find the missing reporters? Why would they look for us?\"","White Crane was puzzled. He raised his voice and replied coldly.","T6 straightened his body and frowned as he recalled. He leaned forward and whispered to Xia Jinyuan, \"Could it be that the missing reporters from Wanhai are the ones who passed by our Chinese peacekeeping force two days ago? Two men and a woman. They spoke in a weird tone. They said that the equipment of our peacekeeping soldiers is a few levels worse than the equipment of their Wanhai soldiers.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t answer T6. He entered the channel and asked calmly, \"Two men and one woman?\"","\"That’s right. It’s two men and one woman. They’re all reporters from the government television station in Wanhai. The woman is quite famous in Wanhai. She often writes critical news. Her words are sharp, and her angles are tricky. She likes to provoke conflicts and incite debates.\"","The female reporter was highlighted. It was obvious that she was the main character among the three of them.","Xia Jinyuan stretched his legs lazily like a sleeping lion that had eaten its fill in the afternoon. \"Is there anything else? This doesn’t seem easy.\"","The people at the main station understood what he was trying to say. His comrades in the vehicle also understood.","Her words were sharp and her angles were tricky. She liked to provoke conflicts. They didn’t want to look for such a female reporter.","The headquarters could understand. If it were them, they wouldn’t be happy either. However, they had no choice. The higher-ups ordered them to go to the South District to look for the three reporters from Wanhai.","After cutting off the communication, the gloomy White Crane wasn’t even in the mood to drive. \"What should we do? Should we save them or not?\"","The six comrades from the Xueyu unit looked at Xia Jinyuan. K7 silently filled the magazine with bullets. Should they save them or not? Could they reject this task?","They couldn’t.","Xia Jinyuan took out a piece of chewing gum from his pocket and threw it into his mouth. He turned around and looked at his brothers who had gone through life and death with him. \"I want to reject them, but I can’t. Let’s go take a look first. The British have already sent soldiers over, so let’s go meet them.\""]},{"number":5219,"title":"Chapter 5219: Big Trouble","paragraphs":["Wanhai was a special case. It was impossible not to save those reporters. They could be saved, but it depended on how they were saved.","After passing through the relatively quiet streets and crossing over to the South District, the scene became a little clearer. The streets on both sides had become much livelier. You could even see a few children kicking a football that was so dilapidated that its original color couldn’t be seen.","Here, the most common forms of leisure and entertainment were hard to come by. In war-torn countries, survival was the foundation of the citizens. What was leisure and entertainment? Some children had never enjoyed the joys of childhood since they were born.","Eight kilometers away from the South District, there was a heavy fire zone where the two armies were fighting two days ago. One of the shells accidentally entered the civilian area, and there were heavy casualties. That day, Xia Jinyuan and his comrades even saved the injured here, but they didn’t participate in the firefight.","Unless it was absolutely necessary, the soldiers of the peacekeeping forces were not allowed to participate in the crossfire between the two countries. This was the rule.","T6, who got out of the car, looked down at the football that had accidentally hit him. He waved at the boy standing timidly not far away. The boy didn’t dare to come over because of their combat uniforms. T6 shouted in English, asking him to retreat further. He then kicked the football over.","The most common activities in the team were basketball and football. T6 played football well. He raised his leg and kicked the old football.","According to his calculations, this kick would definitely reach the side of the boy who had retreated much farther. However, he didn’t calculate whether the football could withstand his kick. He only heard a bang and several bullets being loaded beside him. The relaxed atmosphere instantly tensed up as they entered combat preparations in seconds.","T6 looked at the football that was kicked through. His gaze was blank.","He saw the distrust and fear in the boy’s eyes when he looked at him. He wanted to kick the football over and let him pick it up. He was doing it out of goodwill... That was all!","\"F*ck! You scared me!\"","V8, who was quickly hiding behind the armored vehicle, looked at T6’s right leg and cursed. He put away his gun and walked out. He said coldly, \"He kicked the little kid’s football until it exploded. Are we going to compensate him with another football or what?\"","The boy who was waiting for the ball to be kicked over almost cried when he saw this.","Then, a few boys, who were scattered everywhere, walked out timidly from various corners. They looked at their only football with confused eyes. It was the ball that could give them the most joy. They saw that the round football had been kicked through and was still hanging on the foot of a soldier from an unknown country. Everyone revealed sad expressions.","They had been playing with the ball for a few years. They were afraid of it spoiling. Every time, they would only play football for a while... That was all. In the future, they would never play football again.","Children looked the most innocent when they were sad, and it was infectious. Even Xia Jinyuan was affected by their sadness. His mood was so heavy that it was oppressive.","\"T6!\" He shouted in a low voice. \"How long are you going to stay stunned? Take down the football!\"","T6, who knew that he had done a huge bad thing, quickly bent down and took down the football that he had kicked until it was flat. He touched it in his hand and said with embarrassment, \"What should I do, Captain? This... I can’t fix it.\"","He was about to cry himself.","Xia Jinyuan took the football and looked at it. There was a huge hole in the top. There was no way to repair it. But where could they get a football now? A shop? Where could they buy a football?"]},{"number":5220,"title":"Chapter 5220: Entering","paragraphs":["He raised his leg and kicked T6’s foot. \"Didn’t you see what shoes you’re wearing? You’re wearing a pair of combat boots, yet you went and kicked a football. Why don’t you twist your head off and kick it like a football?\"","The boy standing in front walked over step by step. In the end, he stood two to three meters away from the armored vehicle and spoke in the language of the Basa tribe. \"Can you give me the football? We only have one football. Don’t snatch it away, okay?\"","Xia Jinyuan, T6, and the rest didn’t understand. White Crane understood. When he translated the boy’s words, the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit felt their hearts ache.","Even though they had been through hundreds of battles and seen countless casualties, when they heard the boy say that, they felt a crack in their hearts.","Xia Jinyuan held the football with both hands and walked to the boy’s side. Behind him was White Crane, who could be a translator. \"I’m very sorry. We spoiled your football. Give me three days. I’ll definitely think of a way to compensate you with a brand new football.\"","White Crane translated for the little boy. He added, \"Don’t be afraid. We’re Chinese peacekeepers. We won’t hurt you!\"","The boy took the football carefully. When he saw the big hole in the football, the sadness on his tanned face made Xia Jinyuan feel guilty. \"We’ll definitely compensate you with a football. Please wait for me here three days later, okay?\"","Perhaps it was because White Crane could speak the language of their tribe, the boy, whose eyes were filled with fear, replied softly, \"No need. Thank you. I can ask my mother to fill this with fabric and sew it up. We can still continue kicking it.\"","If it were in China, it would be fine if the football tore. If it tore, they could just replace it with a new one. There were footballs everywhere.","The supermarket, stationery store, wholesale market... There were footballs for sale everywhere. They weren’t precious things.","However, in the eyes of the boy, the football in his hand was the most precious. Even if it was torn, he would find a way to use it again.","Without giving Xia Jinyuan a chance to speak, he hugged the football and ran away. As he ran, he waved his hand and cheered loudly.","It didn’t matter if the football was torn. As long as the football was returned to them, it was fine.","The scattered children all ran over to hug the boy. The boy who carried the football back was like a returning hero receiving praise from his friends.","T6 pounded his head. \"Q King, I’ll definitely find a brand new football to compensate them.\"","\"Compensate them in three days!\" Xia Jinyuan glanced at T6, who was blaming himself. His voice was slightly cold. \"Let’s settle the Wanhai reporters matter first before looking for a football.\"","\"Yes!\" T6 nodded.","They boarded the armored vehicle and continued forward. They didn’t stop until they reached a place where there was a huge bomb on the street. At the corner of the street, the British peacekeepers and soldiers were on guard with guns. There were no Libyan citizens nearby.","When they saw the Chinese soldiers jumping down from the armored vehicle, a British soldier jogged over.","The person who came to the front of Xia Jinyuan was Major David from England. He was well-equipped. Those who didn’t know better would think that he would be going to the battlefield in the next second. When he saw Xia Jinyuan, he reached out his hand and said enthusiastically, \"Hello, Chinese soldiers. Nice to meet you.\"","\"Hello, Major David. Nice to meet you.\" Xia Jinyuan shook his hand. \"I heard that you already have some news. Can you tell us? After all, the earlier we act, the sooner we can save the missing reporters.\"","The earlier they saved the reporters from Wanhai, the earlier they could find a new soccer ball to compensate the children.","Major David was very happy. \"Of course. I can tell you all the clues we know. We have the same goal. I hope we can work together happily.\"","This time, the English soldiers were very efficient. Major David said to a soldier beside him, \"Please give me a pen and paper first. I need to draw the general situation inside for you.\"","The English soldiers would need to run back if they wanted to get paper and pens. K7 moved and quickly took out a pen and paper from the armored vehicle and handed them to Major David.","\"Oh, thank you. You’re really well-prepared!\" Major David smiled and took the pen and paper. Soon, he drew a building and the map inside.","Xia Jinyuan’s gaze darkened.","Why did this look like a base with a special function?","\"This is a night club. It’s a club specially for the soldiers to play. The six reporters disappeared here. There’s only one entrance and exit to the entire night club. It’s the door you see in front of you. It’s a double-door electronic iron door. Once there’s a serious situation, the night club will immediately inform its personnel to close the door.","\"After entering the door, there’s a 50-meter corridor. There are night club staff guarding both sides. Normally, there’ll be about ten people. After the corridor, there’s a disco. There are all kinds of people there. The thugs and staff of the night club are all there.\"","Major David explained in detail as if... he had been there many times.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at him. Major David looked over too. Then, he smiled and explained, \"You know that we’re under a lot of pressure. Occasionally, we need some entertainment to relax. I think that as men, we should understand.\"","\"I understand.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled and nodded. He understood but didn’t agree.","Major David could tell that there was no sincerity in Xia Jinyuan’s voice. In order to save his image, he had no choice but to explain, \"Of course, we all wear plain clothes when we go there. We won’t be recognized by the ladies there.\"","Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows. \"Yes, I believe that you’ll be able to hide your identities easily. What next? Are there any other clues?\"","\"Yes, of course. There are more important clues.\" Major David felt that no matter how much he explained, the Chinese soldiers wouldn’t be interested. He shrugged and continued, \"This is the disco. After passing through the disco, you’ll be at the bar. There are two doors behind the bar. One leads to the cafeteria, and the other is a secret door. It provides some special services.\"","At this point, Major David raised his head and looked at Xia Jinyuan again. Should he explain what special services were here? This group of Chinese soldiers looked like they had never come to the largest nightclub in the South District to have fun.","Did they never need to solve their physiological needs?","Seeing that he had paused, Xia Jinyuan raised his head. He looked puzzled. \"Why? Is there a problem here?\"","He didn’t need to explain?","\"Oh, no. I just want to tell you that there’s a wall behind the bar counter. We’ve always suspected that there are weapons hidden in the wall.\" Major David, who didn’t want to explain in detail, heaved a sigh of relief. He quickly went back to the main topic. \"That’s because I found three surveillance cameras here. Besides the bartender, there are two people guarding the bar from time to time. Only those who need to provide service can enter the secret door behind the bar. Those who just want to drink and relax are not allowed to enter.\""]},{"number":5221,"title":"Chapter 5221: Recreation","paragraphs":["It had to be said that Major David knew the layout of the nightclub very well. It could be seen that he usually... went there a lot. Only those who frequented it would know it so well.","This was the first time Xia Jinyuan and the other Chinese soldiers heard of the existence of this nightclub.","T6 went to V8’s side and whispered, \"A few days ago, I heard that a certain country’s peacekeeping boss brought his soldiers to have fun. Damn, I thought that a country was deliberately slandering another.","\"Tsk, tsk, tsk. It turns out I’m still too naive. As it turns out, it’s really true.\"","The British soldiers weren’t the only ones who would go out to have fun and solve their personal needs. It was reported internationally that the soldiers of certain countries would go out to have fun. As long as it was a consensual deal, there was no need to take action. The higher-ups would also turn a blind eye to it.","The peacekeeping soldiers in the war zone had to be at their peak when facing these bloody scenes. They needed to relax occasionally. Out of humanity, they wouldn’t pursue the matter.","Unless something happened, such as a forced transaction, then the problem would be serious. They would be condemned internationally. If the situation was serious, they would be brought to military court.","The Chinese soldiers, who always remembered the Three Major Disciplines and Eight Objectives, would be strict with themselves whether they were at home or abroad. They would never discredit their country. Discipline was the most basic professional quality of soldiers.","V8, who was in charge of guarding the surroundings, said calmly, \"You’ve heard too many rumors recently. Be careful not to become a rumor in other people’s mouths one day.\"","T6 was vaguely reminded to keep his mouth shut. He should say less and just observe.","\"I’ve always been the one gossiping about other people. Is it possible for other people to gossip about me?\" T6 raised his chin and was very confident in himself.","He cherished his military uniform very much. He wouldn’t allow himself to make even the slightest mistake, let alone smear his country’s reputation. As for rumors and confidentiality rules, he knew them by heart. He wouldn’t say a word even if he was beaten to death.","Z7, who was in charge of large-scale surveillance, smiled and said, \"When we enter the nightclub later, don’t be attracted by the ladies inside.\"","\"Bullsh*t! I have a wife! I’m very loyal!\" T6 spat back. He firmly believed that he wouldn’t make a mistake.","If he couldn’t even handle such a small matter, how could he still be considered a man?","Z7 smiled slyly. \"The ladies like you. The more you reject them with your expression, the more interested they’ll be. The more they want to challenge you and conquer you. As for you, if you listen to them a little, they probably won’t be interested in you.\"","\"You want me to be seduced? You’re really bad!\" T6 saw through Z7’s evil thoughts. He was really not a good person.","He rolled his eyes at Z7 in contempt. \"You’re a playboy who has already had 17 or 18 girlfriends before. I’m sure you’ll run into problems.\"","\"You’re wrong. I’ve already experienced everything. I’ve long realized that I have no desires in the mortal world. No matter how enthusiastic a lady is in front of me, I’ll only treat her as a piece of wood.\" Z7 smiled, indicating that he could withstand the test.","T6 still wanted to refute, but White Crane said calmly, \"It’s time to get down to business.\"","They would relax a little before a fierce battle. Now, the few of them were solemn. Their auras changed in an instant and were filled with a coldness.","Major David made the final strokes on the paper. \"I suspect that this is a control room. The power source and the engine room are all here. I think we can discuss how to successfully infiltrate the innermost part of the nightclub to find the reporters.\""]},{"number":5222,"title":"Chapter 5222: Deploy","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan took the floor plan that he had already drawn. Major David’s drawing skills were very high. The entire floor plan was very clear. He had even drawn the possible exit and confirmed the exit.","Major David, who usually went to the night club many times, had proven himself to be useful this time.","After some arrangements, both sides confirmed their positions. Fifteen minutes later, Xia Jinyuan took the floor plan and returned to his comrades to arrange China’s combat plan.","The combat plan was split into Plan A and Plan B.","Plan A was if it was confirmed that the missing reporters were indeed at the nightclub. Plan B if it was confirmed that the missing reporters were not at the nightclub.","\"There are about 12 visible surveillance cameras in the entire night club. There are two hidden cameras at the bar counter. After entering through the hidden door, there will also be cameras. The other party is in charge of destroying the engine room. After confirming that there are no mistakes, two of our team members and two of their team members will enter the secret door first...\"","At this point, Xia Jinyuan paused slightly and reminded the two team members who would enter the secret door, \"After entering the secret door, you might see some couples. So be it. Don’t scare them like bumpkins.\"","Couples... T6 held back his laughter. Xia Jinyuan made it sound so elegant.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at him. His gaze then shifted to Z7 and G3. He continued, \"Z7 and G3 will enter the secret door. V8, keep an eye on the engine room. They’ll send two people into the engine room to destroy all the equipment.\"","One of them was a man who had been through many things at an early age, while the other was a married man who had gotten married at an early age. It was more suitable for them to enter the secret door.","\"White Crane, T6, find a high ground and keep an eye on your surroundings. Once you discover any problems, inform the other party immediately and create a huge commotion. K7 and I will hide in the dark and provide support at any time.","\"Major David’s soldiers will be on standby outside. Once Plan A is carried out and six reporters are rescued, they’ll immediately retreat with the reporters. We’ll cooperate with the soldiers who entered the nightclub to create chaos. Do you understand?\"","\"We understand!\"","The seven of them replied at the same time. They had cooperated with each other and fought together many times. As long as the mission was clear, everything would be clear.","Now, there was another important problem. They needed to change their clothes.","Changing clothes was an easy problem to solve. Every time they went out to patrol, they would bring plain clothes to prevent any special situations from happening. Sometimes, if they wore a combat uniform and a blue helmet, others would know their identity no matter where they stood. They had to disguise themselves well.","For instance, they had to disguise themselves before they entered the nightclub at night.","This was a special nightclub. The people who came and went rarely saw the residents of Libya. Instead, most of them were foreigners, including Asians.","Major David brought a few soldiers into the night club and started playing around. The night club wasn’t big, and there weren’t many people. They sat at a simple wooden table in twos and threes and ordered a few glasses of beer.","It was a rare relaxation in a war-torn zone. It was like a different world from the outside. The flames of war were everywhere outside, and the people were having a hard time. Here, they could order beer. Even if it was an astronomical price, people would be willing to drink it.","There was no debauchery, nor was there any excessive noise that filled every corner with DJ music. There was only a 15 or 16-year-old girl from Libya standing in the middle of the night club and playing the violin that was cracked at the edge.","It could be seen that before the war broke out, this was a young lady from a good family. Her parents had money for her to learn musical instruments."]},{"number":5223,"title":"Chapter 5223: A Different Job","paragraphs":["The 15 or 16-year-old girl was probably mixed-race. Her tanned skin was slightly yellow. She didn’t look like she was from a pure Libyan bloodline. Even her eyes were green, beautiful, and big.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at her and glanced at the dilapidated violin in her hand. She played it well, but the strings were not tuned properly and had lost their sound quality.","A group of women sat cross-legged at the corner of the wall, waiting for guests to choose them. They didn’t dare to take the initiative to welcome them. This was the rule. Whoever broke the rule would disappear the next day and would never be able to return to the nightclub that could allow them to survive.","The bar counter was simple too. It was built with cement, lined by cheap plastic colored lights. Xia Jinyuan walked to the bar counter and looked at the wine cabinet. He ordered two cans of sky-high beer. On the other hand, a few Libyan boys were dancing their ethnic dance. They were enthusiastic, unrestrained, and full of joy.","Applause and whistles sounded. Someone threw the money on the ground. A slightly older boy quickly picked it up and grabbed it tightly. When he picked up a coin, someone raised his leg and stepped on his palm, crushing it forcefully.","It hurt, but the boy who picked up the money raised his head and smiled brightly. He kept thanking the foreign man who deliberately stepped on his hand. It was just a five-dollar coin. But he only earned one dollar a night, so five dollars was very important to him.","When the foreign man saw this, he couldn’t help but laugh. His ugly face was like a worm that had crawled out of a smelly ditch.","A weak country had no dignity. If even the country didn’t have dignity, how much dignity did the citizens of this country have?","No one cared how much pain the boy was experiencing. No one cared if the boy’s self-esteem was trampled on. Such things happened often. If they kept seeing similar scenes, they would get numb.","Xia Jinyuan retracted his gaze and drank a mouthful of beer. He stood up and walked toward the man who was still laughing like a pig.","Major David, who was sitting at the edge of the bar and drinking beer, smiled when he saw this. Were the Chinese soldiers trying to save the boy so that it would be easier for them to make a move?","It was a good idea.","Picking up his glass, which was only half filled with whiskey, David walked toward the girls, who were sitting cross-legged in the corner. He thought that they could make a move now.","On the other hand, Xia Jinyuan’s shoulder bumped into the other party’s body. The beer in his hand spilled. The foreign man, who was grinding the back of the boy’s hand with his shoe, cursed and reached out to grab Xia Jinyuan’s collar.","\"Damn it, look at what you’ve done!\" The moment he opened his mouth, a strong smell of alcohol assaulted Xia Jinyuan’s nose. This was a fellow who had drunk whiskey and was drunk.","His fingers were callused from holding guns. He was alone and could cause trouble at will. He might be a mercenary who came to a war-torn country to get rich.","Xia Jinyuan raised his hand and grabbed the other party’s wrist. He broke his wrist violently. \"You drank. You need to sober up.\" He exerted a little more force, and the other party screamed in pain.","After teaching the drunkard a lesson, Xia Jinyuan let go of his hand and took out a banknote from his pocket. He walked toward the girl who was still playing the violin.","The drunkard, who was in pain, was about to cause trouble when two men appeared from an unknown corner. One blocked the drunkard’s path, while the other grabbed the drunkard’s wrist and forced him to leave with a smile."]},{"number":5224,"title":"Chapter 5224: Action","paragraphs":["Just as Xia Jinyuan was about to approach the girl, the lights suddenly went off. He could clearly hear many gunshots around him. After about five seconds, the lights lit up again and everything returned to normal.","Xia Jinyuan passed the money in his hand to the girl. The girl bowed deeply to him. He smiled and took a sip of beer before returning to the bar counter.","A few seconds after the lights returned, a few unfamiliar faces in the night club seemed to have left. No one cared about it and continued chatting as usual. If they had any urges, they would walk to the corner and pull a girl they liked into the secret door.","\"Q King, the surveillance cameras have been destroyed.\"","\"Alright,\" Xia Jinyuan replied as he passed through the crowd. He saw David walking toward the secret door of the bar with a girl.","Z7 and G3, who were in charge of entering the secret door to look for the missing reporters, had already disappeared. After a few seconds, they had already infiltrated through the secret door.","The girl who was playing the violin had finished her song. She bowed and thanked the people around her again and again. Then, she picked up the money that was thrown at her. The amounts were different, but she was very happy.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at the violin in her hand carefully again. As he drank, a hint of coldness flashed past his eyes.","Inside, Z7 and G3 had already met up with the four English soldiers who had infiltrated before them. Z7 and G3 were in charge of bringing up the rear. The four English soldiers quickly pushed forward until they reached the end.","There was a locked iron door at the end. A British soldier quickly installed a silencer on his pistol, planning to break the lock with bullets.","This was a closed corridor. If they spoke loudly, there would be echoes. If they used bullets to break the lock, even if the gun was equipped with a silencer, it would make a loud sound.","G3 quickly stepped forward to stop him. \"We can use another method.\"","Picking locks wasn’t a problem for G3.","Five minutes later, Major David, who was purely chatting this time, suddenly had a look of joy in his eyes. He sat up from the ’bed’ that was only made of a few wooden planks with bedsheets on it.","They had found the missing reporters!","Xia Jinyuan placed the half-empty beer can back on the bar counter and stood up lazily. He was waiting to act.","White Crane and T6, who chose the highest point, had already touched the pistols they brought in. Perhaps it wouldn’t be long before they had to use these pistols to save their lives.","V8 stared at one of the surveillance cameras. When Z7 and G3 appeared, he destroyed the entire nightclub’s electrical control equipment without hesitation.","Even after two consecutive blackouts, the people who were drinking didn’t find it strange. In this place, it would be strange if there was electricity all night. It was normal for there to be interruptions.","Sometimes, when the electricity was cut, it would last the entire night.","\"A nightclub is equipped with a set of more advanced surveillance cameras. It’s a little abnormal.\" V8 came out of the computer room and lowered his voice. He raised his leg and stepped over a nightclub thug who had been taken care of.","\"There are thugs and surveillance cameras. It looks like this isn’t a simple nightclub. I’ll delete the footage of all the places we entered to avoid leaving any evidence.\"","V8 had considered this very thoroughly. If he deleted all the footage, no one would be able to find any traces.","Xia Jinyuan walked toward a corner in the dark. When the power went out just now, the reaction of the girl who was playing the violin whom he had been staring at was extraordinarily fast.","A few rays of light suddenly lit up from a few corners of the nightclub. The staff lit candles, and the girl standing in the corner played the violin again. The sound of the violin was sharp and rapid, as if she was sending a message."]},{"number":5225,"title":"Chapter 5225: Is Everything Fine?","paragraphs":["The sound of the violin was too sharp. It made people feel uncomfortable. It was as if something was pressing down on their hearts that could cause them to collapse at any moment.","\"Put down the stupid thing in your hand! It’s so unpleasant!\" Someone couldn’t take it anymore and shouted at the girl playing the violin unhappily. He picked up the beer can in his hand and smashed it at the girl.","The sound of the violin was still sharp and hurried. More and more people couldn’t help but frown. Some sharp people felt that something was wrong and looked around uneasily. Some people slowly got off the barstool and winked at their companions, planning to leave early.","The order of the nightclub was a little out of control. Most of them were frustrated by the girl’s violin-playing. The electronic door by the bar counter, which had been closed, opened with a bang. A group of black men rushed out and looked around the nightclub.","Their sudden appearance made the already restless night club even more chaotic. In the corner, someone fired three shots at the ceiling. The atmosphere in the nightclub suddenly became tense.","The beer can in someone’s hand fell to the ground in shock. The unfinished beer flowed out.","However, no one was too afraid. It was normal for there to be guns here. The only abnormal thing was that something seemed to be happening tonight.","The bright candles were extinguished, and countless flashlights lit up, illuminating the entire night club as if it was daytime. The girl playing the violin put down the violin and looked at the nightclub with a gloomy and cold gaze. It didn’t look like the gaze of a girl at all.","A hint of mockery flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s eyes as he looked at the scene calmly. Armed men... These were armed men under the government’s control. The country was in internal strife, and the people were struggling. Yet, there were still officials taking the opportunity to earn money.","A few men who came to have fun took out their guns. When they saw the guys who suddenly rushed out, fear flashed across their eyes. They didn’t know that there was another door behind the bar!","There was another group of people who had already silently placed their hands on their waists. They even exchanged glances with each other.","Xia Jinyuan glanced at them and raised his head. He pressed his ear casually and said in a low voice, \"There should be a commotion tonight. Don’t be in a hurry to act. Major David, are you okay?\"","They found the reporters inside, but they hadn’t come out. There was another wave of armed men outside. No, there were two waves of armed men. From the looks of it, it was safer to stay behind the secret door.","Inside, Major David replied to Xia Jinyuan helplessly, \"If I say that I’m not doing well at all, will you believe me? I feel that the reporters we saved are a problem.\"","The biggest trouble was the Asian-looking female reporter. She was a hot-tempered person. She was clearly in danger, but she still stood up and accused them of being regulars at the nightclub.","Major David felt a headache coming on. Reporters were a very unlovable profession. It was a disaster to meet a reporter who thought that they were the most capable and smart.","Outside, Xia Jinyuan’s instincts told him that the trouble Major David was talking about might be the female reporter from Wanhai. He could only sympathize with him and express his helplessness.","\"The situation outside is a little complicated. If you can evacuate normally, tell them to retreat as soon as possible.\" Xia Jinyuan told Major David about the situation outside. He actually hoped that they could evacuate normally. It was better to leave as soon as possible to prevent any accidents along the way."]},{"number":5226,"title":"Chapter 5226: Cause Trouble","paragraphs":["Major David felt that it was the right choice for them to retreat immediately. However, they needed the guys outside to keep an eye to prevent anyone from rushing into the secret door.","\"Leave the outside to us,\" Xia Jinyuan said seriously. \"You just need to bring them out safely.\"","After rescuing the three reporters from Wanhai, their mission would be completed. The higher-ups could then give Wanhai an answer.","Major David trusted the Chinese soldiers. When they were peacekeeping in the same place before, the Chinese soldiers were famous for their strict rules. In the past, he didn’t have a good impression of the Chinese and Chinese soldiers. He thought that the soldiers nurtured by a poor and backward country had to be severely lacking.","As it turned out, he was thinking too much. The Chinese soldiers were very worthy soldiers!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know how difficult it was to deal with the female reporter from Wanhai. He left this problem to Major David. Major David had already hinted from the start that they would save all the reporters. The Chinese soldiers just needed to help.","Xia Jinyuan knew what the other party was thinking. Fame and fortune was right within their reach. Major David wanted to perform well, so Xia Jinyuan would let him.","The special forces soldiers of the Xueyu unit, who never liked to be in the limelight, were happy with the arrangements.","After cutting off the communication, Xia Jinyuan squeezed together with the men who were really confused. They were purely here to drink and relieve their stress. White Crane and T6 also moved closer to Xia Jinyuan. A few disguised British soldiers stared at the secret door of the bar counter. Once these guys with guns wanted to enter the secret door, they had to take action.","A Libyan man strode in front of the girl holding the violin. He lowered his head and asked a few questions. The girl’s cold eyes swept across the night club. When she answered the questions, the man who was listening to her revealed a serious expression. Occasionally, he would look up and sweep his gaze around. Cold killing intent flashed across his eyes.","\"Damn it! What’s going on?\"","A man who was a little drunk shouted and staggered toward the light that hurt his eyes. \"Damn it, turn off the things in your hands! My eyes are very uncomfortable. It’s very uncomfortable!\"","Xia Jinyuan looked at the muscles on the other party’s arms and then at his gaze. His cold black eyes couldn’t help but narrow slightly.","He was pretending to be drunk...","After taking a few steps, someone held a rifle against the drunk man’s chest. \"Sir, there’s a problem. We need your cooperation. Please stand or sit down obediently.\"","\"What’s wrong? Why do you need my cooperation? This is just a place to drink. Are you here to drink?\" The drunkard seemed to be very drunk. He kept staring at the shoulder of the man with a gun and roared until his saliva came sputtering out.","Not satisfied, he raised his hand and threw the unfinished bottle of whiskey on the cement floor.","The thick whiskey bottle was smashed, and the glass shards flew everywhere. The girls squatting in the corner screamed, causing a small commotion.","\"You’re drunk, sir. You need to sober up.\" The man with the gun pushed the barrel of the gun harder against the ’drunk man’s’ chest. \"If you don’t sit down obediently, maybe my bullet can wake you up.\"","Warnings and threats were used at the same time, but it was useless against the drunkard.","White Crane and T6 approached and stood behind Xia Jinyuan. White Crane said in a low voice, \"The entrance is sealed. Take the stairs to the second floor and retreat from the second floor. But we have to deal with the people guarding the bar first.\""]},{"number":5227,"title":"Chapter 5227: Messy Battle","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who was staring at the surroundings, looked at the spiral iron ladder that led to the second floor near the bar counter. He smiled and said, \"There’s no hurry. Someone wants to go out more than us. Three o’clock and seven o’clock. These two waves of people are more anxious than us.\"","Hearing this, White Crane and T6 looked up slightly. Then, they heard Xia Jinyuan say calmly, \"You’re in charge of dealing with the people on the left. I’m in charge of dealing with the people on the right. The earlier we leave, the earlier we’ll be done.\"","They didn’t know which big shot was protecting the nightclub. However, they shouldn’t complicate the matter too much, or the country would have to step in.","Oh right, there was also a reporter from Wanhai who had some thoughts about the country. Xia Jinyuan kept feeling that there were many conspiracy theories in the country. He had to guard against such people.","He originally came to save those reporters, but the female reporter played the blame game... This was inconceivable.","Previously, Major David said that they would be in charge of saving people. The Chinese just needed to cooperate. Xia Jinyuan, who agreed without hesitation, had already been guarding against the reporters from Wanhai.","The drunkard who caused trouble was probably not afraid of death. He was not afraid even when someone pressed the muzzle of the gun against his heart to warn him. Instead, he grabbed the gun that was pressed against his chest with one hand and shouted in the local ethnic language, \"Come on, bastard. Shoot if you dare!\"","The man with the gun obviously didn’t expect the other party to be so fearless as to snatch the gun from his hand. As for him, he obviously didn’t think of shooting a drunkard to death. He just wanted to scare the other party and the people in the nightclub who wanted to take the opportunity to cause trouble.","It seemed peaceful here, but once something triggered the violent elements in people’s bodies, the entire nightclub would be in chaos.","The drunkard’s fearless behavior caused many people to kick up a fuss. They whistled, shouted, roared, and even slammed the table at the guys who had suddenly rushed out of nowhere with guns.","It seemed that none of them was afraid of death. It seemed that none of them was afraid of bullets shooting at their bodies.","They had seen many guns, so they seemed to have become bolder.","The change happened very quickly. The man with the gun was furious. He pulled the trigger with his finger. As long as he pulled the trigger, the drunkard would be killed by him.","Before the other party could act, the drunkard suddenly pointed the barrel of the gun at the ceiling and pulled the trigger. Bullets fired continuously at the ceiling...","Amidst the gunshots, the shouts got louder. It was as if what they were hearing weren’t gunshots but celebratory fireworks.","The girls squatting in the corner covered their ears tightly. They were so afraid that they didn’t dare to look anymore. The timid girls bit their arms and bit them tightly to prevent themselves from opening their mouths.","The girl who was playing the violin raised her hand and pointed at a group of people. The man who was talking to her looked in the direction of the finger. His expression changed for a moment. There was obvious disgust in his eyes as if he knew these people.","On the other hand, the drunkard holding the gun barrel punched the bridge of the man’s nose.","The group of people pointed at by the girl instantly took out their guns and fired at the people who rushed out of the electronic door...","This time, the commotion turned into screams. The nightclub was in chaos.","Xia Jinyuan saw the girl who was playing the violin open the cover and take out a small pistol. She shot the back of the man’s head.","Bang!","She only fired one shot. It didn’t stand out among the dense gunfire.","The man who was shot in the back of his head was talking to the girl a second ago. The next second, he fell to the ground and was shot dead."]},{"number":5228,"title":"Chapter 5228: Divide","paragraphs":["Why was the sound of the violin off-tune? The reason was simple. There was a pistol stuck to the body of the violin. The pistol affected the sound quality of the violin.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t approach the girl. Here, even a five or six-year-old child could shoot someone. It wasn’t strange for a 14 or 15-year-old girl to shoot someone.","What was a little strange was that... the girl should be from the nightclub. Why would she shoot someone from the nightclub?","Also, did she suddenly play the sharp and unpleasant music just now on purpose to let the guys behind the electronic door reveal themselves so that it would be easier for the other group to deal with them in one go?","A few questions flashed past Xia Jinyuan’s mind. Without stopping, he, White Crane, and T6 rushed toward the spiral iron stairs that led to the second floor.","V8, who had left the computer room with the two British soldiers, heard the gunshots in the nightclub. His expression turned sharp as he stopped in his tracks. He lowered his voice and asked, \"What happened?\"","The operation didn’t mention shooting in the nightclub, only retreating!","\"Someone is causing trouble. We’ll take the opportunity to leave.\" Xia Jinyuan, who was bending over to avoid being accidentally injured by the bullets, replied. \"Go out and inform the headquarters immediately. There might be internal divisions in the government.\"","The nightclub was run by an official. It shouldn’t be a secret in the government. If not, they wouldn’t be able to survive in the flames of war and provide good wine and women for others to enjoy.","Now, someone came to cause trouble. Perhaps the girl had deliberately lured people out to cause trouble by playing that chaotic tune. Obviously, the person who was targeting the nightclub knew the layout of the nightclub very well and had bribed the girl to tip them off in advance if she discovered anything wrong with the nightclub. That was why there was such a ’large sweep’ tonight.","The government was not peaceful. Xia Jinyuan had always known about what the girl had done just now. The man who was killed by the girl before had a weird expression on his face when he saw the group of people who fired the gun, as if he knew the people who came. Putting all these details together, Xia Jinyuan’s first thought was whether the division within the Libyan government was beginning to intensify.","If that was the case, it would be another huge mess.","The gunshots at the night scene were chaotic. The light from the flashlights had already been extinguished. Xia Jinyuan, who was rushing toward the staircase, aimed at his target and quickly killed him.","\"Done,\" White Crane said in a low voice. He and T6 brought up the rear. Xia Jinyuan held the railing of the stairs with one hand and quickly rushed up.","Footsteps sounded from above. There were around five to six people. The expressions of the three shifted slightly. At the same time, they approached the railing and quickly got down.","They didn’t want to fight head-on. They just needed to retreat quietly.","At that moment, Major David’s voice was heard. One could tell that his tense voice had become exceptionally relaxed. \"My brothers, you need to come out quickly. We’ve already left the nightclub. We’re just waiting for you to come out.\"","Outside, the female reporter who was rescued scolded in English, \"I clearly heard gunshots inside. Why didn’t you go and take a look? You came to maintain peace. Why are you turning a blind eye now?\"","Major David cut off the communication and looked at the female reporter who had just survived. This was a lady. As a gentleman, he shouldn’t argue with a lady, even if it was a stupid lady.","\"Madam, we can’t rush over every time we hear gunshots. We need to know why there are gunshots and who the two parties are before we can act. Madam, I think you’re tired. It’s not safe here. It’s better to leave with my soldiers as soon as possible.\"","Major David, who was maintaining his gentlemanly demeanor, tried his best to maintain a polite smile on his face."]},{"number":5229,"title":"Chapter 5229: Something Wrong","paragraphs":["Major David, who was trying his best to maintain a smile on his face, was unhappy. However, he was a gentleman, especially in front of women. He couldn’t lose his gentlemanly demeanor. No matter how unhappy he was, Major David maintained a polite smile and politely invited the Asian lady into the car.","\"Alright, Madam, it’s time for you to get in the car. You’ve been missing for too long. Your colleagues and your country are very worried about you. Leave the maintenance of peace to us soldiers. I’ll leave the reporting on the true cruelty of war to you. You and I will each return to our posts, okay?\"","He tried his best to persuade her patiently, but this female reporter with the surname ’Chen’ from Wanhai didn’t seem to appreciate it.","She wasn’t bad-looking. Her figure was sexy too. She wasn’t too tall or short. She was around 1.65 meters tall. However, she jutted her chin, which displayed a sharp arrogance.","\"From your accent, I know which country you’re from. That’s right, I came to Libya to report the true cruelty of war. Similarly, I can reveal the true faces of you people and let everyone see that you only know how to enjoy life here!","\"The gunshots have already sounded. As a reporter, I’ll never retreat because of this. I’ll do my best to report the situation on every battlefield here! I’ll let the world know that the people who will be hurt the most by the flames of war will always be the citizens of the country.","\"As for you, you can choose to leave! I don’t have the right to let you stay. However, I’ll definitely report everything I see truthfully, including your departure!\"","These words were indeed sharp, even containing a threat. Major David’s expression turned ugly.","Why should he be a gentleman to a woman like this? He really wanted to beat her up now!","\"Madam, please get in the car immediately!\" Major David didn’t maintain his manners anymore. He realized that he couldn’t maintain his manners with this reporter at all. She treated his manners as cowardice!","Reporter Chen was furious. \"Are you forcing me? Do you want to restrict my personal freedom? I’m gonna sue you! I protest!\"","No one paid attention to Reporter Chen’s protest. Gunshots were ringing in their ears. The right choice was to get rid of her quickly.","\"Major, we should hand this trouble to the two Chinese soldiers who came out with us!\" a British soldier said unhappily. He heard everything clearly and was very angry.","The two people who came out together with them... were Chinese soldiers?","Chinese soldiers?","Reporter Chen, who was expressing her anger with her body language, stopped in her tracks. As if she had caught a piece of big news, a bright light flashed past her eyes. She asked the British soldier who was expressing his dissatisfaction, \"Chinese soldiers? Do you mean that Chinese soldiers appeared at this nightclub too?\"","Where were the Chinese soldiers? Where were they? Why didn’t she see them?","The Chinese soldiers appeared at the nightclub?","This was a big piece of news! She had a feeling that as long as she reported the news of the Chinese soldiers going to the nightclub, it would definitely cause the biggest storm!","Reporter Chen looked around. She wanted to find the two Chinese soldiers who came out together.","Not far away, G3 and Z7, who had rescued the reporters together, pretended as though they didn’t see the reporter who was shouting like a madwoman.","There was still no movement from K7. They didn’t know how he was doing.","Major David didn’t want to talk to this stupid reporter anymore. He waved his hand and instructed coldly, \"Take her away. If she doesn’t cooperate, drag her into the car.\""]},{"number":5230,"title":"Chapter 5230: Help","paragraphs":["Major David was really restrained by this reporter who thought that she was very good.","\"Yes, Major!\" The soldier agreed and dragged Reporter Chen into the car.","Reporter Chen wasn’t willing to leave. How could she let go of such big news? Furious, she tried to start a fight. \"Let go of your hand. I’m a reporter. I have the right to report here! Let go of me. I’m warning you, don’t catch me again. I’ll sue you for molestation and illegal imprisonment.\"","No one paid attention to the reporter who had lost her mind. Major David rubbed his head that was hurting from the noise and contacted the Chinese soldiers who had yet to appear. \"This is David. Please answer if you hear me.\"","\"The situation is bad. I saved a little boy along the way,\" Xia Jinyuan replied to David. He quickly picked up a rifle and fired. The armed men who rushed out of the corridor on the second floor fell one by one.","White Crane and T6 brought up the rear. The shooting quickly ended, killing a total of six people.","\"Alright, little fellow, you can bring me to the room where your parents are locked up now.\" Xia Jinyuan pulled out the little boy who was curled up in the door frame. He was a Chinese boy who could speak Mandarin well. His family ran a business that provided drinks for the nightclub. Today, he came to deliver the last batch of drinks for the nightclub. According to their agreement, the person behind the nightclub would arrange for people to send the family of three out of Libya.","Unfortunately, the person behind the nightclub detained the family of three.","The reason why they were detained was simple. If the three of them left Libya, there would be no more drinks at the nightclub. How could a nightclub without alcohol be considered a nightclub? How would they earn money?","The little boy was locked up alone and was very happy to be saved by Xia Jinyuan, who had been preparing to leave. The little boy was very smart. When he saw the person who barged in to kill the person guarding him, he immediately asked for help.","They were on a mission, and they were almost done with their retreat, but a sudden variable appeared. This was dangerous for all the combatants, but the special forces of the Xueyu unit chose to stay.","When the little boy realized that they were only taking him away, he cried loudly in Mandarin.","Now, a new problem arose. Should they go save his parents?","Did they have a choice?","No, they didn’t!","They could only choose to save them!","Fortunately, it was chaotic enough below. Otherwise, there was no way to save the boy’s parents.","After taking down the militants who were reinforcing them, the three of them used their bullets to blow up the locked iron door. A place like this mostly used iron doors because they were sturdy.","The bullet left a few dents in the iron door. Sparks flew everywhere as the iron lock was broken. The rusty iron door was then kicked open by T6.","After kicking it open, T6 quickly dodged to the side and shone the flashlight into the dark room. There was no one there. There was only a huge and tightly sealed cabinet against the wall.","T6 quickly infiltrated the room and took a photo before retreating. He said in English to the comrades who were guarding the back, \"There’s no one.\"","The little boy remembered that he was separated from his parents in this room. He was sandwiched in Xia Jinyuan’s arms and cried as he shouted, \"Dad, Mom.\"","There was the sound of something colliding in the room and the faint sound of someone struggling. The little boy’s cries stopped abruptly, and he suddenly burst into tears. \"Dad, Mom!\"","There was someone in the cabinet. From the outside, no one could see who was inside."]},{"number":5231,"title":"Chapter 5231: Chinese","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan and T6 carefully approached the wooden cabinet. White Crane aimed his gun at both sides of the corridor and was in charge of guarding. V8’s voice came from the hidden earpieces. \"This is V8. I’ve successfully escaped from the vent.\"","Xia Jinyuan slowly opened the cabinet door.","One second, two seconds, three seconds...","When the cabinet door was completely open, Xia Jinyuan and T6 saw a man and a woman with their hands and feet tied. Their eyes were covered, and their mouths were gagged. They were curled up together.","The two of them could feel that the locked cabinet door had opened. They screamed and struggled even harder.","\"Dad, Mom!\" The little boy saw it too and shouted in surprise. The couple, who had long heard their son crying, instantly wet the cloth covering their eyes. The two of them, who were tied up, were so excited that they fell out of the cabinet.","Seeing this, Xia Jinyuan knew that he had found them.","The Chinese immigrants were the parents of the little boy.","T6 took out a small and sharp dagger. He held the gun and faced Xia Jinyuan, who was half-squatting at the door. He said in English, \"Don’t move. I’ll untie you now.\"","\"Mmm...\" The couple, who fell sideways, landed in unison. Their tears of joy did not stop. They even felt their son’s soft hands touching their faces as he kept calling, \"Dad, Mom...\"","T6 used a small dagger to quickly cut off the rope that tied the couple’s feet. Then, he untied their hands. The couple quickly pulled off the blindfold that tied their eyes and took out the cloth that covered their mouths. The mother hugged her son tightly and cried loudly. The husband hugged his wife and son and cried loudly as well.","They had overcome death and were overjoyed. After experiencing the greatest ups and downs of their lives, even the husband was crying.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t give the couple too much time to cry. Out of professionalism, he verified the couple’s identities and confirmed that they were the little boy’s biological parents. He spoke faster and said in a low voice, \"We’re not out of danger yet. If you want to live, you have to listen to my arrangements. Also, you need to protect your children. My friends and I might not have the time to take care of you.","\"Do you know how to use a gun? Even if you don’t, you need to know how to use it now. Use the gun in your hand to protect your son.\"","Without giving the couple any time to thank them, they quickly retreated with the family of three.","The six of them retreated smoothly. K7 finally made a move. His cold and indifferent voice sounded. \"The nightclub is Amherst’s. The ones who came to cause trouble are the soldiers under Ives. Everyone knows that the two of them have clashing political opinions.\"","K7, who had not left, started to leave too. It was faster for him to leave alone, so Xia Jinyuan asked him to meet up on the second floor.","Just now, when K7 went up to the second floor from the spiral iron ladder, the chaotic nightclub suddenly exploded with a bang. Someone threw a grenade, and the entire nightclub was engulfed in flames and smoke. Countless screams came from all directions, mixed with gunshots. The scene was chaotic. It was like hell on earth.","The huge impact made K7, who was on the second floor, instinctively jump forward.","His comrades’ anxious shouts came from the hidden earpieces. \"K7, K7, answer immediately if you hear me! Answer immediately if you hear me.\" It was their captain, Q King."]},{"number":5232,"title":"Chapter 5232: In Danger","paragraphs":["K7, who was lying on the ground, stood up calmly. He didn’t forget to pat the dust off his body. \"I’m not dead. I’m alive.\"","\"F*ck!\" T6, who was so shocked that he even broke out in a cold sweat, cursed in a low voice. He quickly said, \"Don’t f*cking pretend to be cool. Hurry up and come over! Second floor, take the third turn on the left...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, T6, who was staring out of the window, cursed even louder. He contacted G3 and Z7 outside. \"What’s going on outside? A group of people came!\"","From his direction, even though it was pitch-black outside, he could see a group of people rushing over from the dilapidated street under the faint night light.","G3 and Z7, who were guarding the other entrance, jumped out of the darkness. Z7 said in a low voice, \"Direction!\"","\"East! Damn it! These people are carrying artillery! Retreat!\" T6 shouted. They were going to flatten the only intact four-story building!","K7, who had yet to meet up with his comrades, ran frantically. His handsome face, which was so cold that there was no expression at all, was still expressionless. \"Retreat. I’ll be there soon.\"","\"Stop talking nonsense. Hurry up! I’ll wait for you!\" White Crane cursed. They were brothers who went through life and death together. No matter what, he would never abandon his brother.","The brothers in the Xueyu unit would never abandon each other!","Xia Jinyuan pulled down the curtain and said to the trembling man, \"You’re a man. Your wife and child have to depend on you to protect them. Don’t end up losing your wife and child because of your fear.\"","This time, Xia Jinyuan spoke Chinese. This could be considered as emboldening the Chinese immigrants.","The couple was stunned for a moment. They... They didn’t know that the people who saved them were Chinese. The wife hugged her son tightly and said in a trembling voice, \"Thank you, thank you... Thank you so much.\"","In terms of nationality, they were no longer Chinese. They had new identities. These Chinese men could choose not to save their family of three.","However, these Chinese soldiers saved them and even let their family of three leave early.","These were Chinese soldiers. They had to be Chinese soldiers!","Only Chinese soldiers would always leave their hope for survival to the civilians in danger and take on the danger themselves.","\"You... You’re Chinese soldiers from the peacekeeping forces. You must be...\" The man’s legs trembled, and he didn’t dare to move. He grabbed Xia Jinyuan’s arm tightly. His voice was so excited that the words were about to fly out.","Xia Jinyuan smiled and said, \"Now is not the time to chat. Hurry up and go down. If you delay any longer, you’ll really die.\"","The man felt that he was not afraid anymore. He took a deep breath and said, \"Okay! I’ll go down now! We’ll leave alive!\"","The Chinese soldiers had given their lives to the family of three. He had to hurry!","The man climbed out of the curtain in one go. Then, he grabbed the curtain that was tied up with several other curtains and started moving down. Actually, he didn’t need to do much else. He just needed to hold the curtain tightly to prevent himself from falling.","Finally, the man went down. He didn’t dare to shout loudly. When he heard the footsteps, he was so nervous that his heart was about to fly out. He quickly caught his son, then his wife, and then a rifle.","\"Hurry up and hide. Hurry!\" The man protected his wife and child with his arms. He bent down and found a place where the family of three could hide.","Outside, G3, who was running like a wolf at night, found a high point. Through his binoculars, he saw the crowd rushing over from the east. \"Anti-government militants, Z7, guard the entrance!\""]},{"number":5233,"title":"Chapter 5233: Headache","paragraphs":["Z7, who was guarding the entrance, stared intently in front of him. When he saw the people through his night-vision binoculars, he gritted his teeth until his cheeks were as hard as rocks.","His expression was as cold as water as he said in a low voice, \"Damn it, they’re not anti-government militants. It’s government forces who are rebelling!\"","They communicated in English the entire time. Major David’s heart sank as he drove away. He pressed his earpiece tightly and shouted, \"Comrades, hurry up and retreat! Don’t get involved in the battle between the two parties!\"","Damn it, part of the government troops had rebelled. There was a problem with the government!","Reporter Chen, who was struggling in the car and sweating profusely, immediately received the latest news from the frontline. However, she couldn’t get out of the car or send the latest news back to Wanhai.","No, she had to get out of the car!","She panted heavily, no longer shouting at the top of her lungs. She didn’t have the energy to shout anymore. Her voice was so hoarse that it hurt. It was as if there was a fire burning in her throat. Her voice was already hoarse. If she continued shouting, she might lose her voice.","She stopped struggling. She needed to find an opportunity to get out of the car.","The Chinese soldiers entering and leaving the nightclub and the rebelling of the government forces were all top news. She had to think of a way to spread the news. Also, her camera...","Camera...","Where was her camera?","Where did her camera go?!","\"Stop the car! I lost my camera! I want to find my camera!\" Without a camera, it was useless even if she got the news first-hand. Reporting required authenticity, and the truth was often conveyed through the photos captured by the camera.","She didn’t even have her camera with her. Even if she knew the news, it was useless. Without evidence, no one would believe her.","As a reporter, she knew the importance of evidence and photos.","Reporter Chen, who was hitting the bulletproof armored vehicle with both hands, was as angry as a crazy lioness. When her hands hurt, she started kicking the inside of the car. \"I want to get out of the car. Stop, stop! You don’t have the right to restrict my personal freedom. You’re breaking the law!\"","It was impossible for the car to stop. Major David even urged the soldier to speed up and contacted the soldiers in the vehicle in the middle to tell them to speed up and enter the safe zone.","Among the six reporters who were rescued, besides Reporter Chen from Wanhai, the other five were sitting in the middle car. The car in front was the vehicle that broke out of the encirclement. If anything happened, it would immediately cover the safety of the car in the middle. The car at the back was responsible for bringing up the rear and evacuating everyone safely.","Major David was in the car behind with the reporter who was giving him trouble.","The other party’s argument didn’t affect his decision. As a peacekeeping soldier, he didn’t have the right to participate in the battle between the two parties. He had to leave as soon as possible.","As for the soldiers from China, he prayed that they would be able to return safely.","The first car had just turned into an intersection when a huge explosion sounded in front of them. Flames soared into the sky, and rocks and scrap metal flew everywhere. Countless fragments splattered like rain along with the flames, adding another scar to this city that had been ravaged by war.","Major David, who was still praying for the Chinese soldiers, heard the explosion. Through the windshield, he saw a huge fire engulfing the surroundings.","In the car, Reporter Chen, who was struggling crazily, screamed in fear, \"Quick, quick... Get down, get down!\"","She screamed involuntarily and grabbed Major David’s arm tightly. Her eyes were filled with fire, reflecting her fear."]},{"number":5234,"title":"Chapter 5234: Rebels","paragraphs":["There was a bomb in front. It even blew up the car in front. There were rebels in front!","As a reporter, she had to react quickly. She had to be sensitive to the news, the development of facts, the value of the news, and the ability to escape when she was in danger.","Reporter Chen was very outstanding in this area. She wasn’t a famous reporter in Wanhai, but she did have some talent. Coupled with the fact that she knew how to create publicity, she became one of the more well-known reporters in Wanhai.","The explosion frightened Reporter Chen. She immediately realized that there had to be rebels in front. If they drove over, they would explode like the car in front.","Major David’s patience with her completely disappeared at this moment. However, he controlled himself and didn’t push her away. He was a soldier. He wouldn’t do anything stupid.","The flames burned with a dark brown color. The light shone on Major David’s face. He was a handsome and gentlemanly soldier from the United Kingdom. He had the sharpness of a soldier and the elegance of a gentleman. The combination made him very charming.","However, Major David was no longer as elegant as before. He raised his hand and pressed the hidden earpiece in his ear. Fear appeared in his deep light brown eyes as he shouted, \"Alan, are you alright? Are you alright?\"","\"Retreat, retreat, there’s an ambush! There’s an ambush! Retreat!\" The voice of the soldier in front came from the earpiece. The wheels of the car rolled over the uneven street, and they retreated at their fastest speed.","The armored vehicle in front looked clumsy, but at this moment, it was fast and agile as it fell back from the corner. God! They almost lost their lives just now!","Major David heard the voice of his comrade in the car in front. His heart, which was about to jump out of his chest, fell back to its original place. His heart was beating fast. He took a deep breath and sniffed the smell of gunpowder that floated into the car. He quickly adjusted his panicked mind and said in a low voice, \"Change the retreat route.\"","If they didn’t change their retreat route, all three cars would explode.","Major David didn’t want to see God this soon. He wanted to return to his country alive.","Everyone wanted to return to their country alive.","The voices of the British soldiers reached Xia Jinyuan and the rest. They were in trouble themselves. They didn’t expect Major David to be in trouble as well.","K7 had already rushed out. He placed his hands on the edge of the window and jumped up from the second floor like a soaring crane. He was the last to retreat from the nightclub.","The little boy, who was being protected by his parents, hugged his father tightly. His soft voice was heard. \"Dad, when are we going home?\"","\"Soon, baby. We’ll be able to go home after we leave here.\" His father kissed his young son. Beside him and leaning against him was his wife. He felt his wife’s body trembling in fear. He leaned forward and kissed his wife’s hair. \"Don’t be afraid. We’ll definitely go home safely. Don’t be afraid.\"","With the Chinese soldiers around, they would definitely return home safely.","Gunshots sounded continuously. The wife, who had brought her son to this war-torn country in a fit of anger, blamed herself deeply.","It was all her fault. If it weren’t for her willfulness, their family of three wouldn’t have been in danger at all. It was all her fault."]},{"number":5235,"title":"Chapter 5235: Together","paragraphs":["The life-threatening gunshots had no intention of stopping. The wife, who was hugging her husband’s arm, lowered her head and bit her lower lip, letting out suppressed cries.","\"Mom, don’t be afraid. These uncles will help us go home. We’ll see Grandma and Grandpa soon.\" The little boy heard his mother’s sobbing and thought that she was afraid. He comforted her like a little adult, making the couple cry.","K7 had come down. Everyone could retreat.","\"Go, go, go!\" G3, who was watching his surroundings and covering the retreat, said in a low voice. The few of them started gathering in one direction from a scattered inverted triangle, including Z7, who was watching the entrance closely.","Xia Jinyuan, White Crane, T6, V8, K7, and the family of three they saved were together. After G3 and Z7 gathered, they quickly approached Xia Jinyuan.","The father hugged his son tightly. Amidst the sound of bullets, he kept kissing the child’s forehead and comforting him in a low voice, \"Don’t be afraid, baby. Don’t make a sound. Hold me tightly. We’ll protect you. Don’t be afraid.\"","As Chinese citizens, they had never encountered war before they immigrated. They even felt that war was far away from them.","After coming to Libya, they started a business that was the most profitable but also the most dangerous. They would die at any time while providing drinks for Libya’s nightclubs.","Wealth came from danger. As for the husband, he never expected that he would almost lose his wife and child.","The mother, who retreated after hearing the gunshots, was shocked. She grabbed her husband’s clothes tightly the entire time and touched the child’s hand and face from time to time.","She never thought that she would almost lose her life when she came to Libya with her child in a fit of rage.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t know the story of the family. The most important thing now was to leave. They couldn’t leave easily and were surrounded.","He and G3 took turns moving forward. From the dark street, they used the ruins as cover to leave the night scene that had become the center of the firefight.","\"Find a place to take a breather first before thinking of a way to sneak out.\" Xia Jinyuan, whose back was pressed against the wall, turned around and looked at the man who was protecting his wife and child. He needed to send the three of them out.","Outside, the rebellious government forces had already exchanged fire. They were lucky enough to escape from the nightclub, but they didn’t manage to escape the bullets of the rebellious government forces. Screams kept coming.","They passed through the chaotic crowd—crawling, squatting, and running until they finally came out of the nightclub alive. However, they didn’t expect that what awaited them outside was still death. There was no way to escape and nowhere to hide.","The rebellious government forces had obviously made preparations in advance to catch the government off guard. They surged out from many places in the city and started a large-scale war.","The location of the nightclub was just the signal for them to start a war.","Flames soared into the sky above the city. The various peacekeeping forces had entered Class A vigilance. The Chinese and British peacekeeping forces were still anxiously waiting for their comrades who had gone out to rescue the reporters to return.","Major David and the rest had already abandoned their cars. They no longer considered escaping in cars. The huge cars would become the main target of the rebel government forces.","They destroyed the vehicles’ oil lines and control systems. The expensive armored vehicles became scrap metal that couldn’t be driven anymore to prevent them from falling into the hands of the rebel government.","They were not far away from Xia Jinyuan, but it was difficult to gather them. Xia Jinyuan had the family of three while Major David had the six reporters, which included one uncooperative reporter. She was the only woman present."]},{"number":5236,"title":"Chapter 5236: A Bunch Of Tough Guys","paragraphs":["Major David pulled out his gun and pressed the muzzle of his gun against Reporter Chen’s forehead. \"Madam, you’re making me very angry now. It’s easy to kill a reporter on the battlefield. Are you afraid?","\"Right now, are you afraid?\"","Why wouldn’t she be afraid? This was the first time someone pointed a gun at her head. Reporter Chen was so afraid that her face turned pale. She was even more afraid than the day she was dragged into a room and locked up!","After all, she had seen the world. She calmed herself down and pretended to be calm. \"Please remember your identity. Don’t stain your blue helmet with blood. Don’t insult the word ’peacekeeping’!\"","\"Yes, you’re right. I have to remember my identity at all times. Otherwise, do you think you’d still be alive?\"","Major David retracted his pistol. He had lost all his patience with this woman.","They had already replenished their equipment in the car. There were grenades, rifles, and bullets. With these weapons on them, they felt more confident.","It was a little troublesome with the Chinese soldiers. They didn’t have any equipment. The two Chinese soldiers who retreated with them just now only asked for night-vision binoculars. They didn’t ask for anything else.","Putting away his pistol, Major David contacted Xia Jinyuan. \"Buddy, we need to gather and evacuate together. There are too many rebels.\"","When the cold muzzle moved away from Reporter Chen’s eyebrows, her face turned pale. She panted heavily. She was furious.","She was a reporter, a reporter who was in charge of reporting the battle in real time. She came to Libya to represent Wanhai, but she was threatened with a gun. If she didn’t shut up, she would be killed!","This was a personal insult to her and a disrespect to Wanhai!","She would definitely report everything that happened just now and punish the guy who held a gun to her head. She would definitely do it.","Xia Jinyuan could hear Major David’s angry voice, but he didn’t reply immediately. They squatted behind the cover and listened to the footsteps close to them. Everyone held their breaths, including the sensible little boy. He didn’t know what was happening, but he knew that the sounds he was hearing now were all gunshots. The people running around outside might be bad people.","He hugged his father’s neck tightly. He snuggled his small face into the crook of his shoulders, making him feel safe. His eyes were wide open, revealing fear that shouldn’t belong to someone his age.","The footsteps were messy as they quickly passed by the ruins. Xia Jinyuan, who was hiding in a building that had been destroyed by gunfire, looked around coldly and replied to Major David, \"Let’s meet up first and try our best to avoid the crossfire between the two factions.\"","This was also Major David’s intention. He didn’t want to get involved in the firefight between the government forces and the rebels at all.","Major David heaved a sigh of relief when he knew that the Chinese soldiers had the same thoughts as him.","Why was he relieved?","During the retreat, the Chinese soldiers saved a family of three and brought them to their side. He was really worried that the Chinese soldiers would be kind and sacrifice their lives.","Now that his worries were gone, Major David felt that they would have a good time cooperating with the Chinese soldiers. Of course, it would be a good time for a group of tough men to cooperate.","\"Very well! We’ll come and look for you now. Before we arrive, you need to hide well. Also, watch the child and don’t let him make a sound.\""]},{"number":5237,"title":"Chapter 5237: Escape","paragraphs":["The child was a time bomb. If he screamed from fear, it would cause a big mess!","Major David teased, \"You need to keep an eye on the small problem on your end. I have a huge problem on my end that’s giving me a headache.\"","Reporter Chen, the troublemaker, was beside him and heard everything clearly. Anger flashed across her eyes as she glared at the fellow who despised her. She had already prepared a script for the press release. With a little more polish, it would be complete.","Xia Jinyuan knew who the ’huge problem’ he was talking about was.","He really didn’t know what that reporter from Wanhai did to make Major David despise her so much. He even lost the gentlemanly demeanor he always maintained in the company.","The gunshots outside were endless. The sky above the entire city was filled with the sound of artillery fire. In one night, the city was engulfed by artillery fire. In one night, countless innocent people lost their lives.","As for their home, their home had long been lost. It was riddled with holes and could not return to its former peace.","The country of Libya had never been peaceful.","Explosions kept ringing in the sky above the city. The entire city had lost its order. The devastated people of Libya rushed out of their temporary shelter at night. The children who had lost their parents cried in fear. The adults who were running bumped into them and passed by them. No one stopped because of the cries of the children. Everyone was running for their lives.","They all fled to the camps of the various peacekeeping forces. That would be their refuge. As long as they entered the camps of the peacekeeping forces, the government forces would not fire their shells by mistake. The anti-government militants would not rush in recklessly. They would only have a chance of survival if they entered the camps of the peacekeeping forces.","\"Did you contact them? Did you contact them?\"","In the command center of the Chinese peacekeeping forces, a person-in-charge spoke loudly. The seven peacekeeping soldiers they sent to rescue the three missing reporters from Wanhai had yet to return. They lost contact half an hour ago, and then they learned that the rebels were fighting right at the nightclub where they were rescuing people. The person in charge broke out in a cold sweat.","They lost contact at the first point of crossfire. The person in charge was very worried that they were in danger or had already met with misfortune.","The head station replied to the person-in-charge. They didn’t receive any news either. The British peacekeeping forces didn’t receive any news either. They had lost contact with all the soldiers sent by the Chinese and British sides!","\"A large number of refugees are rushing to the peacekeeping camp. Please support us! Please support us!\"","\"Release them! Release them!\"","\"The latest report is that the highest-ranking person-in-charge of the military in Libya has defected. The rebels are trying to control the government of Libya...\"","In the country, Ye Jian sat in front of the television and watched the latest report of Libya. Although Reporter Chen from Wanhai did not publish the article immediately, the country’s war correspondents had already sent back the latest reports and the current situation of the battle in Libya.","Ye Jian retracted her gaze and stared at the television. She had experienced such a situation before. She had shuttled through the artillery fire and accepted the baptism of the flames of war. In the end, she had blood all over her body.","It was already early in the morning in China. Ye Jian, who came back from training, turned on the television at the last minute and glanced at the monitor. She didn’t look away again.","The live report didn’t last long. After it ended, Ye Jian turned off the television and walked around the military unit alone. She only returned to the dormitory when her body was a little cold from the cold wind.","She had seen the figures of the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers. She also saw a large number of refugees entering the camp. She saw the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers maintaining order and organizing the refugees to enter the camp to take refuge."]},{"number":5238,"title":"Chapter 5238: Panicking","paragraphs":["Due to the eight-hour time difference between the two countries, it was already five in the morning when they saw the latest news in the country. Those who paid attention to the military news turned on the television and saw the latest news from Xinhua News Agency.","The camera swept past the faces of the refugees who had entered the camp. One could clearly see the joy on their faces. It was a stark contrast to the fear on the faces of the refugees who had yet to enter the camp.","The video was a little blurry. There was a crossfire less than ten kilometers away from the peacekeeping force camp. When the camera flashed past, one could even see flames burning the city.","Gunshots, artillery fire, running figures, the crying people of Libya... The country on the TV screen was in deep trouble. Even through the TV screen, one could feel the despair of destruction.","The more emotional ones were already wiping their tears with red eyes. The more rational ones shook their heads and let out a long sigh.","The mountains and rivers were shattered, the country was destroyed, and people were dead.","Very few people noticed a line of small words scrolling past the bottom of the screen. Ye Jian didn’t notice it at first, but when she went through the captions for the second time, she accidentally noticed it.","\"According to the latest news, the three missing reporters from Wanhai have been successfully rescued by our country’s peacekeeping soldiers. Due to the rebellion of the government’s higher-ups, we have temporarily lost contact with the three reporters from Wanhai and the peacekeeping soldiers.\"","Ye Jian’s heart tightened when she read that.","She was a soldier who had been to war-torn countries and knew what losing contact meant. The flames of war prevented the soldiers from returning to the camp. They also cut off the communication between the soldiers and the camp.","It was 9:00 pm in Libya, when the battle was at its most intense. Ye Jian, who had ended her night training, was no longer sleepy. She was worried about missing any updates on the peacekeeping soldiers.","Her heartbeat was a little abnormal. She was panicking and in a mess. There was also a sense of suffocation that made her breathing especially rapid. This feeling was very, very bad. It came again after a few years!","The first time it happened, Grandpa Gen passed away.","The second time it happened, Uncle Chen passed away.","The third time it happened, Captain Xia was in danger.","The fourth time... This was the fourth time!","Also, when she saw the inconspicuous captions, she suddenly felt suffocated. Captain Xia... Captain Xia... Ye Jian, who was panicking, muttered her lover’s name. As she clenched her fists secretly, a cold look appeared in her black and bright eyes.","The missing peacekeeping soldiers... most likely included Captain Xia. The rest of the people were probably the special forces of the Xueyu unit.","The Xueyu unit soldiers often faced life-or-death missions to rescue hostages.","Reporters from Wanhai had a special identity. Since China had agreed to send soldiers, they wouldn’t send ordinary peacekeeping soldiers. They would only send special forces soldiers with high success rates. The special forces of the Xueyu unit would be the country’s first choice.","Realizing that the soldiers who lost contact might be the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit, Ye Jian didn’t look too good.","When the deputy squad leader returned to the dormitory, she immediately noticed that Ye Jian didn’t look good. She thought that Ye Jian’s body was showing a strange reaction after parachuting. She hurriedly asked, \"Are you feeling unwell? You look bad.\"","Hearing this, Ye Jian raised her hand and touched her face. Did she look bad?","\"Thank you for your concern, deputy. I saw a piece of news just now and saw that our country’s peacekeeping soldiers have temporarily lost contact. I was a little flustered.\"","Afraid that the deputy squad leader would think too much, Ye Jian replied truthfully, \"The most high-ranking official has rebelled, and the entire city is at war. I’m a little worried that the missing peacekeeping soldiers will be in danger.\"","Although it was taking place in another country, this concerned the peacekeeping soldiers of their country. The female soldiers in the dormitory felt heavy-hearted."]},{"number":5239,"title":"Chapter 5239: Hold On","paragraphs":["The deputy squad leader patted Ye Jian’s shoulder lightly. She could tell that Ye Jian was really worried about the missing peacekeeping soldiers. \"It’s okay, it’s okay. Those who become peacekeeping soldiers are all soldiers with strong comprehensive abilities. From the moment it’s confirmed that they’d go for peacekeeping, they’d undergo special training for a few months. Trust me, they’ll be fine. They’ll come back safely.\"","Peacekeeping was not an easy thing to do. They had to go from a peaceful country to a war-torn country that was constantly facing bullets and artillery fire. Before they went, all the soldiers were prepared to sacrifice at any time. Some soldiers even left their wills in advance to the military unit. If they returned safely, their wills were destroyed. If they didn’t return, their wills would be handed to their families.","For high-risk special forces soldiers like Xia Jinyuan, they had to write countless wills every year. The content was different every time.","This time, he also wrote a will when he went to Libya.","Ye Jian knew that the deputy squad leader was comforting her. She smiled slightly. \"Yes, they’ll all come back safely. Their families and comrades are all waiting for them to come back.\"","However, the smart Lu Hui noticed that something was wrong. She put down her military boots and asked Ye Jian carefully, \"Are there any comrades from your old unit among the troops sent out?\"","The deputy squad leader, who didn’t think about this, was stunned for a moment. Seeing that Ye Jian’s expression had turned a little darker, the deputy squad leader’s heart dropped. Did Lu Hui hit the nail on the head?","After Lu Hui finished speaking, she kept staring at Ye Jian. At this moment, she naturally saw the dark expression on Ye Jian’s face and scolded herself in her heart. She squatted down and brushed her shoes. She then threw her brush and military boots away before standing up. She hugged Ye Jian. \"It’s okay, it’s okay. Those who can go for peacekeeping are all good soldiers in the company. Losing contact is nothing. They’ll definitely return to the team safely. Don’t think too much.\"","Ever since she learned how powerful Ye Jian was, Lu Hui became Ye Jian’s number one follower in the female soldier class. Sometimes, the squad leader couldn’t help but scold her, but Lu Hui never got angry. She still looked proud.","Now, when she saw that she had hit the nail on the head, she panicked even more. \"Pull yourself together, Lieutenant Ye. You’re an invincible person. We have to pass the psychological test. We can’t get depressed because of uncertainties.\"","Ye Jian’s heavy heart froze, and the panic in her heart eased a little. She raised her hand and hugged Lu Hui, who was comforting her, back. Smiling, she said, \"It’s okay. I can handle it.\"","She continued, \"You’re a good scout. You were able to tell at a glance. You actually guessed that my old comrades were among the troops sent out.\"","\"It’s possible that they weren’t. Don’t think too much.\" Lu Hui placed her chin on Ye Jian’s shoulder and hung on Ye Jian like a koala. \"Did you take energy drinks? Why are you so energetic? We were so tired that we couldn’t open our eyes for the entire night, but you still went to watch television.\"","Last night, they gathered at 7:00 pm and entered the mountains to parachute. The terrain was dangerous, and the river was turbulent. Everyone was tense as they descended. Even Captain Lei reminded all the airborne soldiers to be careful from time to time. The distance between the two parachutes had to be wide. They saw Captain Lei sweating from nervousness. Only Lieutenant Ye was fine.","She was the only one who could watch television after coming back.","She also happened to see news of her old comrades losing contact in the war zone. Her mood was sure to drop."]},{"number":5240,"title":"Chapter 5240: Go Away, I’ll Wait","paragraphs":["At this moment, Ye Jian regretted not controlling her emotions. She had made them worry. Sometimes, she found it hard to control her emotions when it came to Captain Xia’s matters.","Rubbing her face, she looked up and gave the female soldiers a bright smile. \"It’s okay, it’s okay. I’ll be fine after resting for a while. Rest early. We’ll gather for exercise in an hour and a half.\"","Due to the all-night skydiving, the original time of gathering and exercising at 5:30 am was delayed to 6:30 am. The soldiers were given one and a half hours more to rest and adjust. They were to gather and exercise at 6:30 am sharp and could not take leave.","The female soldiers who were training closely with the male soldiers weren’t as relaxed as they were half a year ago. After joining the Special Reconnaissance Team, they went from ordinary airborne soldiers to special airborne soldiers. The difficulty of their training increased.","The training during the day wouldn’t be delayed because of the all-night skydiving. This time, they could delay the gathering for one and a half hours. This was already a huge concession from Captain Lei.","Ye Jian didn’t want to affect everyone’s rest because of her. She chased them to the bed. \"Sleep. Sleep. We’ll gather in an hour and a half.\"","In the future, she had to learn to control her emotions. Now, all the female soldiers, including the squad leader and deputy squad leader, centered around her. Her words and actions would directly affect the female soldiers’ words and actions. She had to be careful.","This was the only time she lost control of her emotions.","As she spoke, Ye Jian, who had already restrained her emotions, sent the female soldiers to their beds. Then, she climbed onto the upper berth and lay down. Fang Xin, who was sleeping on the lower berth, suddenly whispered, \"Lieutenant Ye, have you ever thought about going to do peacekeeping?\"","Ever since Ye Jian mentioned ’peacekeeping soldiers’, Fang Xin didn’t feel sleepy anymore. She lay on the bed and rolled over twice. She mustered her courage and asked Ye Jian the question.","Fang Xin was a reserved and shy female soldier. She kept a low profile and was steady in everything she did. Captain Lei liked her personality.","Ye Jian liked it too.","Hearing her whisper, Ye Jian leaned out of the upper berth and looked down at Fang Xin, who was not sleepy. \"Why? Do you have any thoughts about going for peacekeeping?\"","\"Yes, I want to, but I don’t think I’ll be able to due to our military unit’s nature. Most of the peacekeeping soldiers sent out are from the army,\" Fang Xin said softly. She didn’t want everyone to know. \"I thought about it when I was still in my old military unit, but I know that the chance is very small.\"","It was so small that it was almost zero.","The probability of sending an airborne military unit for peacekeeping was very small. It was so small that it was negligible.","\"It’s more dangerous to go out for peacekeeping than what we see on television. There are all kinds of variables and dangers that we don’t know about. The peacekeeping soldiers put their lives on the line every day. They might die at any time.","\"Peacekeeping isn’t as simple as you think. The danger is deeper than you think. When you’re outside the peacekeeping camp, artillery fire will fall at any time.\"","Ye Jian said in a low voice to Fang Xin and the female soldiers who weren’t sleeping, \"Peacekeeping is a bridge of peace built with blood and bones. As long as the war doesn’t end, the bridge will never be destroyed.\"","This was spirit and love forged with life.","All kinds of things that had happened in the past flashed past her mind. Ye Jian closed her eyes to hide the emotions in them. ’Captain Xia, please come back safely. Please remember our agreement.","’If you go far away, I will wait for you.’","Fang Xin remained silent for a long time. After a while, her lips moved and closed again. She didn’t ask anymore. She closed her eyes as if she had fallen asleep."]},{"number":5241,"title":"Chapter 5241: War And Death","paragraphs":["Actually, she really wanted to ask Ye Jian, who had a deep understanding of ’peacekeeping’, if she had participated in peacekeeping.","She wanted to ask, but she didn’t dare to. It was better to bury the question in her heart.","Lieutenant Ye had many secrets. Everyone knew this, so she shouldn’t ask.","The female soldiers didn’t say anything else. They blinked and closed their eyes. After a while, they fell asleep.","Ye Jian raised her hand and placed it on her chest. Her heart was beating furiously. It was uncomfortable. With every breath she took, she felt pain.","Her eyes were red. She placed one hand on her chest and the other on her forehead. Covering her eyes, she hid the panic on her face.","’It’s okay, it’s okay. Don’t panic. It’s Captain Xia we’re talking about! He definitely won’t let anything happen to him.’","Ye Jian closed her eyes and kept comforting herself. But the moment she thought about how the missing peacekeeping soldiers might be Captain Xia and the comrades of the Xueyu unit, she wasn’t able to fall asleep.","Would the Chinese peacekeeping forces be in danger if the rebels tried to take over the entire country?","The rebels and anti-government militants didn’t want peacekeeping soldiers to appear in the country they wanted to occupy because it would make them worry.","From tonight’s battle, the rebels’ firepower was extremely fierce. It was also possible for them to fire at the peacekeeping forces of the various countries.","It was hard to say for sure. If a cannonball was ’accidentally thrown’, a few sacrificial lambs and scapegoats had to be pushed out to accept international condemnation. In the end, the matter would be left unsettled.","In a war, it was normal for accidents to happen!","In a war, it was normal for a few peacekeeping soldiers to die!","Ye Jian didn’t fall asleep until the whistle blew. When the whistle sounded, she was the first to sit up and wash up as quickly as possible.","The only way to stop her thoughts from wandering was to devote herself to training and do the right thing.","It was 6:30 am in the morning in the country and 10:30 pm in Libya. Xia Jinyuan and Major David met up. It was only a distance of three kilometers, but they used a total of three and a half hours to successfully meet up. It could be seen how dangerous it was outside.","\"You need to replenish your ammunition first. Here, take this! Take it, Chinese guys. We might have a life-or-death battle tonight.\"","Bulletproof vests, rifles, grenades, and magazines... Major David handed them to Xia Jinyuan generously. Why were they so slow? Everyone had more equipment on them, so they were naturally slower.","Xia Jinyuan took the equipment and raised his fist to meet Major David’s. \"It’s a pleasure working with you, Major.\"","With the equipment, it added another layer of security to their successful retreat.","Reporter Chen, who had been protected by the British soldiers, stared at the few black shadows that had gathered. She stared intently as if she wanted to tear apart the darkness of the night so that she could see who the soldiers behind were.","After checking the equipment, Xia Jinyuan equipped them all on his body. He touched the grenade on his waist. The heavy and round touch gave him a sense of security.","As professional soldiers, weapons and equipment were their lives. Without weapons and equipment, no matter how powerful a soldier was, they would be worried.","Now that they had weapons and equipment, the coldness in Xia Jinyuan’s eyes dissipated a lot. This time, he really felt that the British soldiers were giving him timely help."]},{"number":5242,"title":"Chapter 5242: Trap","paragraphs":["The exchange of fire from the back was still going on. From the sound of bullets, they knew that one side had set up an anti-aircraft machine gun. The bullets of the anti-aircraft machine gun were thicker than fingers. If you were unlucky and got hit by one, a bloody hole as big as a bowl would be left wherever it hit, and you would be crippled even if you could be saved.","No one dared to face the anti-aircraft machine guns head-on, including Xia Jinyuan.","Xia Jinyuan spread out the map of the city and turned on the miniature flashlight. The extremely thin beam shone on the map. Reporter Chen saw the other party’s slender hands, which were as long as a pianist’s, slowly brushing past. Even his actions were like playing the piano.","\"Major, we’re here now. This is the location of the nightclub. It’s also the most concentrated location. From here to here, we’re surrounded by the rebels. There are dozens of us. We’re too big a target. It’ll be difficult to break out.\"","He spoke fluent English. His voice was deep, sounding extremely refreshing and containing the power to pierce through rocks.","From his side profile, Reporter Chen could tell that the other party was a very young soldier from China.","The Chinese soldiers appeared in the nightclub... Reporter Chen, who had her gaze locked on them, moved closer to her colleagues. \"The one speaking is a Chinese soldier. The Chinese soldiers appeared in the nightclub. Think of a way to capture their faces clearly and send them back to the Wanhai.\"","Reporter Chen had the highest status among the three reporters from Wanhai. The other two male reporters were called reporters, but one was actually in charge of carrying equipment while the other was in charge of photography.","The male colleague in charge of photography was good at drawing. He was especially good at drawing portraits. He could capture more than 80% of the other party’s appearance with an ordinary pencil.","The male colleague instantly understood the deeper meaning behind Reporter Chen’s words. He nodded and replied softly, \"I roughly counted just now. There should be six to seven of them. I just need to draw three to four. If the Chinese soldiers went to the nightclub, it’ll definitely cause a huge storm and damage their image when they return to their country.\"","\"Yes, let’s grab the opportunity. I’ll cooperate appropriately,\" Reporter Chen said softly. Her voice was filled with suppressed excitement. She had been keeping an eye on the Chinese soldiers for more than half a month but hadn’t found any evidence to damage their image. This time, the evidence was directly in her hands. How could she miss it?","Another male colleague who was in charge of carrying equipment said regretfully, \"If we still had our cameras, it would be more convincing. They always said that the Chinese military unit is strict with their soldiers. Now, it looks like it’s nothing much.\"","\"Ha, do you really believe what they say? They’re lagging behind everywhere. If they don’t flatter themselves, who will care about them?\" Reporter Chen sneered and stared at the Chinese soldiers with contempt. \"They’re just pretending. Only their own people think that their soldiers are good and powerful.","\"Keep an eye on them and remember every word they say.\" The sounds of fluent English from the corner in front hadn’t stopped. There were some technical terms that even she didn’t understand. Reporter Chen sneered contemptuously. \"I didn’t expect this Chinese soldier to speak English. It looks like he underwent a lot of training.\"","Looking around, Reporter Chen tried to look for the other figures. After looking around, she didn’t see anything. She retracted her gaze and continued to stare at Xia Jinyuan, who was talking to the British soldiers. \"The other Chinese soldiers haven’t appeared. It looks like he’s the only one who speaks English. We shouldn’t expect a country that doesn’t even have a strong education to be formidable.\"","\"That makes sense,\" her male colleagues agreed."]},{"number":5243,"title":"Chapter 5243: Low Quality","paragraphs":["The three Wanhai reporters muttered among themselves. After discussing it, Xia Jinyuan and Major David decided on the best retreat route.","Xia Jinyuan, who had been looking down at the map, suddenly raised his head. His sharp gaze swept toward a spot in the darkness. His black eyes were cold. Reporter Chen was so shocked that she seemed to have suffered a substantial impact and leaned back in a sorry state.","\"Shuzhen, be careful!\" the male colleagues beside her exclaimed when he saw that. He quickly reached out to support Reporter Chen, who fell backward.","Reporter Chen’s real name was Chen Shuzhen.","Her male colleague’s voice was a little loud, especially in the dark and quiet surroundings. The soldiers hiding in the dark glanced at them coldly. Their faces were tense.","These people were reporters, so why were they stupid?","They were retreating now, but they still dared to court death.","F*ck!","T6 cursed softly. He swallowed his saliva when he heard the other party’s sudden voice. He tightened his grip on his rifle and stared fiercely at his surroundings.","The rescued British reporters quickly made a prayer gesture with their hands in front of their chests.","They were also so frightened by the sudden sound that they broke out in a cold sweat.","This was the first time Chen Shuzhen was so frightened by someone’s gaze that she almost fell. Hence, she felt very embarrassed. She also felt that the Chinese soldier who suddenly looked at her was deliberately embarrassing her.","\"What a horrible man!\" She stabilized herself and reprimanded in a low and angry voice. She looked indignant, but if one listened carefully, one could hear that she was covering her weakness.","Her voice was very weak, but she forced herself to maintain the arrogance she thought she had. In response, Xia Jinyuan smiled coldly.","\"Do you see that? That’s a huge problem. She gives me a headache, but I can’t leave her behind.\" Major David rubbed his temples and said with a headache, \"I don’t allow her to get out of the car, and she calls it illegal detention. Gosh, doesn’t she know that it is dangerous outside and she needs protection?\"","Xia Jinyuan said calmly, \"Maybe she thinks that she has the ability to leave alive. Next time, if she wants to leave, we don’t have to stop her.\"","\"Buddy, are you serious?\"","\"Of course. I’m very serious. I never joke.\" Xia Jinyuan kept the city map and replied to Major David politely with a smile. \"After all, we need to respect her choices. Everyone has their own choices. We can’t restrain anyone, right?\"","Major David raised his eyebrows very high. \"Yes, you’re right. I should respect the choices of those reporters.\"","Major David, who had already seen how troublesome Reporter Chen was, wanted to toss her aside even more than Xia Jinyuan. Unfortunately, they all knew that Xia Jinyuan was just saying it. How could they really leave her behind?","No matter how big the trouble was, they had to continue bearing it until everyone was safely brought out.","A British soldier stood up and squatted in front of Chen Shuzhen. With a straight face, he said coldly, \"All of us are in danger now. If you’re going to continue to be stupid, please leave immediately!\"","He wasn’t as patient as Major David. If there were rebels nearby, they only needed a bomb to blow everyone up.","Reporter Chen, who was frightened, was intimidated again. Realizing it had been intimidated, there was anger in her eyes. \"Your attitude toward reporters is very bad. It’s a serious violation of the professional ethics of a peacekeeping soldier. You don’t know how to respect others. You should be ashamed!\""]},{"number":5244,"title":"Chapter 5244: Ingrate Soul","paragraphs":["At this moment, Chen Shuzhen’s mood was extremely bad. She was not respected and was even humiliated and threatened. This was the first time Chen Shuzhen had experienced this.","The difference in treatment was so great that she was especially angry.","\"Remember, lady, the person you’re saying should be ashamed is the person who risked his life to save you!\" the British soldier said in a low voice. He wanted to punch this woman who didn’t know how to be grateful at all.","However, Reporter Chen didn’t feel that these people had saved her. It would have been better if this soldier hadn’t mentioned it. Now that he did, she was even angrier. She leaned forward slightly and gritted her teeth. \"It’s your arrogance that caused all my investigation to be in vain! You should go ask the reporters from your country why we appeared at the nightclub! Bastards!\"","Why did she appear at the nightclub?","The three British reporters who were locked up at the nightclub gave the best answer. It also allowed Xia Jinyuan and Major David to understand why the rebels suddenly took action with the nightclub as the center.","Amherst, the high-ranking official behind the nightclub, was there tonight too. He secretly met two ethnic leaders. When the leader of the rebellion, Ives, received the news, he didn’t do anything until today. He suddenly rebelled and tried to blow Amherst up at the nightclub, causing the government to lose another high-ranking official.","Amherst was able to become a high-ranking official of the government because he was the leader of a large race in Libya. Once Amherst was blown up, the people would definitely hate the government and make the situation in Libya even more turbulent.","Chen Shuzhen and the other two entered the nightclub because they unintentionally recognized Amherst.","At that time, Chen Shuzhen only wanted to follow them and release a press release that exposed the corruption of high-ranking officials in the government. She didn’t expect Amherst’s bodyguards to discover her and detain her.","The British reporters were simply unlucky. They didn’t know anything, but they were caught because they drank a glass of beer with Chen Shuzhen and the other two.","Amherst didn’t plan to do anything to these reporters. He was just worried that before they formed an alliance, the news would be leaked by these reporters and the anti-government militants would know in advance and take action.","They planned to lock them up for the time being and release them after the alliance was formed. It would only be for three to five days.","On the other hand, Wanhai was shocked. Chen Shuzhen was an influential reporter. At the same time, she was the daughter of a high-ranking official in Wanhai. If something happened to her, they wouldn’t be able to answer to the high-ranking official. That was why they asked for help.","Chen Shuzhen, who was saved, hadn’t cooperated from the start. She didn’t think that she was saved by the soldiers at the risk of their lives. The main reason was that the big news she wanted to secretly track had become completely worthless after she was saved.","If she knew, the reporters from other countries would know as well. If she continued reporting on it, she would just be picking up other people’s work. She wouldn’t be able to show her ability anymore.","Hence, Chen Shuzhen was very angry.","After hearing this, Xia Jinyuan, who had always been rough, cursed in his heart, ’F*ck, so that’s what happened!’ He didn’t believe that Wanhai didn’t know where Chen Shuzhen went! They just didn’t say it on purpose!","Xia Jinyuan stepped on the ground with his toes and said coldly in English, \"If you think that we’re delaying you, you have two choices. First, you can leave and return to the nightclub to report the latest battle situation. Second, follow us and get out alive.\"","Chen Shuzhen still has some concerns about the British soldiers. She was concerned about the country behind the British soldiers. Although her words were offensive, she still had a sense of propriety in her heart."]},{"number":5245,"title":"Chapter 5245: Barbarian","paragraphs":["Facing the Chinese soldiers, Chen Shuzhen didn’t hold back. She looked down on the country behind the Chinese soldiers and had never taken them seriously.","\"You’re threatening me, huh? Ha, follow you out alive? I don’t dare to. You don’t even have the basic qualities of a soldier. Are you worthy of being soldiers?\"","She was very rude and even insulting.","T6 and the rest were gritting their teeth. Could they teach her a lesson?! They really wanted to do it!","Xia Jinyuan said to Major David, \"After you leave, please be a witness and remember everything she said to me.\"","Major David, who was also a soldier, was furious. He nodded with a cold face. \"Okay, Brother! I’ll remember every word she says!\"","\"You’re weak and useless. Don’t drag the soldiers from the big countries into this. You’ll only make me look down on you even more.\" Chen Shuzhen wasn’t afraid that every word she said today would spread. It would be better if it spread as it would let everyone know how much she looked down on the Chinese soldiers.","She looked down on the Chinese soldiers, but so what?! If they had the guts, they could scold her and hit her.","As long as they dared to do anything to her or say anything harsh to her, she would make them regret it for the rest of their lives.","How could these low-IQ barbarians dream of fighting with her?","T6 narrowed his eyes and said coldly to V8, \"Provocation? It looks like Reporter Chen is really using all kinds of methods to get dirt on us.","\"Unfortunately, she’s destined to lose to our captain.\"","\"There’s no need to say so much,\" V8 replied calmly. His gaze was cold as he looked at the dark street. His voice soft as he added, \"She’ll regret everything she said today.\"","Based on their understanding of Q King, Reporter Chen would definitely be unlucky.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t fall for it. He glanced at Reporter Chen, who was trying to provoke him, with contempt. He laughed softly. \"Your IQ makes me anxious.\"","\"Watch your mouth!\" The male colleague in charge of camera tracking stepped forward and pushed Xia Jinyuan. He shouted, \"Damn it, apologize!\"","However, before he could reach out his hand, he was grabbed by the British soldier who was staring at him.","The male reporter who had his wrist twisted was in so much pain that his expression changed drastically. Before he could scream in pain, something cold was suddenly pressed against his mouth. It was the butt of a rifle. The soldier warned, \"You have no right to speak here! If you open your mouth again, all your teeth will fall off!\"","The male reporter’s face turned red. He wanted to say something, but his male colleague pulled him back secretly and reminded him in the local language, \"Don’t fight with the British soldiers. They’re not Reporter Chen’s target.\"","This sentence stabilized the male reporter.","Seeing that the Chinese soldiers weren’t falling for it, Chen Shuzhen’s expression turned even uglier. She took a deep breath and suppressed the unwillingness in her heart.","There was no hurry. There was still time. As long as she followed these Chinese soldiers tonight, she would definitely find dirt on their image.","The look of sarcasm on Xia Jinyuan’s face deepened. This was a reporter? Ha.","Chen Shuzhen’s expression turned even darker. She could see the contempt in his sneer.","A group of barbaric and low-quality fellows actually dared to look down on her. How infuriating!"]},{"number":5246,"title":"Chapter 5246: We Will Try Our Best","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan couldn’t be bothered with Reporter Chen anymore. He turned his head and asked Major David, \"We’ll leave in five minutes. How about that?\"","\"Okay, no problem.\" Major David made an ’OK’ gesture. In the end, when he heard the three reporters panting angrily, Major David was very curious about what this Chinese man said to anger the three of them.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t answer his question. He just smiled and replied, \"I was just reminding them to pay attention to their identities.\"","Five minutes had passed, but the gunshots outside were still endless. Xia Jinyuan walked toward the family of three who had been cooperating in the corner. When he approached, he could hear the boy’s even breathing.","The little boy had fallen asleep while listening to gunfire.","Xia Jinyuan squatted down and raised his hand. He touched the little boy’s head and stroked it gently. \"It’s good that he’s asleep. Follow behind us later. Don’t be afraid. We’ll bring you to the peacekeeping camp. When we return to the country, we’ll try our best to help you. However, your nationality has changed. We can only try our best.\"","\"Thank you. Thank you so much.\" The couple thanked him again with tears in their eyes. They placed all their hope of getting out alive on the Chinese soldiers who were protecting them. Even though their nationality had changed, subconsciously, they still believed in the Chinese soldiers without a doubt.","Even at this moment, they regretted changing their nationality.","The wife held her husband’s arm tightly. Her eyes were red and swollen.","The night in Libya was still young. The sky above the city that was shrouded by death was filled with smoke. Countless Libyans could not sleep at night and waited for dawn in fear.","Actually, to them, it didn’t make a difference whether it was dark or dawn.","The city at dawn was also very dangerous. It was also enveloped by the flames of war. In that case, what difference did it make if it was dark or bright?","The citizens of a peaceful country would never know how much the citizens of a war-torn country yearned for peace. They yearned for peace and freedom; they looked forward to a miracle.","Several dark shadows crossed the street that was under artillery fire, moving forward at the fastest speed and entering the next shelter.","In front, the British soldiers cleared the path. Every few steps, they would squat down so that the people behind them could follow closely. In the middle, the three British soldiers were responsible for covering the six reporters as they advanced. T6 and V8 covered the family of three as they advanced. Xia Jinyuan, G3, and the rest followed closely behind.","There were many people, which made them a large target. Every move was filled with danger. The flames of gunfire lit up the street, illuminating the figures running past it.","\"Quick, quick! Follow! Follow!\"","In front, the squatting British soldier spoke in a low voice. The footsteps behind him were hurried as they passed through quickly. In the end, they squatted tightly under the broken wall that was filled with the smell of gunpowder. The soldiers stretched their feet and adjusted for a short time.","Chen Shuzhen looked at the artillery fire in front of her. Her eyes flickered with fear. She felt that it was a pity that her camera was taken and she couldn’t take photos at such a close distance.","Just as she popped her head out, the British soldier, who was focused on her, pressed it down.","He didn’t want to die. He didn’t want to die because of this stupid reporter!","Chen Shuzhen, whose head was pressed against the broken wall, was about to explode from anger. \"Let me go! Don’t make me angry!\"","The hand that was pressing on her head left. The British soldier even wiped his hand on his pants in disdain. He found it dirty!","Fortunately, Chen Shuzhen didn’t see the soldier’s secret action. If not, she would be so angry that her soul might just leave her body."]},{"number":5247,"title":"Chapter 5247: Tense","paragraphs":["\"Go!\"","The British soldiers in front set off again. They had passed through the most dangerous place. The rebels were at the center of the nightclub. The surroundings were at least three kilometers wide. Amherst had appeared at the nightclub. As Ives hadn’t received any news of Amherst’s death, he needed to be wary of Amherst leaving alive.","The footsteps of the rebels could be heard. The government forces were already fighting with the rebels. Both sides were fighting fiercely. The exchange of bullets and grenades never stopped. The little boy woke up. Just as he muttered ’Daddy’, his mouth was covered.","He couldn’t speak.","The mother was so nervous that she hugged her husband’s arm tightly. She was so afraid that her legs were trembling violently. She didn’t even have the strength to stand up.","Everyone was tense. Once the rebels discovered them, they wouldn’t give them a chance to speak. They wouldn’t verify their identities either. They would just sweep them with anti-aircraft machine guns to prevent any future trouble.","\"Surround this place! Hurry! Surround this place!\"","Before she could catch her breath, the footsteps that ran past her ears stopped not far ahead. Someone was shouting loudly.","Xia Jinyuan closed his eyes and swallowed his saliva.","The place they were surrounding was the street they passed through just now. If they were a step late, everyone would have been blocked. They would have been caught like turtles in a jar. Everyone would have died.","Sweat flowed down his forehead and cheeks. Then, it dripped down from his chin. Time seemed to pass exceptionally slowly at this moment. It was so slow that it seemed like centuries had passed.","The three British reporters panted heavily and clenched their fists tightly. As reporters, they were clearly very afraid, but they didn’t want to let go of such a close combat situation. Their eyes were wide open, but they couldn’t see the outside. They could only prick up their ears and listen carefully to the movements outside.","They didn’t have cameras, but with such a close encounter with the rebels, they could write a memo and report everything they had experienced.","Chen Shuzhen and the other two were the same. They were so frightened that their hands and feet were trembling, but their ears were pricked up as they listened carefully to the commotion outside. Their thoughts were the same as the British reporters.","About ten minutes later, the British soldiers confirmed that they could leave. They bent their backs and moved slowly.","They had to move slowly. If they walked quickly and they kicked some rocks, it would alert the rebels who were only a wall away from them.","The sleeping little boy placed his head on his father’s shoulder. The child was actually very sensitive. Although he didn’t understand much, he knew that this wasn’t the time for him to speak. He hugged his father’s neck tightly and laid there motionlessly. He was very obedient.","At least the little boy had parents to rely on. In this country, many children around his age had lost their parents and lived alone. What awaited them might be death.","No one spoke as they followed closely behind. Xia Jinyuan, who was bringing up the rear, hunched his back. In the darkness, his cold black eyes, which seemed to contain a sword gleam, stared behind him, signaling his comrades who were a few steps behind him to follow.","They advanced one after the other to ensure safety in the rear.","They were so careful, but something unexpected still happened. Chen Shuzhen turned her head and looked at the rebels who were getting farther and farther away from her. She was distracted and landed a little heavily. She kicked something with her shoe, which made a very clear clang. It wasn’t loud, but the surroundings were so quiet. No matter how soft it was, the sound was still obvious."]},{"number":5248,"title":"Chapter 5248: I’m A Soldier","paragraphs":["There was a dead silence in the air. Then, the rebels at the back shouted in the local language. They were just testing the waters and didn’t rush over immediately. However, Chen Shuzhen was so frightened that she screamed because her heart was too tense.","\"Damn it! Hurry! Hide! Hide!\"","This time, she had poked a hornet’s nest.","The woman’s voice was sharp to begin with. With her voice, the soldiers at the back didn’t need to probe further. Countless bullets were loaded, and in a few seconds, gunshots were heard.","Chen Shuzhen was really frightened this time. Her knees were weak as she lay on the ground tightly. Besides screaming, she didn’t know what else to do.","The British soldier pulled her and realized that the woman only knew how to scream. She didn’t know how to hide quickly. Hence, he gave up and rolled into the ruins.","V8 and T6 brought the family of three to a cover at their fastest speed. Fortunately, they were on the side of the street. They were surrounded by ruins, which could temporarily provide cover. If not, they would really be riddled with bullet holes by the rebel soldiers.","Chen Shuzhen, who only knew how to lie still, no longer had the arrogance from before. Under the bullets, all her arrogance disappeared. Despair hit her like a turbulent wave in the sea. The Grim Reaper would take her life at any moment.","\"Save me, save me, hurry up and save me...\" she shouted in despair. She didn’t dare to move and only shouted in despair.","The bullets flew past her body. If she weren’t lying on the ground, she would have been shot by the bullets.","When Xia Jinyuan heard her voice, no matter how unhappy he was with her, he couldn’t let her be alone outside. Everyone was hiding, and she was the only one outside.","\"Suppress the firepower. I’ll drag her over!\" Through the earpiece, Xia Jinyuan communicated in English with his comrades and Major David.","It was just because he was a soldier.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit didn’t stop Xia Jinyuan. Instead, they replied to Q King calmly, \"Yes!\"","They had to save her. They had to protect her life.","Xia Jinyuan’s hand touched the grenade provided by Major David. He pulled it off and held it in his palm. Under the rain of bullets, countless pieces of mud and stone flew everywhere. They were like small sharp blades. When they cut through the exposed skin, they would leave several small wounds.","Xia Jinyuan wiped the side of his cheek, which was scratched by debris. He felt a soothing tingling sensation as his fingers pressed against it. He retracted his rifle, bent down, and spoke in a low voice as he calmly gave out instructions.","\"White Crane, K7, attack. V8, T6, suppress. Z7, G3, cover us! I’ll shout one, two, three... Start.\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Roger!\"","\"Roger!\"","The voices of his comrades came from the earpiece. At this moment, they were Xia Jinyuan’s strongest support. With them around, they would never let their Q King be in danger!","Major David actually didn’t agree with Xia Jinyuan’s actions. He didn’t want to save a reporter who only knew how to question others and didn’t know how to be grateful. If they saved her, she might even wrong them. Major David didn’t have any intention of saving her.","However, the Chinese soldier’s determination made him helpless. \"Buddy, you can give up on her.\" Major David persuaded Xia Jinyuan. \"The firepower is too strong. We can’t guarantee her safety. Just now, my comrade wanted to save her. But she was too stupid and didn’t know how to cooperate.","\"I’m telling you that she’ll definitely drag you down and even kill you. Will you still choose to save her?\""]},{"number":5249,"title":"Chapter 5249: Childlike","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who was making the last adjustment, knew that Major David had his best interests at heart. He smiled slightly. \"Major, thank you for your advice, but I have to save her. I have the responsibility to protect any Chinese citizen.\"","Even if the person outside who urgently needed to be rescued didn’t recognize herself as a Chinese citizen...","Major David was silent. After a few seconds, he replied, \"Okay, I respect your choice. We’ll cooperate with your rescue! I hope you can come back alive.\"","\"I’ll come back alive.\" Xia Jinyuan held the grenade tightly, and the smile on his handsome face deepened. His little fox was still waiting for him. How could he break his promise?","\"One, two, three... Suppress!\"","As Xia Jinyuan’s cold voice came from the earpieces, the comrades of the Xueyu unit focused their firepower on the main attack. Major David and the rest split up the firepower of the rebels. The two sides cooperated, and gunshots rained down.","Chen Shuzhen was dumbfounded. She hugged her head and couldn’t even scream anymore. Her entire body was trembling like a dog that had fallen into the water in winter. She no longer had the arrogance she had in the past.","In the ruins, Chen Shuzhen’s two colleagues were already hugging each other in fear. They didn’t even know that Chen Shuzhen wasn’t hiding at all.","A life-or-death situation was the best way to test human nature. For instance, the two male reporters, who usually curried favor with Chen Shuzhen because she was a lady, slipped away faster than anyone when it came to facing death.","If she lost her life, everything would be for nothing.","At this moment, the couple was hugging their son tightly. The family of three squeezed together, warming each other up and leaning on each other. In the dark, the fear in their eyes was something they would never experience again.","\"Daddy, I’m scared.\"","The little boy’s soft voice floated into his father’s ears clearly. His father, who was also afraid, could easily put on a facade in front of his son who needed his protection. He kissed his son’s delicate little face and comforted him very softly, \"Don’t be afraid, don’t be afraid. We’re brave men. Don’t be afraid.","\"Do you know who has been protecting us? They’re the men of the People’s Liberation Army. With them around, we don’t have to be afraid.\"","\"What does the People’s Liberation Army do? Why are they here? Why don’t we have to be afraid?\" Although the little boy was afraid, he didn’t know what life and death meant. His attention was quickly diverted as he asked his father curiously.","\"The soldiers from the People’s Liberation Army can knock down bad people and save us. They’re very powerful. They’re even more powerful than Superman. As long as we have them, we’ll be safe.","\"Weren’t you separated from us previously? In the end, it was the soldiers from the People’s Liberation Army who sent you back to us and even saved us. Qi, don’t you think the People’s Liberation Army is very powerful?\"","The ignorant child didn’t understand much. After his father’s explanation, he still didn’t quite understand. He blinked his innocent eyes and whispered, \"Will we be safe as long as the soldiers don’t leave? Will the soldiers send us home?\"","\"The People’s Liberation Army will send us home. That’s why you don’t have to be afraid. With the soldiers from the People’s Liberation Army and Daddy and Mommy around, you don’t have to be afraid.\"","His father coaxed him patiently. He was so afraid that his hands and feet were trembling, but he tried his best to control his voice. It sounded very calm, making his son feel safe.","He had to coax the child. He was afraid that his son would cry from fear."]},{"number":5250,"title":"Chapter 5250: Difficulties","paragraphs":["Just now, the reporter from Wanhai made a small mistake, and everyone was discovered to be in a predicament by the rebel soldiers. If his child cried in fear... he didn’t even dare to think about the consequences.","The mother raised her hand and hugged her son’s head. She kissed the little boy’s forehead deeply. \"Qi, be good. Sleep for a while more. When you wake up, we’ll be home soon.\"","With his parents accompanying him and the soldiers protecting him, Qi, who was afraid of the gunshots, quietened down. He hugged his father’s neck tightly and closed his eyes.","The little boy’s relaxation made his father heave a sigh of relief. Then, his tense body leaned against the cold and uneven broken wall behind him. The night wind wrapped in gunpowder blew through the gap. He realized that he was sweating because of his son’s words.","He was even prepared to cover his son’s mouth if he cried out.","Fortunately, his son was sensible and didn’t cause a huge commotion.","He hugged his son with one hand and stroked his wife’s thin back with the other. He didn’t forget to kiss the top of his wife’s head. \"Don’t be afraid. We can’t let anything happen to us for Qi’s sake.\"","For the sake of their son, the couple couldn’t collapse. Xia Jinyuan, who rushed out in front, had already disregarded his life and death. He rushed out from the cover and quickly rolled forward. He found the next cover. The bullets passed by his right shoulder, and dense bullet holes formed on his cover.","The flying dust and fragments formed a net that blurred his vision. A few specks of dust entered his eyes. Xia Jinyuan, whose eyes were hurting slightly, took a deep breath and rolled forward fearlessly.","He could only roll forward. There was no way he could run in the rain of bullets.","The well-prepared rebels had powerful firepower. They even mistook the target of the firefight for Amherst, a high-ranking official who had escaped, and asked for support.","The rebel soldiers who were attacking the nightclub with all their might didn’t think that Amherst had escaped. They thought that it might be the government forces who were helping Amherst leave. The rebels on both sides communicated for a short time and simply treated both places as their main targets. They increased their firepower and suppressed the other party completely.","White Crane heard the sound of empty bullets coming from the magazine and quickly retracted his rifle. He crawled back to his cover and changed into a new magazine as quickly as possible.","They could feel the increase in firepower from the other party. Major David’s expression turned even more serious. They should retreat. If they didn’t, everyone would meet God.","\"We need to retreat immediately!\" Major David gritted his teeth and said in a low voice through the earpiece, \"The rebels have strong firepower. We can’t fight with them until the end. China, we have to retreat!\"","Bullets flew past his ears. Major David, who had eaten a mouthful of gunpowder and dust, was pressed down by the increased firepower and couldn’t raise his head.","Damn it! He had to think of a way to retreat!","Even if they wanted to retreat, they had to bring the reporters they saved along. Whether they could get out alive or not required God’s blessing. After shouting, Major David pounced to the side, avoiding the crumbling wall.","Bricks rolled down, and dust flew everywhere. Major David, who was hiding hurriedly, saw the lethal bullets grazing through the air. He pulled a line of fire and fired at the ruins they were hiding in.","Xia Jinyuan, who was suppressed by the rebels’ firepower and couldn’t move, panted. He replied Major David calmly, \"Major, arrange for two or three soldiers to leave with the reporters. We’ll hold them off first.\"","\"Okay!\" Major David agreed. He would take them away while they could still hold on."]},{"number":5251,"title":"Chapter 5251: The Brave","paragraphs":["Major David, who was leaning close to his cover, immediately arranged for the soldiers to leave with him. \"Alan, Lib, bring them away! Remember our retreat route and meet up with the soldiers from the Libyan government. Tell them that we need their support!\"","Damn it, what they needed the most now was support!","\"Yes, Major!\"","The two British soldiers who received the order retracted their rifles that had been firing. Their muzzles were hot. They squatted beside the reporters and told them that they would lead the retreat now.","On the battlefield, the reporters could only listen to the arrangements obediently. The three British reporters naturally trusted their country’s soldiers and nodded without any hesitation to show that they understood.","The family of three also chose to leave together. The two reporters from Wanhai were afraid that they would be left behind. When they knew that they would be leaving first, they heaved a sigh of relief.","At this moment, the two of them realized that Chen Shuzhen, whom they had been currying favor with, was not beside them. They were stunned.","\"Where’s Reporter Chen?\" the reporter in charge of filming asked his colleague.","The colleague was frightened. \"Isn’t she with you?\"","The two of them looked at each other in the dark. Although they couldn’t see each other’s expressions, they knew that the other party’s expression was definitely very bad. It was over! It was over! Reporter Chen wasn’t with them!","\"Go, go, go!\"","Before the two of them could recover from their shock, their shoulders were pushed forward by the British soldiers. Without any time to think, the two of them followed the British soldiers.","Reporter Chen wasn’t with them. Where... Where did Reporter Chen go?","They didn’t dare to think about it because they were thinking of the worst.","They didn’t dare to think or go out to look. Who would dare? Did they want to die?","Since they didn’t dare to think about it and didn’t dare to go out to look for her, they would follow the British soldiers obediently and leave quickly. But... could two soldiers escort the eight of them?","They didn’t dare to ask for more soldiers to escort them. Listening to the gunshots that made their souls scream, the two reporters hugged their heads and left the crossfire point.","The remaining British soldiers used their firepower to cover their comrades as they left with the people who were rescued. Major David, who was panting heavily, fired fiercely at the street. \"Kill the machine gunner! Kill the machine gunner!\"","The anti-aircraft machine guns pressed down on everyone until they couldn’t lean out. If they didn’t kill the machine gunner now, the rebels would close in. They would then have no other choice but to die.","The special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit didn’t say anything. They focused all their attention on the traitors only one street away. The anti-aircraft machine guns’ bullets made them lower their heads too. They could only shoot blindly with their rifles.","Xia Jinyuan panted. \"Think of a way to kill the machine gunner. Damn it, I can’t move forward.\"","The power of the bullets from the machine gun was too great. Even if the bullets only brushed past their skin, they would leave a deep wound, like a burn mark.","Xia Jinyuan couldn’t tell how Chen Shuzhen was doing. If she had continued to lie on the ground, she might still be alive. If she had gotten up, she would be dead by now.","When it was time to make a sound, she didn’t. When it wasn’t, she kept quiet.","K7 retracted his rifle and said calmly, \"I’ll kill the machine gunner. You guys cover the captain.\" His voice was calm as if he wasn’t on the battlefield.","\"Be careful!\"","Z7, who used to be a playboy, was now holding a rifle. His eyes were as fierce as a hungry wolf as he fired at the target in front of him."]},{"number":5252,"title":"Chapter 5252: Smoke","paragraphs":["They couldn’t shoot blindly. There weren’t enough bullets, so they had to save them.","V8 and T6 became the main force suppressing the other party. G3, who was hiding, aimed in front. Almost every shot he made was accurate.","White Crane’s eyes were cold as he asked Xia Jinyuan, who was silent, \"Have you found her?\"","He was outside. If he didn’t make a sound for a while, people would worry that something had happened.","Xia Jinyuan, who couldn’t take half a step forward, wiped his thin lips that were stained with gunpowder. His clear black eyes were deep and cold. \"She shouldn’t be dead. She’s probably still a distance away.\"","Judging from the location of her screams earlier, she should be right under the electric pole that was knocked down by artillery fire. If she was not dead, it was because the electric pole served as a cover.","After blowing up the heads of a few rebels, G3 retracted the rifle that needed to have its magazine replaced. His breathing was rapid as he said calmly, \"K7, kill the machine gunner. We’ll reload, rescue her, and then fight while retreating.\"","If they continued to fight like this, they would run out of bullets. Once they ran out of bullets, they would die.","Major David didn’t understand Chinese at all. His eyes were so red that they seemed to be bleeding. He said helplessly, \"I’m very sorry, my friends. I can’t understand what you’re talking about at all. Can you say something I can understand? Thank you.\"","\"My comrade suggested that we kill the machine gunner first and throw a few grenades their way. After saving her, we’ll fight and retreat at the same time,\" Xia Jinyuan spoke quickly in English. Several bullets suddenly hit the broken wall that was protecting him.","Xia Jinyuan, who reacted quickly, immediately changed from half-squatting to crawling to prevent his head from being shot.","His cover was very small. It was just a piece of wall that had been blown by gunfire. One side was high and the other side was low. It was just enough to hide him. If the bullets took down what was left of the wall, he would be exposed as a live target.","Major David felt that this was a good idea. In that case, he would kill the machine gunner first!","Xia Jinyuan didn’t shoot to prevent himself from being exposed. He lay on the ground tightly and waited for K7 to kill the machine gunner first.","The seven Chinese special forces soldiers and eight British peacekeeping soldiers faced hundreds of rebels together. The exchange of fire lasted for ten minutes, but they didn’t suffer any losses. There were zero casualties.","On the other hand, the rebels suffered heavy casualties. The dozen or so rebels who broke out of the encirclement in front had already seen their god. In addition, there were more than ten injured rebels. For a moment, the remaining rebels were stunned. They didn’t dare to move forward and kept using a machine gun to suppress the other party, afraid that the other party would counter-attack.","K7 used the darkness as a cover as he passed through the rows of ruins and arrived at the corner of the street.","The place where they were exchanging fire was an intersection that formed a ’+’. The middle street was the area where they were exchanging fire. The rebel soldiers were in the upper right corner. The corresponding lower left corner was the peacekeeping soldiers of the two countries. K7, who had reached the intersection of the two armies, was very close to the rebels. He was so close that he could see the heavy machine gun set up by the other party after setting up his rifle and adjusting his aim.","\"I’ve taken aim at the heavy machine gunner.\" K7 aimed at the target and pulled the trigger with a calm expression. \"Cover!\"","As soon as he finished speaking, a gunshot was heard.","The bullet hit the other party in the head. Half of the head of the machine gunner was sliced off by the bullet. Broken bones and brain matter splattered everywhere. They splattered on the face of the sub-machine gunner who was firing bullets beside him, blurring his vision.","He realized something and shouted. As soon as his hands touched the machine gun, he didn’t even have time to shoot a bullet. His body suddenly froze, and his eyes widened. He leaned back."]},{"number":5253,"title":"Chapter 5253: Duty","paragraphs":["Within a few seconds, the machine gunner and sub-machine gunner were shot and killed. No one dared to touch the machine guns anymore.","\"There’s a sniper! Damn it! They have a sniper!\"","The two machine gunners fell one after another. The rebel soldiers thought that they had met a sniper. They didn’t expect that at the corner where they were facing each other, a peacekeeping soldier was retracting his gun and retreating quickly under the cover of his comrades.","Without the heavy machine guns and the other party panicking because they thought that they had encountered a sniper, it was enough for Xia Jinyuan to find Chen Shuzhen’s approximate location. According to the British soldier who covered her retreat, Xia Jinyuan quickly found his target.","When he found her, she was lying under the wires.","Xia Jinyuan slowly crawled forward. He was so close that the other party should be able to hear him. Then, he said in a low voice, \"Are you alright? You can still walk.\"","Chen Shuzhen didn’t answer. Xia Jinyuan’s heart sank slightly. He crawled to her side and pressed his fingers on the aorta of the other party’s neck.","Her pulse was normal, which meant that she was still alive.","Xia Jinyuan called out to her again, but the other party still didn’t answer. Xia Jinyuan slowly pursed his lips and reached out to press Chen Shuzhen’s philtrum.","She had fainted from fright. He needed to wake her up.","Chen Shuzhen’s eyes moved slightly. As the pain got worse, her dizzy mind slowly cleared up. Gunshots rang in her ears. Reporter Chen, who had fainted at some point in time, finally woke up.","She woke up with a start and remembered where she was. Fear swallowed her like a monster. Her voice was completely out of her control. She screamed again.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t give her a chance to scream, however. He quickly covered her mouth with his combat gloves and warned her sternly, \"Shut up if you don’t want to die! Lie down and don’t move!\"","A familiar voice was heard. Chen Shuzhen widened her eyes. Her breathing stagnated for a few seconds before she reacted. Tears flowed down her face as she nodded vigorously.","She wouldn’t scream, and she wouldn’t move.","She only nodded. Xia Jinyuan immediately retracted his hand and pressed it against his earpiece. \"We’ve found her. She’s not dead. Cover and retreat.\"","\"Okay!\" Z7’s happy voice was heard. Damn it, he had been holding his breath for more than ten minutes!","If she wasn’t dead, it meant she was alive.","Major David even whistled. \"Amazing. You’re the fiercest warrior I’ve ever seen.\"","He was the fiercest warrior for saving someone despite it raining machine guns bullets.","If it were him, he wouldn’t have had the courage.","Retreating was also very difficult, but it was much smoother than rescuing her. With the suppression of firepower and the lack of machine guns, Xia Jinyuan let Chen Shuzhen retreat first. \"Remember, when I shout at you to run, get up and run immediately! Remember!\"","Chen Shuzhen, who was so frightened that she couldn’t speak properly, nodded. She was so frightened that her body was still trembling.","At this moment, her inexplicable sense of superiority was gone. She didn’t look down on the Chinese soldiers anymore.","She didn’t wipe her tears. She bit her lower lip tightly and crawled toward the ruins that Xia Jinyuan was pointing at. She didn’t want to die. She wanted to go home alive.","Chen Shuzhen, who always thought that she was bold enough to survive the flames of war alone, had really softened now. She had learned an unforgettable lesson, so she didn’t dare to think that she was bold anymore.","Hearing the faint sound of someone crawling behind him, Xia Jinyuan pulled off the grenade, pulled the safety catch, and threw it at the corner of the street."]},{"number":5254,"title":"Chapter 5254: Delusion","paragraphs":["Boom!","The grenade exploded. Xia Jinyuan turned around and pulled the reporter who was lying on the ground and didn’t dare to move. He shouted, \"Run!\"","Stepping on the flames from the grenade, he ran with the other party. In the end, he grabbed the other party’s shoulder with one hand and rolled on the ground. Finally, they successfully retreated.","\"Go, retreat, retreat!\"","Major David shouted. At the same time, he threw several grenades at a corner of the street. More than ten black shadows ran away quickly.","Behind them, the special forces soldiers from the Xueyu unit successfully suppressed the other party’s firepower and retreated.","The bullets swept past their heels, and countless fragments flew around them. The special forces soldiers hugged their rifles tightly and kicked through the ruins with their long legs. Their figures were as fast as lightning as they passed through the abandoned buildings that were no longer inhabited and had been destroyed. They retreated at a speed that ordinary people couldn’t reach.","Chen Shuzhen ran. She had never run like this before. She clearly didn’t have any strength in her knees. She had fallen countless times, but she still ran. She ran with the British soldiers!","The Chinese soldiers who saved her were no longer protecting her. They pushed her into the hands of the British soldiers.","The consecutive grenade attacks made the rebel soldiers not dare to act rashly. They only dared to shoot with their rifles. In the end, they chased after them.","The command center of the British peacekeeping force received a letter from the government. They said that a few British peacekeeping soldiers were exchanging fire with the rebels. The government forces had already sent soldiers to support them.","The commander-in-chief of the Chinese peacekeeping forces received the same letter. There was finally news of the missing peacekeeping soldiers. However, they were still exchanging fire with the rebels.","At 8:00 am in China, the latest news from the military channel was that the missing Chinese peacekeeping soldiers had been found. Everyone was safe and there were no casualties.","Commander Xia turned off the television, stood up from the couch, and walked toward the study.","Not bad. Everyone was safe, and there were no casualties.","Du Jiayi, who had woken up, saw her father, Staff Officer Du, watching the international channel in front of the television early in the morning. She shuffled over in her slippers and sat down next to Staff Officer Du. She hugged his arm with one hand and said, \"Dad, why are you watching these bloody scenes so early in the morning? You’re home. Can’t you focus on resting?\"","Staff Officer Du, who had always doted on his younger daughter, raised his hand and pretended to be angry as he patted his daughter’s head. \"Bloody scenes? This shows how difficult it is for you to live in a peaceful country.","\"It’s only been a while since you’ve left the military unit and you’ve forgotten? You deserve a beating.\"","\"Dad, you’re hurting me!\" Du Jiayi hugged Staff Officer Du’s arm like a child and shook it. Staff Officer Du didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. \"Alright, alright. Why are you still acting like a child? Even your nephew isn’t so delicate.","\"Aren’t you resting today? Where are you going to play?\"","Du Jiayi sat up straight and thought for a moment. \"I’m going shopping with Mrs. Qin. I have to go over early and wait. Alas, I’ve put in a lot of effort to find a good son-in-law for you.\"","Staff Officer Du was very satisfied with Qin Xiu, but he didn’t know that Qin Xiu didn’t like Du Jiayi very much. When he saw his daughter accompanying Mrs. Qin out from time to time, he even thought that his daughter had received the approval of the Qin family.","He smiled and said, \"You’re not young anymore. When you have the time, let’s have the parents meet and settle the matter between the two of you. The sooner you get married, the sooner I’ll become a grandfather.\""]},{"number":5255,"title":"Chapter 5255: Urge","paragraphs":["Staff Officer Du liked his younger daughter very much. He hadn’t interacted with his eldest daughter much. Although their father-daughter relationship was not bad, he was never as considerate with her as with his younger daughter.","He never urged his younger daughter to find a boyfriend and get married as soon as possible because he wanted to keep her by his side for a few more years. After all, after his daughter got married, the situation at home would change.","The Qin family was a wealthy family. In the past few generations, they were all powerful people. As for the Du family, they were poor farmers for the past few generations. It was only in his hands that they changed their status.","Even though he was the staff officer, he couldn’t put on airs in the Qin family.","\"Why are you still so childish? You’re not young anymore. If you keep at it, you’ll become a nuisance.\" Staff Officer Du patted the back of his daughter’s hand and sighed. \"I’ve been keeping you by my side for many years. Your sister’s child is already three years old.\"","Du Jiayi, who wanted to coax him, felt her heart drop. Her father was not joking.","\"You and Qin Xiu have been together for a few years, right? In that case, let’s do it as soon as possible. We have to let the man take the initiative to mention the meeting of the parents. Remind Qin Xiu indirectly and let the Qin family set the date. Our family just needs to cooperate. It’s just a formality. There’s no need for too much etiquette.\"","Staff Officer Du, who had always thought that his daughter and Qin Xiu were in a relationship, made serious arrangements. In his eyes, Du Jiayi had specially retired from the military to work at the Ministry of Foreign Affairs for Qin Xiu. The Qin family would also ask their daughter to go over from time to time. It could be seen that the relationship between the two young people was very stable. The Qin family was probably quite satisfied with his daughter.","Now that she was old enough, she had to do what she needed to do.","Come to think of it, the two young people had been in a relationship for so long. Why had Qin Xiu never come to the Du residence?","No matter how busy he was with work, he could take one day to visit his future in-laws.","Why had he never been here before?","Staff Officer Du asked in a very serious tone. Du Jiayi panicked when she heard this. Her eyes flickered as she did not dare to look at Staff Officer Du.","Staff Officer Du noticed something amiss.","Frowning, Staff Officer Du asked in a low voice, \"What’s the matter? Does he think our Du residence is too small and is not willing to come over?\" Seeing that Du Jiayi did not even dare to look at him, Staff Officer Du’s expression darkened. He picked up the remote control and turned off the television, preparing to ask her properly.","Du Jiayi, who had a guilty conscience, did not dare to face him. Seeing this, she stood up hurriedly and pretended to be calm. \"Dad, you’re thinking too much. Xiu really doesn’t have time. Otherwise, he would’ve come to visit you long ago.\" She pretended to look at her watch and exclaimed, \"Ah, it’s already so late. Dad, go ahead and watch TV. I have to go out.\"","Staff Officer Du was capable of reaching his current position. He could easily see through Du Jiayi’s cover-up.","His expression turned even uglier than before. He shouted in a low voice, \"Sit down! If you don’t explain everything today, you’re not allowed to go anywhere.\"","Staff Officer Du, who had always been kind to his younger daughter and rarely got angry, had a cold expression on his face. Du Jiayi’s calves trembled. She knew that her father was serious this time.","No, she couldn’t let him realize that something was wrong. If her father learned that something was wrong, she wouldn’t be able to meet Mrs. Qin anymore.","Du Jiayi, who had sat down, was so flustered that her fingers were trembling. Her mind was racing as she tried to think of a good way to resolve the current difficulties and coax the suspicious Staff Officer Du."]},{"number":5256,"title":"Chapter 5256: Suspicious","paragraphs":["Du Jiayi was a smart and quick-witted woman. In the face of Staff Officer Du’s anger, although she was afraid and flustered, she did not give up immediately. Instead, she tried her best to think of a way to resolve the predicament.","What she needed to do now was coax her father!","After she left the Qin residence last time, Mrs. Qin had specially called to explain that she had delayed Du Jiayi in finding true love. Qin Xiu still hadn’t changed his mind, and the two elders of the Qin family wouldn’t interfere in this matter. In the future, Mrs. Qin didn’t want to intervene and delay Du Jiayi’s love life anymore. Hence, she specially gave Du Jiayi a pair of jade bracelets as compensation.","From then on, Mrs. Qin never contacted her again, let alone met her.","It wasn’t easy for her to contact Madam Qin, who hadn’t seen her since she left the Qin residence the last time. She had gone to great lengths to make contact with the Qin family again, so how could another accident happen?","If another accident happened... everything she did would be in vain. It would definitely become the regret of a lifetime. It was even more likely that Ye Jian would get what she wanted and marry Qin Xiu.","Now, she was staying by Mrs. Qin’s side so that Mrs. Qin would hate Ye Jian more and more.","If her father knew that she wasn’t with Qin Xiu at all and wouldn’t allow her to meet Mrs. Qin again, she wouldn’t be able to grasp how far Qin Xiu and Ye Jian had taken things. She wouldn’t be able to let Mrs. Qin continue to hate Ye Jian.","She had worked hard for so long. How could she allow others to take advantage of her?","After calming herself down, Du Jiayi hugged Staff Officer Du’s arm again. Her voice became softer and more delicate. \"Dad, why are you angry for no reason? Xiu just didn’t come to our house. Why are you angry? Isn’t that normal?","\"In fact, I won’t allow it even if you want him to come.\"","She wrinkled her nose and looked like a spoiled daughter.","Staff Officer Du, who was suspicious, was not so easy to fool. However, his expression improved a lot. He snorted calmly. \"Really? Why wouldn’t you allow it?\"","\"Xiu is so good. If he comes to visit you, you’ll definitely urge me to get married quickly. Hmph, I’m not getting married early. I want to accompany you and Mom for a few more years.\"","She was sweet-tongued and knew how to coax people. Staff Officer Du almost fell for her trick too.","However, the situation this time was different. This concerned his daughter’s future. Staff Officer Du was very cautious and couldn’t make any mistakes.","Staff Officer Du, who was not convinced, became even more suspicious. \"Jiayi, you’re hiding something from me. I’ll give you a chance to explain it clearly. If you continue to hide it, I’ll contact Qin Xiu directly. With my ability, it’s very simple to contact Qin Xiu.","\"You can choose to hide it, but I can just talk to Qin Xiu directly. Do as you see fit.\"","Du Jiayi, who wanted to coax her father, turned ashen when she heard this. How could she hide it? Her father said that he would personally call Qin Xiu... How could she continue to hide it?!","All of Du Jiayi’s excuses were rendered useless. There was no way out. She could only tell the truth.","She believed that her father meant what he said. She also believed that contacting Qin Xiu was a simple matter for him.","When Staff Officer Du saw his daughter’s expression, his heart turned cold, and so did his hands and feet.","\"Do you not want to tell me? Okay, I’ll look for Qin Xiu immediately.\" Staff Officer Du’s expression was dark as he pretended to take out his cell phone. \"Although the Qin family is a wealthy family, the daughter of the Du family is not easy to bully. I’ll ask Qin Xiu personally.\""]},{"number":5257,"title":"Chapter 5257: Furious","paragraphs":["Although he said that, Staff Officer Du’s heart had turned cold.","If his daughter was wronged by Qin Xiu, she wouldn’t have looked so afraid. His daughter’s fear... was more like she was afraid that he would call Qin Xiu to confirm it.","Why would she be afraid?","This shouldn’t be her reaction.","Staff Officer Du’s heart turned cold as he became more and more puzzled. His instincts told him that the matter between his daughter and Qin Xiu was not so simple. There were many things he did not know!","Knowing that her father meant what he said, Du Jiayi stopped pretending and smiled miserably. Before she could speak, tears fell from her eyes.","Staff Officer Du heaved a sigh of relief when he saw this. \"If you’ve been wronged, you should just tell your mother and me. Why face it alone? Did Qin Xiu bully you? Did the two of you have a conflict?\"","Staff Officer Du, who didn’t know anything, thought that the two young people were having a conflict. He didn’t think about anything else at all. He didn’t expect to almost faint from anger.","One second ago, Du Jiayi was still crying. The next second, she was smiling. It was a smile that was uglier than crying. Staff Officer Du was shocked. He raised his voice and got angry again. \"What happened? Tell me! Did he let you down?!\"","If Qin Xiu had bullied her or let her down...","Du Jiayi pulled Staff Officer Du’s sleeve tightly and told him the truth. \"Dad, I lied to you! I, I... I’m not with Qin Xiu at all...\"","The more she spoke, the darker Staff Officer Du’s expression became. In the end, his eyes were filled with anger.","\"That means that you’ve been sticking to him for the past few years. He, Qin Xiu, never even looked at you, right?\" Staff Officer Du gritted his teeth and asked. He felt that his chest was about to explode from anger. His breathing was rapid, and his vision was turning black.","Du Jiayi didn’t dare to hide it anymore. She was afraid that Staff Officer Du would really call and ask Qin Xiu. At that time, she would really lose all her dignity in front of Qin Xiu.","Du Jiayi, who was afraid and aggrieved, cried until her lips turned pale. She was so afraid that she did not dare to continue.","However, Staff Officer Du, who was so angry that he was about to faint, didn’t give Du Jiayi a chance to escape. \"Answer me honestly. If you dare to hide anything again, today...\" He reached for his waist. This was the action of touching a gun.","Du Jiayi’s shoulders trembled. She said miserably, \"I... I was the one who clung to him. But what can I do? Dad, I...\"","Smack!","He slapped her hard. The sound was so loud that even the maid, who was busy preparing breakfast, heard it. She was so frightened that she ran out while wiping her hands. \"What happened? What happened? Why are you angry so early in the morning?\"","The maid hired by the Du family was Staff Officer Du’s cousin. In the past, Staff Officer Du’s family was so poor that they couldn’t even put food on the table. It was this cousin’s family who would offer them help every few days.","Hence, although this cousin did housework for the Du family, she had always been respected by Staff Officer Du. Even Madam Li and her children respected her.","When she came out, she saw the finger marks on Du Jiayi’s fair face. She had always been pampered, but now, there was a red handprint on her cheek.","Why were they fighting?!","This was the first time she saw Du Jiayi, whom no one dared to offend, getting beaten up! And it was by the person who doted on her the most."]},{"number":5258,"title":"Chapter 5258: Furious","paragraphs":["The atmosphere in the living room was extremely gloomy. Du Jiayi, who had been slapped, did not even dare to cry.","\"Go back and do your work.\" Staff Officer Du didn’t want his cousin to know about his family’s embarrassment. \"Jiayi and I have something to talk about alone.\"","She hesitated for a moment and advised, \"If there’s anything, just talk it out. Don’t be angry. What can anger solve? You have to talk about it.\"","In the end, she did not dare to stay any longer. She looked at Du Jiayi with heartache and returned to the kitchen to prepare breakfast.","Although these children called her ’Aunt Fang’ obediently, alas... It was better not to annoy her cousin.","Staff Officer Du couldn’t afford to lose his dignity in the living room. Seeing that his cousin was leaving, he stood up with a livid expression. \"Go to the study! What an embarrassment!\"","Du Jiayi, whose face was half numb, stood up. Even if she wanted to escape, where could she go?","Getting slapped was already a light punishment. Just now... just now, she almost thought that she would be shot to death by her father.","After entering the study and closing the door, Staff Officer Du, who was so angry that his lungs were about to explode, pointed at the floor. He was so angry that his fingers were trembling. He shouted angrily, \"Kneel!\"","Du Jiayi, who had never been hit before, did not dare to resist. She lowered her head and arched her back. Her beautiful black hair covered her pale face.","\"You still have the cheek to cry! You’ve embarrassed me completely!\" Staff Officer Du slammed the desk so hard that his palm hurt. \"You’re the daughter of a staff officer, yet you’re rushing to throw yourself at another man! He has no interest in you, and he has made it clear time and again, but you still have the nerve to continue clinging to him. You’re just humiliating yourself and ruining yourself like this!","\"Du Jiayi, Du Jiayi, do you still care about me? Do you still care about your mother...\"","Suddenly, Staff Officer Du’s voice stopped. Then, he seemed to have thought of something. He clenched his fists and pressed them against the desk. His voice was like the cold wind that blew in the middle of winter. It was so cold that his bones hurt. \"Does your mother indulge you? Does she know everything? Give me an explanation!\"","He had to know. With his wife’s shrewdness, it was impossible for her not to realize that her daughter wasn’t with Qin Xiu. Du Jiayi had been shamelessly clinging to him for the past few years!","She definitely knew. She had been helping Du Jiayi and supporting her to get close to Qin Xiu.","Staff Officer Du, who was trembling with anger, stopped questioning Du Jiayi. He picked up the phone in the study and pressed the numbers one by one, dialing a set of cell phone numbers.","The call was connected. There was no need to wait for any sound from the other end. Staff Officer Du was so angry that his throat was hoarse. He gritted his teeth and spat out the words, \"Li Chenglan, come home immediately! Immediately!\"","Li Chenglan was Madam Li’s name.","For the past two days, Madam Li had been taking care of Old Master Li, who had suffered another stroke and was hospitalized. After two days, he had lost a lot of weight. Hearing her husband’s cold voice, Madam Li didn’t show a good temper either. \"I’m taking care of my father in the hospital. If you need anything, come to the hospital yourself.\"","After Li Chuhai left, the couple basically didn’t talk to each other anymore. Staff Officer Du didn’t like it when Madam Li didn’t even care about her family for the sake of the Li family. Madam Li didn’t like it when Staff Officer Du turned against her because of the Li family. The two sides were in a stalemate and couldn’t even maintain their relationship."]},{"number":5259,"title":"Chapter 5259: Strange","paragraphs":["Madam Li’s temper had always been fiery. Her family members were the same. Staff Officer Du used to think that there was nothing wrong with it and thought that with a strong woman at home, she would take care of the family and not let him worry.","That was the truth. Ever since he married Madam Li, the Du family started to wash the mud off their legs bit by bit. They walked step by step from the field to the road and then to the prosperous city. In the end, they got to where they were today.","However, after Li Chuhai came back from overseas and committed a series of things, Staff Officer Du was almost dragged down. Madam Li still did whatever she wanted and did not realize that the Li family was on the verge of collapse. She even asked Staff Officer Du to get involved in Li Chuhai’s matter and tried to save Li Chuhai through him.","This concerned his future. Moreover, Li Chuhai’s crime was related to the country. No matter how much Staff Officer Du respected his wife, he couldn’t do anything.","If he made a move, he would be going against the country.","Opposing the country?","Was she tired of living?!","Staff Officer Du didn’t do anything in the end, and Madam Li kicked up a fuss. Hence, the couple’s phone call this time was filled with tension.","Madam Li didn’t say anything else. After she finished speaking, she ended the call and turned her phone to silent mode. No matter how thick her makeup was in recent years, it couldn’t hide the gloomy facial expression on her old face.","Commanding her to go home immediately?","He was a leader in the military unit, but was she his soldier?","If anything happened, he should come to the hospital himself!","But he would never do that.","\"Chenglan...\" Second Old Madam Li’s tired voice came from the ward. Madam Li had walked out of the ward to answer the call. She pushed the door open and entered. \"Mom, why are you awake? Sleep for a while more. It’s still early.\"","The ward was a one-bedroom high-class ward. Only people at Old Master Li’s level could receive such treatment.","Two days ago, Old Master Li had a stroke. Second Old Madam Li insisted on staying in the hospital to take care of him. Madam Li had no choice but to stay in the hospital with them. Fortunately, she didn’t need to do anything. There were nurses and caretakers. She just needed to keep an eye on them.","Even so, Madam Li, who had been at the hospital for two days, couldn’t eat properly.","She was already in her early 60s. How could she endure it?","However, she had no choice. Second Old Madam Li insisted on staying in the hospital, and Old Master Li was still lying in the ICU. He only woke up once. As his daughter, she had to accompany him.","She came over and placed the pillow properly. Then, she helped Second Old Madam Li to sit up and lean against the pillow. The mother and daughter looked tired.","Second Old Madam Li, who was sitting up in bed, drank a glass of water. Her expression was dark as she said to Madam Li, \"Call Ronghuan and ask him about Jun’s current situation. Also, tell him that he can either give those hooligans a death sentence or make them stay in prison for the rest of their lives.","\"Jun is our only child. If something happens to him, how am I going to answer to the old master? Chenglan, you have to keep an eye on him. You have to keep an eye on me. As for Ronghuan...\"","When Second Old Madam Li mentioned Li Ronghuan, there was a hint of gloominess in her muddy eyes. \"The old master trusts him, but I don’t.\"","Second Old Madam Li, who had forced the first wife to her death, would never believe the child left behind by the first wife. Li Ronghuan’s return was too coincidental. He did not seem estranged from her at all. The more this was the case, the more uncertain Second Old Madam Li was.","She didn’t trust him, and neither did Madam Li.","Hearing this, Madam Li nodded. \"I know it even if you don’t say it. We only have Jun now. Nothing can happen to him.\""]},{"number":5260,"title":"Chapter 5260: Parasites","paragraphs":["Li Jun was not the only grandson of the Li family. However, in the eyes of Second Old Madam Li and Madam Li, other than Li Jun, there was no one else.","Second Old Madam Li spent half her life controlling the entire Li family and making the first wife’s children hated by Old Master Li. How could she allow her child to lose to the child left behind by the first wife?","\"Go and see the old master. The doctor said that he woke up once last night. He might wake up today too. Go and take a look. Don’t let the people outside take advantage of you.\" Second Old Madam Li was at ease leaving this matter to her daughter. Thinking of Old Master Li, who was still lying in the ICU, Second Old Madam Li still felt lingering fear when she thought about what happened two days ago.","\"You just take a rest. I’ll go over as soon as Dad wakes up.\" Madam Li, who knew what was going on, didn’t need Second Old Madam Li to remind her. She was also on guard against the \"people outside\".","Li Jinnian’s biological father, Li Ronghuan, and Li Jinnian were all ’outsiders’ as mentioned by Second Old Madam Li.","The Li family had been very chaotic for the past half a year. First, their subordinates, who relied on Old Master Li to climb up the ranks, fell one after another. Then, there were problems with the collateral relatives. At first, Old Master Li did not take it to heart.","The Li family was like a huge tree. The tree was huge and had many leaves. If anything went wrong, it wouldn’t affect the main trunk. However, Old Master Li’s body wasn’t as strong as before. Old Master Li was afraid that he would die. Hence, he didn’t handle everything like before. If there was a small problem, he would deal with it. He would hand over the more serious matters to Li Ronghuan or the direct descendants.","Unexpectedly, in just half a year, more and more things happened. Two days ago, two of his subordinates, who were promoted by him, met with problems and were invited to tea by the Military Disciplinary Committee. Until now, there was still no news of them.","There were too many problems with the Li family. As Old Master Li moved farther and farther away from the center of power, the things that he covered up in the past were dug out bit by bit.","What would come would come.","After knowing that something had happened to his direct descendant, Old Master Li’s first call was to Li Ronghuan. Li Ronghuan was on his way to the airport. At the same time, he told Old Master Li another piece of bad news. Li Chuhai’s son, Second Old Madam Li’s beloved, Li Jun, had fought with local hooligans and hit his head. He was currently in the hospital. When Li Ronghuan received the news, he went to Hai Province immediately.","Hai Province was Old Master Li’s strongest territory. He sent Li Jun to Hai Province because it was his old territory. If Li Jun went there, he would be the crown prince. No one would dare to provoke him.","They didn’t expect those local hooligans to make a move. They didn’t know that Li Jun was from the capital city. They didn’t like him and argued with him. These local hooligans, who were also domineering in Hai Province, started fighting with Li Jun.","Li Jun had three bodyguards beside him, but there were too many of them. One of the hooligans picked up a beer bottle and smashed it at Li Jun’s head. Li Jun bled from the back of his head and fainted.","This time, things got out of hand. The people protecting Li Jun in Hai Province didn’t dare to contact Old Master Li. They only dared to contact Li Ronghuan, who had sent Li Jun to Hai Province.","Li Ronghuan, who was rushing to the airport empty-handed and only had his identification document, ’anxiously’ told Old Master Li about Li Jun’s injury. His tone was a little exaggerated, and he said that Li Jun almost died on the spot."]},{"number":5261,"title":"Chapter 5261: Falling","paragraphs":["At that time, Old Master Li was furious that something had happened to his direct descendant. When he received Li Ronghuan’s call and knew that something had happened to Li Jun, he felt all the blood in his body rushing to his mind. Before he could react, he blacked out.","Fortunately, the family doctor of the Li family had been staying in the Li residence for almost half a year. When Old Master Li fainted, he was immediately rescued. Old Master Li was lucky. He had a strong desire to live, and he survived this time.","Staff Officer Du locked Du Jiayi at home and asked the guards to keep an eye on her. Staff Officer Du, who didn’t allow her to leave home, rushed to the hospital angrily. Before he could reach the hospital, he received news that Old Master Li had woken up.","Madam Li had asked someone to keep an eye on Old Master Li in the ICU. Staff Officer Du, who didn’t have time to go to the hospital, had also secretly left instructions.","Staff Officer Du suppressed his anger and went to the ICU to visit his father-in-law.","Although he didn’t help the Li family, Old Master Li was his father-in-law , after all. He had to go to the hospital to avoid suspicion. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be good if word got out.","Old Master Li, who had a second stroke, wasn’t as lucky as the first time. Previously, he was paralyzed on one side. This time... the doctor said to Staff Officer Du regretfully, \"The old master is already lucky to be able to survive his second stroke.\"","His life was saved, but his entire body was paralyzed. He couldn’t even speak clearly. His speech was much worse than the first time he was paralyzed.","Second Old Madam Li’s knees turned weak on the spot, and she fell on Madam Li. The soldiers panicked again. Madam Li had to take care of Second Old Madam Li, so Staff Officer Du looked at Old Master Li, who had just woken up.","Old Master Li, who had been invincible all his life, had tubes attached to his body. His white hair was lying motionless. Besides his eyeballs that could still move slightly, he was so weak that he no longer looked as impressive as before. Even his being had an aura of decay.","Staff Officer Du didn’t feel good either. He sat on the small round stool that the guard had brought over. Staff Officer Du said softly, \"Dad, have a good rest. Don’t worry about what’s happening outside anymore.\"","Old Master Li rolled his gray eyes. With a breathing mask on, he kept making muffled sounds from his throat. He even lost the ability to speak. It was as if something was stuck in his throat. One had to listen carefully to the individual sounds he was making to guess what he was saying.","After a while, Staff Officer Du finally heard what he said clearly.","Jun...","It was Li Chuhai’s son, Li Jun. He grew up overseas. Back then, in order to protect Li Jun, Li Chuhai even made someone impersonate Li Jun and hid the real Li Jun from everyone.","As his uncle-in-law, he had only seen the real Li Jun once.","\"There’s Ronghuan on Jun’s side. Don’t worry, I’ll call Ronghuan later to ask about the situation on his side. If Jun is fine, I’ll ask him to return to the capital city to accompany you.\"","Although Old Master Li was paralyzed and couldn’t speak, his hearing wasn’t damaged, and his brain wasn’t muddled. Hearing that, he nodded and shook his head with difficulty. He was a little anxious, feeling as if something was stuck in his throat. This time, Staff Officer Du didn’t understand what he was trying to say.","\"Don’t you want Jun to come back? If you want him to come back, nod. If you don’t want him to come back, shake your head.\"","Old Master Li nodded.","\"Okay, I’ll contact Ronghuan immediately after I go out. As long as Jun is fine, he’ll return to the capital city immediately.\"","As soon as Staff Officer Du finished speaking, Old Master Li shook his head again. Staff Officer Du really didn’t understand what he meant."]},{"number":5262,"title":"Chapter 5262: Days","paragraphs":["Staff Officer Du, who didn’t know what Old Master Li was expressing, only sat for a short while before the doctor stopped visitation hours. Although Old Master Li was already awake, he was very weak. It wasn’t suitable for him to be with a guest for long.","However, Old Master Li did not expect Staff Officer Du to leave so early. He was so anxious that his breathing was rapid, and white mist was kicked out of his breathing mask. When the doctor saw this, he was so shocked that he immediately said to Old Master Li, \"Calm down. You’re still in a dangerous period. You can’t be agitated anymore.\"","Old Master Li, who was panting heavily, had been stubborn for his entire life. How could he listen to the doctor? He knew his body very well. His days were numbered.","While he was still awake, he had to hurry up.","\"Lan... Lan...\" Old Master Li muttered. The more agitated he was, the more frightened the doctor was. He was afraid that there would be a problem, so he immediately injected medicine with calming and sleeping ingredients into the IV drip. Unexpectedly, Old Master Li, who was very weak, couldn’t withstand the effects of the medicine. After struggling for a while, he finally closed his eyes and fell asleep.","Staff Officer Du, who hadn’t left, saw that the doctors and nurses were sweating profusely. He said apologetically, \"I’m sorry, Doctor Li. My father-in-law has troubled you.\"","Last time, it was Doctor Li who saved Old Master Li from a stroke. This time, it was also him.","Hearing this, Doctor Li wiped the sweat off his forehead and sighed. \"Staff Officer, the old master is a little hot-tempered. He likes to do everything himself. He survived two consecutive strokes and won’t be able to withstand any more agitation even if he’s lucky.","\"As doctors, we can only do our best. However, whether the patient turns out fine or not sometimes depends on the patient’s cooperation. Please take care of the affairs outside. The old master’s health can’t be affected anymore.\"","If they continued to torture him, the doctor was afraid that he wouldn’t have much time left.","But the doctor didn’t say this.","Staff Officer Du knew his old father-in-law’s temper. He was stubborn. Even when he was sick, he was a troublesome patient.","He smiled bitterly and said, \"Okay, we’ll definitely cooperate with your arrangements. We’ll definitely persuade the old master more.\" He would try his best to persuade Old Master Li. But if he overdid it, he was afraid that he would anger Old Master Li even more.","With such a temper, no one could do anything about him.","Old Master Li had already fallen asleep. Doctor Li instructed the doctors and nurses on duty to watch over him before bringing Staff Officer Du out. As they walked, he talked about Old Master Li’s current situation. \"It’s not optimistic. You need to be mentally prepared.\"","These words were very straightforward. When Staff Officer Du saw Old Master Li’s expression just now, he already had a vague feeling. Now that the doctor had made it clear, Staff Officer Du wasn’t surprised.","Staff Officer Du frowned and thought for a moment. He asked Doctor Li, \"Did you tell my wife?\"","\"Not for the time being, but we’ll talk about it later. You should have an idea of the old master’s situation after seeing him just now. We’ll try our best.\"","People in high positions had to arrange many more things than ordinary people, so it was better to let them know early to avoid any problems.","After confirming that Second Old Madam Li had only fainted and that her body was fine, Madam Li rushed to the ICU to visit Old Master Li. In the middle of the corridor, she saw Doctor Li standing there with a serious expression. She didn’t know what he was saying to her husband."]},{"number":5263,"title":"Chapter 5263: Prepared","paragraphs":["For some reason, Madam Li’s heart turned cold. She couldn’t help but shiver and quicken her pace.","\"Chenglan,\" Staff Officer Du saw his wife and greeted her calmly. He had to be careful outside. No matter how unhappy they were as a couple, they couldn’t embarrass themselves outside.","Madam Li cared about her reputation too. She wouldn’t throw a tantrum outside and let others see her as a joke.","\"Doctor Li, how’s the situation on my father’s side? Has the danger period completely passed?\" Madam Li asked anxiously as she approached. As she asked, she saw Doctor Li’s serious expression. Madam Li felt that the cold autumn wind outside was blowing into her bones.","The Li family was still under Old Master Li’s control. The cause of her younger brother’s death had yet to be investigated. Old Master Li could not fall.","\"It’s not optimistic. I just told the Staff Officer Du that the family members should be prepared in advance. If there’s anything you need to do, you should do it in advance.\"","Madam Li’s body swayed.","Staff Officer Du hurriedly held her and said in a low voice, \"He’s already old. We have to be prepared.\"","Old Master Li was probably the only one who could survive the two strokes.","Madam Li wasn’t happy to hear that. A vicious look appeared on her face. She shook off her husband’s hand and said sternly, \"What should I be prepared for? Do you want my father to die?\"","They were still outside and in front of outsiders. Anyone could tell that there was something wrong between the couple.","Doctor Li didn’t stay any longer. He made an excuse and left. Before he left, he reminded them, \"You need to be quiet in the hospital. If you have anything to say, you can discuss it at home.\"","Staff Officer Du waited for Doctor Li to walk away before his expression darkened. \"Don’t be stupid outside! It’s already a blessing that he survived two consecutive strokes. Do you think he can still be like before? You know what you should do. Don’t vent your anger on me!\"","Seeing that his wife was about to flare up again, Staff Officer Du took a deep breath and controlled his temper. He said patiently, \"He wants Ronghuan to bring Jun back to the capital city. Contact Ronghuan and see how Jun is doing.","\"If it doesn’t affect his discharge from the hospital, he should return to the capital city as soon as possible. Also, those hooligans will be dealt with. Ronghuan knows that too. Don’t get involved.\"","Madam Li, who was originally furious, finally felt a little better when she heard her husband mention her nephew. She was someone who could only go along with things. Seeing her husband make concessions, the sharp look on her face disappeared.","\"Did my dad say anything just now?\" she asked coldly.","\"He only said to let Jun come back, nothing else.\" He didn’t understand what he meant.","Li Ronghuan found out half an hour later that Old Master Li had woken up. He had been busy with Li Jun’s matters and had set his phone aside. He only knew that Old Master Li had woken up after Li Jun, who was lying on the bed, found his cell phone.","After receiving Madam Li’s call, Li Ronghuan, who was also in the hospital, smiled coldly. The old man was lucky... He had lived for so long but beat death twice. He was indeed lucky.","After asking the doctor and finding out that Li Jun could be discharged but it was best that he did not take a plane, Li Ronghuan, who also wanted to return to the capital city, asked Hai Province to prepare a luxurious business car and arranged for two doctors to accompany them to leave Hai Province. They would rush back to the capital city.","The distance from Hai Province to the capital city was extraordinary. The entire journey was nearly 3,000 kilometers. They planned to spend two days and two nights rushing back.","The next day, Li Jun lay in the car and fell asleep. Li Ronghuan received an unfamiliar call. Li Ronghuan glanced at Li Jun from the corners of his eyes and leaned to the side lazily. He didn’t speak and only listened to what the other party said."]},{"number":5264,"title":"Chapter 5264: Mysterious Call","paragraphs":["The drivers arranged by Li Ronghuan had ten years of experience. They drove steadily and quickly. The car was extremely stable. The sunlight outside shone through the car window. It was warm and made people fall asleep.","Li Jun, who had his eyes closed, raised his eyes slightly and glanced at Li Ronghuan, who was on the call. A cold and dark look flashed past his eyes.","This second uncle of his was interesting.","Li Ronghuan’s call was a little long, but he was in a good mood after hanging up. He even instructed the driver to drive safely and not rush to prevent anything from happening.","Li Jun had his eyes closed the entire time. Besides getting out of the car to move around and eat, he didn’t open his eyes at all. He didn’t say much to Li Ronghuan either. He was like an invisible person. Sometimes, even the driver would forget about him.","Li Ronghuan didn’t pay much attention to Li Jun. He wanted the Li family to collapse. As for Li Jun, he didn’t want to make things difficult for him. After two days of driving, he even asked if he was feeling unwell.","After Li Ronghuan received a mysterious call, he was in a good mood all the way. On the other hand, Madam Li, who was in the capital city, was in a bad mood. She held her cell phone tightly and said sternly to Staff Officer Du, who was questioning her, \"You’ve never cared about our daughter’s marriage. I’ve been the one managing everything at home. Now that Jiayi’s marriage has been thwarted, you still have the cheek to question me?\"","Staff Officer Du, who came to the hospital to question his wife about their daughter’s matters, almost had a quarrel with Madam Li again because he got Li Ronghuan to send Li Jun back to the capital city.","Madam Li blamed her husband for letting Li Ronghuan escort Li Jun back to the capital city alone. Something would happen. Staff Officer Du felt that his wife was crazy and thinking too much. Even if Li Ronghuan had a grudge against the family, he wouldn’t harm his nephew. How ridiculous!","In the end, he flicked his sleeves and left. He was so angry that he forgot to ask about Du Jiayi.","When he got into the car and remembered why he came to the hospital, he received a call from the office. Staff Officer Du had no choice but to rush back. The matter between Du Jiayi and the Qin family was temporarily put aside.","However, before the matter was resolved, Du Jiayi would still be locked up at home. Du Jiayi could not take a step outside the house. However, this did not affect her communication with the outside world.","When Madam Li received her daughter’s call, she knew why her husband came to the hospital in a fit of anger. When she called, she received a notification that his phone was switched off. In addition, she was worried that Li Ronghuan would harm Li Jun, so she comforted Du Jiayi and asked her to rest at home for a few days. Then, she called Mrs. Qin to explain Du Jiayi’s absence before putting the matter aside for the time being.","The next day, Staff Officer Du, who had turned on his cell phone, immediately called Madam Li. As soon as the matter was brought up, Madam Li exploded.","\"Old Du, tell me just how exactly I’ve let you down! Jiayi likes Qin Xiu, and Qin Xiu is indeed a good man. I’m thinking about my daughter’s lifelong happiness and fighting for her. Am I wrong?","\"You said that Jiayi is throwing herself at another man. How is she throwing herself at another man? Get this straight. Mrs. Qin likes Jiayi. I only agreed because she contacted Jiayi!","\"Even if my daughter can’t get married, I won’t let her throw herself at a man!\"","Staff Officer Du believed this, but...","\"Ask your good daughter and see if she’d throw herself at him!\" After saying that, Staff Officer Du ended the call. Thinking of what happened yesterday morning, he was so angry that he wanted to smash his cell phone."]},{"number":5265,"title":"Chapter 5265: Unfathomable","paragraphs":["Madam Li did not ask Du Jiayi. Old Master Li had woken up again.","After Staff Officer Du left yesterday, Old Master Li woke up again that night. This time, the mother and daughter understood what he wanted to say.","Old Master Li was worried about handing Li Jun to Li Ronghuan. Why? Old Master Li had some thoughts, but unfortunately, he could no longer express them.","Madam Li agreed to wait for Li Jun to return to the capital city before sending him overseas. Only then did a relaxed smile appear on Old Master Li’s face.","The next day, Old Master Li woke up again. He was obviously in better spirits than before. Although it was extremely difficult to speak, he was awake for more than an hour.","It was already three in the morning when Li Ronghuan brought Li Jun into the capital city. The car drove straight to the hospital without returning to the Li residence.","Madam Li received Li Ronghuan’s call at around 2:30 am. He told her that he was coming to the hospital to visit Old Master Li and that he had arrived in the capital city safely. Madam Li, who had been tense for two days, heaved a sigh of relief.","Second Old Madam Li, who was old and naive, heard her daughter answering the phone in the middle of the night. She listened carefully and knew that Li Jun had returned to the capital city safely. She placed her hands together and even muttered a prayer.","\"It’s good that Jun has arrived at the capital city safely. When the old master gets better, quickly send Jun overseas and take away all the valuables in the family. He shouldn’t come back if there’s nothing going on,\" Second Old Madam Li said with lingering fear. \"We have to listen to the old master’s arrangements for this matter. We can’t let Jun do whatever he wants.\"","Madam Li poured a cup of warm water and handed it over. Second Old Madam Li took the cup and moistened her throat. She said, \"The old master must have noticed something and wants to send Jun abroad.","\"Mom still remembers Li Ronghuan’s gaze when he left home back then. He doesn’t have kind intentions in returning and helping the family, let alone taking care of Jun. The old master knows it in his heart. In the past, the old master could still suppress him. Now that he has fallen, he knows that he can’t suppress Li Ronghuan anymore. That’s why he was in a hurry to send Jun overseas.","They had been husband and wife for decades. Second Old Madam Li understood Old Master Li.","After understanding what Old Master Li meant, the mother and daughter, who were already worried that Li Ronghuan would harm Li Jun, became even more worried.","Now that Jun had arrived in the capital city safely and was even on his way to the hospital, Second Old Madam Li felt that Li Ronghuan, her stepson, had finally done something useful.","Madam Li poured herself a glass of water to moisten her throat before saying in a low voice, \"Dad must have made arrangements. I just didn’t expect him to suddenly collapse. He can’t open my mouth now. There are many things that you and I don’t know. It just depends on whether Jun knows something or not. When Jun comes back later, I’ll send Li Ronghuan away. You take the time to ask Jun properly.","\"Dad has always made arrangements. Li Ronghuan went out for more than ten years and suddenly came back. How can Dad believe him?","\"Dad asked Li Ronghuan to investigate Chuhai. Then, he arranged for Jun to be sent to Hai Province. Mom, don’t forget that Chuhai’s old military unit was in Hai Province. Do you think it’s possible that Dad asked Jun to investigate too?\"","Second Old Madam Li’s eyelids twitched violently. \"This is like the old master’s style of doing things! It’s very likely!\"","The mother and daughter, who were waiting for Li Ronghuan to come over, chatted in the ward. They talked about everything and agreed that Old Master Li must have a deeper motive for letting Li Jun go to Hai Province.","That was the truth.","When Li Jun rushed to the hospital, Madam Li sent Li Ronghuan away. He then told Second Old Madam Li why he went to Hai Province. \"Second Uncle and my father are not biological brothers. Who can feel at ease with him investigating? I was the one who suggested it first before Grandpa made the arrangements.\""]},{"number":5266,"title":"Chapter 5266: Scheme","paragraphs":["Li Jun, who was born and raised overseas, did not have much feelings for the Li family. Before he returned to the country, he had never seen Second Old Madam Li or Old Master Li.","Oh, that wasn’t right.","It should be said that Second Old Madam Li and Old Master Li had never seen Li Jun before. Li Jun had seen them through photos.","Old Master Li had always said that his youngest son, Li Chuhai, was like him. He was also a cold-blooded person. Blood ties were dispensable in their eyes. For their own benefit, they could even raise a knife to harm their own family.","In the past, Old Master Li had walked through this path. Old Master Li’s fathers had also walked through this path. If Li Chuhai hadn’t gone overseas, he might have dealt with his two stepbrothers.","Li Jun inherited the cold personality of the Li family. He didn’t come back to the country because of his grandparents who didn’t have any feelings for him. He came back because he wanted to investigate his father’s death. If not, he would have been in Molaban for the rest of his life.","Facing Second Old Madam Li’s question, Li Jun didn’t hide anything. He told Second Old Madam Li what Old Master Li said.","When Second Old Madam Li saw that her good grandson’s head was still wrapped up in white bandages, her heart ached so much that her eyes turned red. She wanted to hug him and dote on him. Li Jun pretended not to see her concern and did not ask why she was hospitalized. He sat down and asked why she was in a hurry to let him return to the capital city.","Li Jun didn’t take it to heart that Old Master Li had a stroke. He had just started investigating when he was hit in the head. Then, he was hurriedly asked to return to the capital city. He was in a bad mood the entire way.","Second Old Madam Li was anxious about whether Li Ronghuan would play any cheap shots, so she decided to get down to business first.","She had always been someone who could tell the severity of things.","Facing Second Old Madam Li’s question, Li Jun said calmly, \"Grandpa doesn’t believe Second Uncle. As for me, I don’t believe in Second Uncle either. I believe that neither you nor Aunt do either.","\"Second Uncle is an interesting person. He does things beautifully and draws beautifully too. Help me ask Second Uncle for a few more paintings another day. I’ll take them out when I need money.\"","Second Old Madam Li agreed to everything Li Jun asked for. It was just a few paintings. It was not a big problem.","Now, she had to arrange for Li Jun to go overseas as soon as possible.","In the ward, Second Old Madam Li told Li Jun Old Master Li’s intentions. Outside, Madam Li asked Li Ronghuan how the matter in Hai Province was going. According to her, those hooligans who hurt Li Jun could forget about having a good time. They would all be arrested.","Li Ronghuan was addicted to smoking, but he could not smoke in the hospital. He took out a cigarette from his pocket and sniffed it a few times before replying with a smile, \"We’ll deal with it according to the law. Of course, if my brother-in-law has any good ideas and can increase the punishment of these people, I have no objections.\"","Second Old Madam Li climbed into Old Master Li’s bed at the age of 15. Although Madam Li was a mistress, she was ten years older than Li Ronghuan. Li Chuhai was four years younger than Li Ronghuan.","The cold wind blew in through the window that was pushed open in the corridor. Madam Li, who was wearing thin clothes, retreated to the side and looked at Li Ronghuan coldly.","He knew that she was wearing thin clothes, but he still pushed open the window. He was really shameless and used all kinds of underhanded methods.","\"I’ll leave this matter to you. I believe that you can do it well. Jun is my only grandson. He’ll inherit the Li family in the future. You’re Jun’s uncle. As an elder, you can’t even protect your nephew. Aren’t you afraid of being laughed at?\""]},{"number":5267,"title":"Chapter 5267: Retribution","paragraphs":["Madam Li said coldly. She was a little angry at Li Ronghuan’s indifferent expression.","Li Ronghuan didn’t care about Jun when his father was still around. Now that his father had left, they wouldn’t be able to count on Li Ronghuan to help Jun!","Li Ronghuan, who was lowering his head and sniffing the cigarette, was silent for a while before sneering. Madam Li’s expression immediately darkened when she saw that. \"What are you sneering at?!\"","\"Why am I sneering?\" Li Ronghuan raised his head, his eyes filled with mockery. \"Li Jun is the only grandson of the old man? Li Chenglan, you’re not so old that you’re muddle-headed, right? You’ve forgotten about our Jinnian, the eldest grandson of the Li family.","Madam Li was angry at first, but towards the end, she sneered, \"Li Jinnian? He’s not a descendant of our Li family. He’s already gone to the Fu family.","\"In the past, Dad even remembered that he was the eldest grandson of the Li family. He told Mom that he had to leave a large portion of the Li family’s things for his eldest grandson.","\"Dad had his eldest grandson in mind, but the eldest grandson has never treated himself as a member of the Li family. His heart is with the Fu family.","\"He’s a traitor. How is he the eldest grandson of the Li family? If he could change his surname, he would have changed it to Fu long ago! Dad has already said that there’s no Li Jinnian in the Li family!\"","Li Ronghuan’s expression was a little dark. It wasn’t because Old Master Li didn’t acknowledge Li Jinnian, but because Madam Li’s attitude toward Li Jinnian made him unhappy.","Li Ronghuan thought it would be nice if Li Jinnian could really change his surname to ’Fu’, but it was a pity that he could not.","In the future, it would be good if the Li family did not have a person like Li Jinnian. The family was rotten to the core, so what was there to be sad about? It was better to not be a member of the Li family and live a clean life.","It was these dirty and smelly people who treated the Li family as a treasure.","That was true. They had spent so much effort to get it, so they naturally treated the Li family as a treasure.","Unfortunately, the family did not have many good days left.","It was good that Li Jinnian had left. He stayed in the military unit obediently. He was clean with no dirt on him at all. Li Ronghuan, who was unhappy with Madam Li’s attitude, was about to smile when he heard Madam Li say with a faint smile, \"You haven’t been home for more than ten years, so you don’t know anything about your family. I can understand.","\"On account of us being siblings, let me remind you not to mention Li Jinnian in front of me. I don’t like to hear it.\"","She couldn’t hide her gloating. Li Ronghuan looked at her deeply and smiled. \"Alright. Thank you for reminding me.\"","Siblings? Was she worthy?","Madam Li, who thought that she had won a round, smiled even wider. \"You’re welcome. Well, I’ll only be happy if you help Jun.","\"Alright, it’s getting late. Go home and rest. I’ve always wanted to spend more time with Jun, so he’ll stay in the hospital.\"","From now on, she had to separate Li Ronghuan from Jun to prevent any problems from happening.","Li Ronghuan stretched lazily and looked at Li Chenglan, who was pretending to be his sister, with a faint smile. After a while, he said slowly, \"Then I’ll go to the hotel next door to pass the night. Call me when Dad wakes up. I have good news that I want to tell him as soon as possible.\"","\"Okay, you can leave.\" Madam Li nodded. She did not take Li Ronghuan’s words to heart. She had no intention of letting Li Ronghuan see Old Master Li.","Li Ronghuan, who had his hands in his pockets, suddenly turned around. Madam Li was caught off guard. After taking a few steps, he suddenly turned around. Before she could retract the cold and disdainful expression on her face, Li Ronghuan saw her."]},{"number":5268,"title":"Chapter 5268: Happy","paragraphs":["Madam Li, who was caught red-handed, immediately froze. \"What’s the matter?\"","\"Nothing. I just want you to tell Dad that there’s been a result of the investigation he asked me to do,\" Li Ronghuan said with a smile. He admired Madam Li’s distorted facial features. \"You’ll let me know the moment Dad wakes up, right?\"","He wanted to see Madam Li embarrass herself, so he did it on purpose. Madam Li understood that, but there was nothing she could do.","There was a result from what the old master asked him to do... Did he know who Li Chuhai’s real murderer was?","\"Don’t worry. As long as Dad wakes up, I’ll definitely call you immediately!\" Madam Li tried her best to maintain her expression. She didn’t want Li Ronghuan to see her lose her composure.","Li Ronghuan raised his eyebrows and gave her a smile. Then, he left in a relaxed manner.","Li Ronghuan was in a good mood when he saw how Li Chenglan wanted to flare up but could only suppress it.","A mistress who dared to act like his sister in front of him? How shameless could she be?","Madam Li’s expression changed a few times. In the end, she gritted her teeth and glared at the departing figure before returning to the ward.","Li Ronghuan was fooling her just now, and he made it clear as day. He just wanted to see her embarrass herself!","This was the first time Madam Li had been taken for a fool. She stood for a while to calm herself down. Then, she took in the cold wind and restrained all the emotions on her face before returning to the ward.","At around 7:30 am, Li Ronghuan rushed to the hospital. In the ICU, he saw Old Master Li, who was much more energetic than yesterday.","Facing Old Master Li, who was emanating an aura of decay, Li Ronghuan felt a twisted sense of comfort. Back then, his mother passed away in pain. Now, it was time for this biggest culprit to experience his mother’s pain!","Li Ronghuan, who was feeling comfortable, stood by the bed and glanced at the equipment that was maintaining Old Master Li’s life. Then, he bent over and sighed. \"Dad, you’re quite good at tormenting yourself. It wasn’t easy for you to be able to stand and eat, but you ended up being hospitalized again. Can you still talk? Can you still hear?\"","\"Li Ronghuan! What are you doing? Do you want Dad to be angry?\" Madam Li scolded in front of the doctors and nurses. \"If you’re going to say anything unpleasant again, then just get out.\"","Second Old Madam Li wiped the corners of her eyes and said in a trembling voice, \"Ronghuan, I beg you. If you feel upset, come at me. Don’t anger the old master anymore, okay?\"","The doctors and nurses who didn’t know anything looked at Li Ronghuan differently.","Another unfilial son!","Old Master Li couldn’t move his body, but his mind was clear. He couldn’t care less even if he wanted to. He glanced to the side and then looked at Madam Li. He wanted Madam Li to invite the doctors and nurses out.","What happened next concerned Li Chuhai. Madam Li didn’t want the doctors and nurses to know either. After they were done with their work, she politely invited them out. She also instructed the people beside Old Master Li to guard the door to prevent anyone from eavesdropping.","Without any outsiders around, Old Master Li spat out a few words with difficulty. \"Tell... Tell... Tell...\"","Li Ronghuan didn’t say anything immediately. He frowned and looked at the door. \"There should be a doctor present. If anything happens, we can save him immediately.\"","\"Li Ronghuan, you’re doing it on purpose, right?!\" Madam Li’s expression was dark. She didn’t have much patience left. \"If you have something to say, say it. If not, don’t disturb Dad’s rest.\""]},{"number":5269,"title":"Chapter 5269: Amazing","paragraphs":["Second Old Madam Li also thought that Li Ronghuan was doing it on purpose.","\"That’s right. Ronghuan, hurry up and say it. Did you investigate your brother’s matter clearly? Hurry up and tell us so that the old master’s wish can be fulfilled.\"","Second Old Madam Li, who had to wipe the corners of her eyes at least three times when saying a sentence, begged. Anyone who saw this would think that Old Master Li was very pitiful while Li Ronghuan was an evil person.","\"I will. I’m just worried that Dad won’t be able to accept what I have to say and will have a problem with his health.\" Li Ronghuan whetted everyone’s appetite, including Old Master Li, who could hear everything clearly.","\"S-Speak...\" Old Master Li, who had plenty to say but couldn’t say them, still wanted to use his previous might to order Li Ronghuan around. Unfortunately, he could only lie down now. He was a paralyzed patient who couldn’t even speak properly.","Li Ronghuan looked at Old Master Li and then at the mistress who caused his mother’s death. A vicious look flashed past his eyes. He said reluctantly, \"Dad, you have to hold on. Don’t let yourself be angry anymore. I-I’ll tell you. Just listen carefully.\"","Then, he looked at Second Old Madam Li and pouted at Li Jun. \"You’re young. Hold her properly.\"","Second Old Madam? Pah! The older she got, the more shameless she became!","\"Hurry up and say it, Ronghuan. I beg you.\" He should hurry up and say it while the old master was still awake and Jun was around.","Second Old Madam Li was a little anxious.","\"I found out something. The female soldier who was killed in the past gave birth to a daughter after she went back. Her daughter was quite successful and even got into the military school. The lower level received an order to investigate the female soldier’s death again. The female soldier’s daughter used her own efforts to contact the higher-ups and attracted their attention. That was why they ordered them to investigate the female soldier’s death again.","The moment he spoke, Old Master Li’s eyes widened.","The dead female soldier actually had a daughter!","He had been investigating for so long, but he didn’t manage to find out about this!","\"It’s been so many years, but the case is suddenly being investigated again. I think someone must want to overturn the case. And that person is naturally someone close to her. It took more than ten years before it happened, so I wondered if the female soldier had any children. Now that her child has become successful, she wants to overturn the case.\"","Li Ronghuan didn’t lie to Old Master Li. This was what he thought before the investigation. Heaven was fair, and everyone would get their retribution. Perhaps the victim’s child wanted revenge.","With this lead, he continued to investigate.","\"I found the female soldier’s former comrades but didn’t manage to get anything out of them. The more I couldn’t get anything out of them, the more I suspected that there was something wrong. In the end, I found one of them and spent some money to lure him. Only then did I confirm that the female soldier did have a daughter. I contacted her classmates from the military school.\"","When Second Old Madam Li heard this, sorrow welled up in her heart. \"So, it’s that b*tch who took my son’s life, right? It’s that b*tch, right?\"","Her voice was obviously old, but it was gloomy and stern, making people feel uncomfortable. It was like water that flowed in a gutter all year round. Anyone who came into contact with it would feel cold.","Old Master Li’s breathing was so rapid that there was a thick layer of white mist on his breathing mask. He wanted Li Ronghuan to continue and reveal everything that he knew.","The more anxious they were, the slower Li Ronghuan spoke. Then, he glanced at Madam Li, who had a dark expression on her face. He saw Madam Li panicking for no reason. She said, \"Why are you looking at me?Have you found out who the b*tch is?\"","Li Ronghuan’s eyes darkened. He couldn’t hide the revenge in his eyes. \"Of course. This person has something to do with you.\""]},{"number":5270,"title":"Chapter 5270: Retribution","paragraphs":["Madam Li could see Li Ronghuan’s malicious intent, but she didn’t have the time to expose it. He actually said that the b*tch he found had something to do with her!","What a scoundrel!","Madam Li, who was shocked, had a dark expression on her face. \"What does it have to do with me? Don’t leave us hanging. Tell us!\"","Second Old Madam Li glanced at her daughter. She didn’t believe that the b*tch would have anything to do with her daughter. She was also afraid that Li Ronghuan was deliberately instigating her in front of Old Master Li. She clutched her chest and cried sadly, \"Ronghuan, please, just give it to us straight, okay?\"","\"S-Speak...\"","Old Master Li’s face was exceptionally rosy. It wasn’t because he was in good health but because he was angry.","How could he not know that Li Ronghuan was deliberately dragging it out?","Li Jun, who had been silent all this while, opened his mouth like a venomous snake that had woken up in winter. He stuck out his tongue and revealed his poisonous teeth. \"Second Uncle, if you have something to say, say it. There’s no point in leaving us hanging.","\"You’re so impatient. Fine, I’ll just say it. Be mentally prepared.\" Li Ronghuan, who was keeping Madam Li in suspense, looked at her deeply. Seeing the panic in her eyes, the smile on his face deepened.","Fear? Yes, that was right.","Madam Li saw a strange glint in his eyes. Instantly, the panic in her heart grew. Even her fingers trembled secretly.","Could it be that Li Ronghuan really knew the murderer who killed her younger brother?","Was that possible?","\"The female soldier’s daughter’s surname is Ye. She was placed in Ye Zhifan’s house when she was young. Ye Zhifan has a daughter called Ye Ying...\"","It was as if a thunderclap had exploded, causing Madam Li to sway violently. She was so shocked that she blurted out, \"That’s impossible!\"","\"It’s not impossible. I’ve investigated everything. Ye Ying and Ye Jian are cousins. They’ve never gotten along since they were young. Speaking of which, it’s fate. It’s all thanks to you that Ye Jian got to know you. If Staff Officer Du hadn’t gotten Ye Ying into the military unit, Ye Jian probably wouldn’t have had the chance to see her...\"","His malice was so deep that Madam Li’s face turned pale.","\"Ye Jian has some ability. After entering the military school, she knew that there was a problem with her mother’s death. She investigated all the way and finally alerted the higher-ups. In the end, she found Li Chuhai.","\"My ability is limited too. I can’t tell much. I only know that Li Chuhai was killed at sea because he killed a female soldier back then.\"","\"Chenglan, a big part of why Chuhai died was because of you. If you hadn’t instigated Ye Ying into entering the capital city and let Ye Jian and Ye Ying meet each other, Ye Jian wouldn’t have targeted the Li family and Chuhai wouldn’t have been shot more than ten times. His entire body would’ve been intact, his intestines and internal organs wouldn’t have flowed all over the ground.","\"Chenglan, you were the one who personally sent Chuhai to his death. Alas, the biological sister killed her younger brother. Chuhai died miserably. He didn’t even know that he was actually killed by his biological sister.\"","Second Old Madam Li didn’t know what Li Ronghuan said after that. She fell straight down.","Old Master Li, who was lying down, opened his mouth wide. He made a bubbling sound in his throat. His turbid eyes bulged wider and wider. In the end, the instrument that had been monitoring his body let out a sharp alarm.","The doctor on duty rushed over in a panic when he heard the sound. The nurse was busy saving Second Old Madam Li, who had fainted again. The doctor was busy saving Old Master Li, whose heartbeat was getting slower and slower. One look at his expression and you could tell that he had fainted from anger.","Li Ronghuan looked at the messy ward coldly. He felt more and more happy. If he couldn’t control himself, he would have laughed.","When he saw that the heartbeat on the instrument had changed from a fluctuating line to a straight line, Li Ronghuan lowered his head, and his shoulders trembled violently."]},{"number":5271,"title":"Chapter 5271: Fall","paragraphs":["Li Ronghuan was elated. He was so happy that tears streamed down his face. He was so happy that he cried and laughed at the same time. He completely forgot that he was still in the hospital.","Madam Li, on the other hand, was different. When she saw that the undulating line had become a straight line, she didn’t even care about Second Old Madam Li, who had fainted. She stood by the bed in a panic.","His heart had stopped beating. Old Master Li’s heart... had stopped beating!","\"Hurry up! Hurry up and save him! Hurry up! If something happens to my father, none of you will have it good!\" She shouted at the top of her lungs. She was so flustered that she fell at the end of the bed and stared at Old Master Li, who was lying motionless on the bed. \"Dad, Dad, don’t scare me. Don’t scare me... Don’t scare me...\"","Old Master Li had always been Madam Li’s support. With Old Master Li in the Li family, it was equivalent to the Li family having a backbone. He could support the Li family and protect Madam Li.","Madam Li, who had always been protected by the Li family, knew too well what would happen if Old Master Li fell. The Li family would fall.","Madam Li’s legs were weak. She could only lean against the end of the bed to support herself to stand properly. She kept talking. One moment, she asked the doctor to save him. The next moment, she called out to Old Master Li. Then, she said that she didn’t know Ye Jian’s background. She said many things, but no one paid her any attention.","The doctor was still trying his best to save Old Master Li. The nurse was also helping at the side. Second Old Madam Li was carried to the side and laid down. There was also a nurse and a doctor taking care of her.","As for Li Ronghuan, he was happy.","He was really happy. He was so happy!","He had been thinking about how to take revenge. He had been thinking about it for a long time, but he had never thought of a good idea. He never had the chance to go home and take revenge.","The old man was a ruthless person. Although he was old, it was not a problem for him to casually kill a person. As long as he didn’t die, he would continue to control the Li family and not let the Li family fall easily.","He had been waiting for the day when he could return to the country. He used nearly ten years to build a good relationship with Li Chuhai and used a few years to persuade Li Chuhai to return to the country. He wanted Li Chuhai to destroy the Li family’s foundation first. It would be best if he could do something big and let the country know what he had been doing overseas. He even did his homework and let the country target Li Chuhai before prying into the Li family.","Unexpectedly, Li Chuhai bumped into the blade and lost his life. The journey that followed was unexpectedly smooth. The old man’s health took a fall, and he returned to the country successfully.","Now...","The old man, who had been awe-inspiring his entire life, was angered to death!","Ever since he picked up the phone, he had been thinking about how to tell the old man who had a stroke again. He had been brimming with excitement the entire way over. The more he thought about it, the more excited he became. He couldn’t wait to rush to the hospital and tell the ’good news’ to the old man who had been waiting for the results of the investigation.","The old man would definitely be ’excited’ after hearing this because he finally knew why Li Chuhai died and who killed him.","As for Li Chenglan, if she hadn’t interacted with Ye Zhifan’s family, he wouldn’t have been able to find out that Ye Jian, the daughter of the female soldier who was killed, had met her.","Thanks to Li Chenglan’s actions back then, his ’good news’ became more exciting and perfect.","Wiping away the tears in his eyes, the doctor said regretfully, \"I’m sorry, Mr. Li. We tried our best. My condolences.\"","Condolences?","No, no, no. This called for a celebration!"]},{"number":5272,"title":"Chapter 5272: Shrew","paragraphs":["There was no sorrow on Li Ronghuan’s face. He bent down deeply. He was afraid that the doctors and nurses would see the smile on his face. He had to hide it well.","\"Thank you for your hard work. Thank you.\" He bowed and thanked them sincerely.","As medical staff, they had indeed worked hard. In order to save the old man, they were all sweating profusely. It had been really tough on them.","The doctors and nurses knew that Old Master Li’s condition was up to fate. Although they did their best, they were still worried that the Li family would vent their anger on them and blame them for not fulfilling their responsibilities.","Seeing that Li Ronghuan was so magnanimous and even bowed to thank them, the doctor heaved a sigh of relief.","He felt terrible that he didn’t manage to save the patient. However, he needed the understanding of the patient’s family members. It wasn’t that the medical staff didn’t try their best. They had really tried their best, but there was nothing they could do.","However, Madam Li didn’t react the same. After the announcement that Old Master Li’s heart had stopped beating, Madam Li was stunned. Then, she pounced on Old Master Li and shouted sorrowfully with red eyes.","Old Master Li doted on the daughter and son whom he had with his second wife more than on his first wife’s two sons.","Madam Li’s sorrow was real. The father and daughter had a good relationship, but they were suddenly separated. Even though Doctor Li had told her to be mentally prepared, she still couldn’t accept it.","She lay on the bed and cried sorrowfully. Li Ronghuan bent down to thank the doctor. Before Li Ronghuan could straighten his back, Madam Li suddenly rushed up to the doctor crazily and slapped the doctor’s face. She wanted to hit him again, but Li Ronghuan spun her to the side. \"Li Chenglan, calm down!!\"","\"Me? Calm down? Li Ronghuan, stop pretending! Tell me! Did you collude with this quack doctor? Did you not want to save Dad? You couldn’t wait for Dad to leave, right? You must have colluded with the quack doctor to kill Dad on purpose!","Madam Li’s hair was disheveled and she was screaming. The entire intensive care unit was filled with her voice. The doctor who was slapped wanted to speak up for himself, but when he thought about how the patient’s family members had lost control of their emotions, he endured it.","A few nurses felt that it was unfair for their doctor. They wanted to stand up and say a few words, but the doctor on duty pulled them away and sighed. \"Forget it. Let’s go out.\"","Li Ronghuan didn’t indulge Madam Li. \"You angered Dad to death, but you’re framing the doctor instead. Li Chenglan, your mother and you liked using this trick decades ago. Even after decades, you’re still the same. You haven’t changed at all! You’re still disgusting!\"","He then turned around and apologized to the doctor on duty who had been wronged. \"Doctor, you’ve suffered grievances. I apologize to you. It’s our fault. It has nothing to do with you.","\"When she calms down, I’ll ask her to apologize to you.\"","Madam Li, who was thrown to the side, exploded again when she heard that she had to apologize. \"Apologize? These quacks are the ones who killed Dad. I want to sue them! I must sue them!\"","Li Ronghuan’s attitude was very good. The doctor on duty looked at Madam Li and sighed. \"There’s no need to apologize. I can understand your feelings. This is a hospital. Let’s control ourselves. Calm down.\""]},{"number":5273,"title":"Chapter 5273: Cold Wind","paragraphs":["The doctor didn’t dare to ask Madam Li to apologize.","As for getting slapped... Forget it. Old Master Li had passed away. As his daughter, she naturally felt bad. He could understand why she lost control of her emotions.","With Li Ronghuan around, the doctors and nurses removed the various instruments on Old Master Li to prevent them from being destroyed by Madam Li, who had lost control of her emotions.","Madam Li, who was stopped, wanted to pounce on the doctor a few times to settle the score, but she was stopped by Li Ronghuan. Li Ronghuan’s face was scratched by Madam Li.","Madam Li, who had been raised outside until she was in her teens, entered the Li residence late. No matter how carefully she was groomed, no matter how noble and elegant she was, her vulgarity had long been planted in her bones. Now that she was making a fuss, the doctors and nurses stopped looking at her.","They could understand the pain of losing a family member, but her actions were so extreme that it was unacceptable.","\"It’s all because you quacks didn’t save my father properly. You caused his death. Our Li family will definitely not let you off! Li Ronghuan, stand aside. Don’t pretend to be a good person here! Doctor Li, find Doctor Li for me! Quacks, you quacks...\"","She continued to yell. The doctors buried their heads when packing up the equipment while the nurses focused on what they were doing. All of them moved quickly and finished packing up after a while.","The doctors and nurses bowed deeply to Old Master Li before leaving the ICU.","As for Doctor Li, who had been in charge of Old Master Li, he was currently undergoing a large-scale surgery and did not participate in the rescue. Old Master Li, who woke up yesterday, was in good spirits. No matter how good Doctor Li’s medical skills were, he could not have expected something to happen to Old Master Li early in the morning.","After the medical staff left, Li Ronghuan let go of Madam Li and calmly took out his phone to inform the relevant personnel.","When Second Old Madam Li woke up, she heard her daughter crying. Her mind was throbbing in pain. She opened her eyes with some effort and muttered, \"Chenglan.\" She was in a daze and didn’t know where she was.","As she got older, her reactions became especially slow. It was not until she heard Li Ronghuan say, \"Your father-in-law is dead. Take the time to come to the hospital,\" that Second Old Madam Li woke up.","\"Old Master, what’s wrong? Don’t scare me. Old Master, wake up, wake up...\"","Compared to Madam Li, Second Old Madam Li, who had always treated Old Master Li as her sky, had really fallen. Other than shouting for Old Master Li, she did nothing else.","\"Mom, Dad left. Dad left just now... Mom... Dad left. He was killed by a group of quack doctors.\" Madam Li, who was crying miserably, added fuel to the fire and blamed the doctors for Old Master Li’s death.","It seemed that this was the only way she could feel better and accept Old Master Li’s passing.","How could Li Ronghuan let her have her way? After informing Staff Officer Du, he snorted. \"You killed his favorite son. The old man couldn’t accept it and was angered to death by you.","\"As I said before, this was a big matter. I asked the old man to calm down first, but the two of you thought that I was doing it on purpose and even pretended to be pitiful in front of the old man to coax him to force me.","\"Li Chenglan, you’re already 60 years old. Why do you still like to shirk responsibility?","\"Why did Li Chuhai die? Why did Ye Jian target Li Chuhai? It’s all because you brought Ye Ying to your side back then. That’s why everything happened. Without you, with Ye Jian’s ability as an orphan, what could she have found out? It was impossible for her to find out in her entire life!\""]},{"number":5274,"title":"Chapter 5274: Closer","paragraphs":["Madam Li wanted to make herself feel better, but Li Ronghuan would never allow that. He wanted to turn the Li family upside down. He wanted to uproot the rotten tree that had long decayed.","Back then, he still remembered clearly how the mistress forced her way into the Li family step by step, pushing aside the first wife.","After enduring for decades, he finally endured until the Li family got unlucky. How could he let these people who forced his mother to her death have a good time?","Now that the old man was dead, it was time for the rest to go with him.","Madam Li was most afraid of Li Ronghuan mentioning that she was the one who killed her younger brother, Li Chuhai. Thinking about it carefully, it seemed that things started happening to her younger brother, Li Chuhai, after she got to know Ye Zhifan.","The more she thought about it, the more flustered she became. She didn’t dare to face the reality of it and couldn’t calm down. She wondered if something had gone wrong. Was Li Ronghuan deliberately saying this to set her up?","Second Old Madam Li was a successful person who had fought all the way to the end. She treated Old Master Li as her god, coaxing him into handing over control of the family affairs to her. Even the two sons left by his original wife were given to her to raise. She had the means and strategies to coax Old Master Li until his final breath.","Old Master Li might believe that his youngest son was killed by his daughter, but Second Old Madam Li didn’t.","How could her daughter harm her son? The siblings had been relying on each other since they were young and helped each other to defeat the two sons of the first wife. How could such a good pair of siblings harm each other?","Even if Li Ronghuan came up with 10,000 excuses reasons, she wouldn’t believe him.","Hearing this, Second Old Madam Li, who had cried until she fainted, calmed down. She turned her head and stared at Li Ronghuan with vicious eyes. \"Ronghuan, the old master has just left. Are you so eager to force your sister to her death?","\"The Li family doesn’t have the old master anymore, but there’s still me! With me around, you can’t be presumptuous! The Li family can’t allow you to be presumptuous either!\"","Second Old Madam Li was a little afraid now. She even regretted letting Li Ronghuan enter the family and letting Old Master Li hand over some of the Li family’s connections to Li Ronghuan.","She was afraid that Li Ronghuan would use his connections to squeeze her out of the Li family and take away everything that originally belonged to her and Li Jun. Hence, she had to let Li Ronghuan know that even if Old Master Li had left, she was still around. She couldn’t allow anyone to be impudent.","No one could take the Li family away from her!","Li Ronghuan seemed to have seen through what Second Old Madam Li was thinking. The corners of his lips curled up slightly, revealing a strange smile that even Second Old Madam Li could not guess. \"The Li family? I haven’t returned to the Li family for more than ten years. What do you think I’ll do to the Li family? Alright, you can do whatever you want with the Li family. After I’m done arranging the funeral, I’ll leave the Li family immediately.","\"Now, I’m just in charge of what I should be responsible for as a son. I’ll inform all the Li family members and the old man’s subordinates about his passing. After he’s buried, the Li family’s old residence will be under your control.\"","Second Old Madam Li didn’t believe it. The Li family was a big family. Would he, Li Ronghuan, think of giving up on this big piece of pie?","Ha, if he really wanted to give up, he wouldn’t have returned to the Li family when the old master’s health took a fall!","His wild ambition was to return for the Li family!","\"Li Ronghuan, do you dare to swear to the old master that you don’t want anything that belongs to the Li family? Do you dare? Do you dare to kneel and swear? Do you dare to repeat what you just said in front of the old master?\" Second Old Madam Li pressed on, forcing Li Ronghuan to swear. She wanted to know if Li Ronghuan wanted to fight for the Li family."]},{"number":5275,"title":"Chapter 5275: Big Trouble","paragraphs":["How difficult was it to kneel and swear?","After all, the old master was his biological father. Even though Old Master Li didn’t do his duty as a father, everyone knew that Li Ronhuan was the old master’s son. Now that the old man was dead, Li Ronghuan had to kneel.","It was not difficult to kneel, let alone swear.","He just had to swear that he didn’t want anything that belonged to the Li family!","Li Ronghuan really knelt down and kowtowed three times. He swore so obediently that Madam Li couldn’t believe it.","Second Old Madam Li didn’t expect Li Ronghuan to really kneel and swear. She wanted to see something from Li Ronghuan’s face, but she couldn’t tell what he was thinking.","She couldn’t trust him even though he had knelt and sworn!","Second Old Madam Li, who had plotted her entire life to snatch the Li family’s treasures, naturally wouldn’t believe it.","Li Ronghuan didn’t care if she believed him or not. After swearing, he kowtowed three more times. He then stood up and turned around. He didn’t have any intention of staying.","When he reached the door of the ICU, he thought of something and turned around again. The facial expressions of the mother and daughter guarding Old Master Li tensed up again. They stared at Li Ronghuan as he turned around, guarding against him like he was a jackal.","\"Inform Li Jun yourself. I don’t want anyone to think that I want to harm Li Jun.\" After saying the last sentence, Li Ronghuan left for real.","After walking out of the hospital, Li Ronghuan returned to the hotel. He opened a bottle of red wine to celebrate. After drinking a glass of red wine, he remembered that he had forgotten to inform the most important person.","How could he have forgotten about his nephew, Li Jinnian?","He took out his phone and immediately sent a message to Li Jinnian, telling him that the tree of the Li family had already been uprooted. The old man had passed away, so Li Jinnian should see if he could take leave to come back for the old man’s funeral. Li Ronghuan wanted to have a drink with his nephew.","The contents of the message were very happy and not sad at all.","On the other hand, Staff Officer Du, who had received the news of his father-in-law’s death, rushed to the hospital from the General Staff Department. Du Jiayi, who had been locked up for two days, also received the news. She staggered out of the house and cried all the way to the hospital.","Madam Li’s two sons and two daughters received the news. Her eldest son and daughter were not in the capital city. It would take some time for them to rush back.","The Du family members all rushed to the hospital. When Old Master Li’s direct descendants received the news, they gasped in shock. Their greatest backer... had fallen!","Didn’t they say that they had already been rescued?","Why... did he leave just like that?","They quickly rushed to the hospital and arranged Old Master Li’s funeral.","Commander Xia was a little surprised when he found out that Old Master Li passed away at around 10:00 am. \"Didn’t they say that he had gotten better? Why did he leave just like that? Did you find out anything?\"","\"They said that Li Ronghuan said something that caused Old Master Li to die. The doctors were tight-lipped, and the nurses only revealed a little. They said that Madam Li caused Li Chuhai’s death.\"","The Li family has always been under surveillance, but the situation became somewhat relaxed after Old Master Li suffered a stroke. There were some moves regarding Li Ronghuan’s return to China, and Commander-in-Chief Xia also knew about it.","Li Ronghuan had told Li Jinnian his purpose for returning to the country. Li Jinnian immediately told Xia Jinyuan, and Xia Jinyuan told Commander Xia. Knowing Li Ronghuan’s purpose of returning to China, they knew that what he did was indeed to bring down the Li family. Only after several incidents did Commander Xia believe that Li Ronghuan’s return to China was just to bring down the Li family, and he no longer kept a close eye on Li Ronghuan.","Commander Xia didn’t know that Li Ronghuan had investigated Ye Jian.","When he heard the name ’Li Chuhai’, Commander Xia’s expression turned cold. \"Investigate what happened at that time. The sooner, the better!\"","Madam Li caused Li Chuhai’s death? Why did Li Ronghuan suddenly mention this?"]},{"number":5276,"title":"Chapter 5276: Investigation","paragraphs":["Commander Xia wasn’t worried about Li Ronghuan suddenly mentioning that Madam Li was the one who killed Li Chuhai. He was worried that Ye Jian would be implicated.","If it weren’t for Ye Jian, they wouldn’t have investigated what happened 20 years ago.","Ye Jian played a crucial role in bringing Li Chuhai to justice.","The Li family had been secretly investigating who ’killed’ Li Chuhai. They even sent people to Ye Jian’s hometown to investigate. Fortunately, they were prepared and had erased all the information about the martyr Red Plum. That was why the people Old Master Li sent didn’t find anything.","Almost three years had passed. It had been more than a year since Ye Jian graduated from the military school. Li Ronghuan, who returned to the country with a goal, suddenly brought up the past. In the end, he even angered Old Master Li to death. Commander Xia had to be wary.","They couldn’t get anything out of the doctors and nurses.","The only people from whom they could pry the truth out were the workers guarding the entrance of the ICU to take care of Old Master Li. Commander Xia wanted to see if they could pry anything out of them.","Commander Xia was still investigating the truth when Li Jinnian, who returned to his dormitory to rest in the afternoon, took off his training uniform and went to the attached bathroom to take a shower. He took a green towel to dry his hair. His upper body was bare as he walked to the wardrobe and took out a clean short-sleeved shirt.","His cold gaze inadvertently glanced at the phone that hadn’t been turned on for a few days. He pursed his thin lips slightly and picked up the phone that had been sitting there for a few days.","The first notification came to view. Li Jinnian’s hand that was holding the cell phone froze for a few seconds. His fingertips stopped pressing the buttons for a few seconds. Before he could decide if he should open the message or not, a second and third message came.","This was his personal cell phone number. Besides the people closest to him, no one would disturb him. Hence, even though his cell phone had not been turned on for a few days, he only received a few messages.","The second and third messages appeared. Li Jinnian, who always had a good memory, immediately recognized the number.","He pressed the phone button with his fingers. Two messages with a lot of information entered his eyes. They came so suddenly that his pupils constricted.","The head of the Li family, his grandpa, passed away this morning. He didn’t die of illness. Instead, he was... angered to death.","The news came too suddenly. Li Jinnian had already forgotten the first message. After reading the two messages, Li Jinnian, who was only wearing a short-sleeved shirt, broke out in a cold sweat.","It was said that the old master found out why Li Chuhai’s case from 20 years ago could still be investigated again and in the end, he was killed. It was said that Li Ronghuan deliberately provoked the old man and made him think that Li Chuhai was killed by Madam Li. The reason was... Madam Li was the only person in the family who had come into contact with the person who brought Li Chuhai to justice.","Old Master Li, who had been unable to accept the fact that his youngest son was killed at sea, was already weak and could not be stimulated anymore. However, the results of Li Ronghuan’s investigation were too stimulating. He could not catch his breath and died.","Li Jinnian could accept everything else, including Old Master Li’s death.","The only unacceptable thing was that Li Ronghuan found out that Madam Li was the only person in the Li family who had come into contact with the person who brought Li Chuhai to justice.","This person was none other than his only cousin, Ye Jian!","Li Jinnian, who remembered Li Ronghuan’s cell phone number but had never taken the initiative to contact him, immediately contacted Li Ronghuan. He needed to confirm if Li Ronghuan had found out about his cousin, Ye Jian! He needed to know if Li Ronghuan had said Ye Jian’s name in front of the Li family."]},{"number":5277,"title":"Chapter 5277: Prevention","paragraphs":["The long beeping sound meant that no one was picking up. Even when it ended automatically, the call was not answered. Li Jinnian’s eyes were cold as he called back again. No one picked up even after three times.","Li Jinnian made a prompt decision and called Commander Xia’s private cell phone. Li Ronghuan couldn’t be contacted for the time being, but he could tell Commander Xia his guess!","Commander Xia had Li Jinnian’s number saved in his personal phone. He was waiting for the results of the investigation. When he saw who the caller was, he waved his hand and interrupted the admin officer’s report. He immediately picked up his phone and answered the call.","With Li Jinnian’s guess, they could basically confirm that Li Ronghuan had indeed found out about Ye Jian. Commander Xia, who was standing by the window, said in a low voice, \"Don’t worry, I’ll handle this matter. Old Master Li has passed away, and Little Ye’s biggest threat has been removed. Staff Officer Du is watching Madam Li closely. She won’t act rashly.","\"If she dares to touch Ye Jian, she won’t be the first to be attacked by the military. It’ll be her husband. Although Old Du has some problems with me, he’s also a person with strong principles.","\"Back then, Madam Li asked him to help Li Chuhai. When Old Du found out that Li Chuhai had done those things, he almost said that he wanted to kill Li Chuhai. For his own sake, he’ll keep an eye on Madam Li.","\"You don’t have to worry too much about Second Old Madam Li. Old Master Li has never liked Second Old Madam Li interfering in his business. His subordinates don’t have any private dealings with her either. She might want to use the connections Old Master Li left behind to deal with Little Ye, but she won’t have the power to do so.","\"These people have all relied on Old Master Li. Now that the tree has fallen, their direct line of descent has been dealt with a big blow. They can’t even take care of themselves. They won’t listen to Second Old Madam Li’s arrangements to deal with Ye Jian.","\"The only worrying variable is Li Chuhai’s son and daughter. Li Jun, who came back early in the morning the day before yesterday, is missing. We know that he returned to the Li family’s old residence after leaving the hospital. We’re still investigating the entire city to see if he has left. We’re also monitoring the airport and the train station.\"","Old Master Li had passed away, but Li Chuhai’s son, Li Jun, was missing. Even Madam Li couldn’t contact Li Jun.","Commander Xia had seen Li Jun before. He was a young man with handsome facial features but extremely gloomy eyes. As for Li Chuhai’s daughter... Commander Xia still hadn’t found out where she was or what she looked like.","Li Chuhai’s anti-reconnaissance awareness was very strong. From the moment his children were born, he had been secretly protecting them. He even adopted a son and a daughter to confuse others. He even hid the truth from Old Master Li and Second Old Madam Li. His schemes were so deep that it made people tremble.","In that case, were the children he raised good or bad? From Li Jun’s photo, it could be seen that he was not a good person.","The military had investigated Li Jun. As he had always lived overseas and was well protected by Li Chuhai, they couldn’t find anything on him. Now that he had disappeared from the capital city, Commander Xia had already included him in the main investigation.","It was fine if he was still in the country, but if he wasn’t... it would be difficult.","Li Jinnian, who was looking down, was silent for a while. His voice was cold as he said, \"There’s no difference between inside and outside the country. The difference lies in where the other party is.\"","Commander Xia immediately understood what he meant.","\"At the moment, we can’t confirm if he’ll cause any real harm to Little Ye. Hence, we can’t take coercive measures against him. You don’t have to panic. Remember, I’m in the capital city. The Xia family is here.\""]},{"number":5278,"title":"Chapter 5278: Human Heart","paragraphs":["There was no mention of the Fu family. Old Master Fu and Fu Yusheng were both scientific researchers. Although they had a wide network and knew all the important scientists, they were experts in scientific research. In other aspects, they were average.","This was also why Old Master Fu specially looked for Grandpa Xia and personally told the Xia family that his only granddaughter would be under the Xia family’s protection.","That was because Old Master Fu knew that once something happened to Ye Jian, the Xia family would be the first to step in.","Li Jinnian was indeed a little flustered. He had always been calm, but this concerned his only cousin, Ye Jian. He couldn’t remain calm.","Now that Commander Xia had voiced his support, he felt much calmer.","\"After you finish what you’re doing, return to the capital city as soon as possible and interact more with Li Ronghuan. He’s responsible for the Li family’s successive accidents in the past few months.\"","Commander Xia also treated Li Jinnian as his junior. He only had to remind Li Jinnian a little to understand what he meant.","That night, Li Jinnian left the military unit in a car and took a 5:30 am flight back to the capital city. At this moment, Old Master Li’s funeral was arranged in an orderly manner.","Second Old Madam Li had been accompanying Old Master Li the entire time. She seemed to have aged ten years instantly. Everyone who came to visit would tell Second Old Madam Li to take care of herself.","Second Old Madam Li, who thanked the guests, seemed to be choking back tears. Anyone who saw her like that would sigh. They would not be able to help but say, \"Madam, if you have any difficulties in the future and need our help, please feel free to ask.\"","People often sympathized with the weak. Respecting the old and loving the young was a Chinese virtue. Second Old Madam Li was an ’old lady’ that needed to be respected now. Everyone would feel bad for an old lady like her? Old Master Li was no longer around, so his subordinates would naturally respect Second Old Madam Li.","As for whether Second Old Madam Li would need their help with anything, with their current status, they would be able to help as long as it wasn’t a big matter.","What could happen to the old madam, who was at home all year round, serving the old master? It was just about how the Li family’s assets were divided.","That was what they all thought. Hence, they naturally said such things to her.","This was what Second Old Madam Li wanted them to say.","She instructed Madam Li to remember these people so that it would be easier to contact them later. She wanted them to stand on her side. She would not let outsiders take advantage of the Li family.","Li Jinnian’s father was very cold to her actions.","How far could the Li family go? The higher they went, the clearer Mr. Li became. In addition, he had already built his own path and had long escaped Old Master Li’s control. Whether the Li family was around or not made no difference to Mr. Li.","Second Old Madam Li just wanted the Li family’s assets. She really didn’t think that she could support the Li family.","After Old Master Li left, everyone’s hopes dissipated. They were all smart people. Who would work for an old woman?","She was the only one who thought that she could succeed and took other people’s pleasantries seriously. She thought that everyone would give her some face on account of the old master.","Mr. Li looked coldly at his stepmother’s various cheap shots. He retracted his gaze and ignored her. Li Ronghuan was the same. The two brothers didn’t like the Li family at all, but this actually brought unprecedented harmony to the Li family."]},{"number":5279,"title":"Chapter 5279: Home","paragraphs":["Even when Li Jinnian came back, no one mentioned how the Li family’s assets were distributed. They seemed to have forgotten about Old Master Li’s inheritance.","The more they acted like this, the more guarded Second Old Madam Li became, especially when she saw the stern and cold Li Jinnian coming back. When she saw Li Jinnian’s face that looked like the late first madam, ruthlessness flashed past her eyes.","She only took one look before retracting her gaze. She wiped her tears with a handkerchief. The entire process only took a few seconds.","Li Jinnian, who felt the malicious intent, glanced at her indifferently. He then knelt down and kowtowed three times. After offering incense, he stood at the side. He had come back travel-worn, but his figure was still like a pine tree. The guests who came to the Li residence couldn’t help but take a few more glances. They felt that Old Master Li had a worthy successor.","\"This is Jinnian, right? I met you once more ten years ago. I didn’t expect you to become an indomitable man in the blink of an eye. The old master mentioned you a few times in front of me and sounded quite proud. From the looks of it today, I finally understand why the old master was so proud. With you in the Li family in the future, we’ll be at ease.\"","The person who said this was a subordinate that Old Master Li had taken good care of. He naturally knew some things about the Li family. He knew very well why Old Master Li didn’t like his eldest grandson. However, he needed a member of the Li family who could reassure the people’s hearts.","In that case, Li Jinnian would become a chess piece in these people’s hands. They wanted to make use of him.","They wanted to let certain people see that the Li family still had a leader and was not easy to mess with so that those who had been secretly trying to disintegrate the Li faction’s power would feel fearful. It would also give these people from the Li faction some breathing space.","Unfortunately, Li Jinnian wasn’t interested in that. Before he could speak, Madam Li wiped her tears and said, \"Jinnian, you just came back. You must be tired. Go change your clothes and rest first. I still need your help with the rest. You have to take good care of yourself.\"","The people who came today were all Old Master Li’s subordinates. Second Old Madam Li and Madam Li didn’t want Li Jinnian to appear.","Li Ronghuan stood up and sighed. \"She’s right. Let’s rest for a while.\"","Li Jinnian didn’t even have the chance to say anything before they left.","Old Master Li’s body was in the Li family’s old residence. The old residence was an ancestral home, and the place was spacious. Even though there were many guests coming and going these two days, it didn’t seem crowded. Li Jinnian didn’t care how many people came to the old residence. He only cared about what Li Ronghuan had found out.","After going upstairs, Li Jinnian didn’t beat about the bush. With a calm expression, he asked the question he wanted to ask.","\"Do you want to know who the daughter of a female soldier is? What’s the matter? Do you want to take revenge for Li Chuhai?\" Li Ronghuan teased. \"That won’t do. I won’t agree.\"","Li Jinnian didn’t say anything. He just glanced at Li Ronghuan, who was teasing him. His handsome face was a little cold.","That disdainful look made Li Ronghuan laugh. After laughing, he said earnestly, \"It’s not that I don’t want to tell you, but I just don’t think there’s a need to add to your problem. Do you really want to know?\"","\"I don’t have any thoughts about the Li family. I just want to know what you did and what you investigated.\"","If Li Ronghuan didn’t say Ye Jian’s name directly, Li Jinnian wouldn’t say it rashly either. He used a tone that showed his distrust for Li Ronghuan, making Li Ronghuan speechless for a long time.","So, everything he said in the past was treated as nonsense!"]},{"number":5280,"title":"Chapter 5280: Siblings","paragraphs":["Li Ronghuan, who looked furious, raised his hand and pretended to point at Li Jinnian fiercely to make himself feel better before speaking.","\"I’m not sure. How can I find out about the things in the military? I just suspect that the female soldier’s daughter took revenge for her mother. If not, why would the matter from 20 years ago be brought up again? The descendant of the female soldier must have done something to overturn the case.\"","After he finished speaking, he glared at his nephew who didn’t believe him. \"No one in the Li family, including your father, is good. But you have to believe me, your uncle!","\"You always look like you suspect that I’ll harm you. Just looking at you like this makes you angry. Come, come, come. What else do you want to know? I’ll tell you in one go so that you won’t have to guess.\"","\"Who’s the descendant of the female soldier?\"","\"Her surname is Ye. She graduated from the military school. I don’t know where she’s serving now.\"","\"What’s her full name?\"","\"Ye Jian. Do you want to chase after her?\" Li Ronghuan mocked. He was so angry. Why didn’t this kid believe him?","Li Jinnian frowned. \"Did you say her name yesterday?\"","\"If I didn’t say her name, how could I anger the old man? How could I drag Li Chenglan down?\" Li Ronghuan replied with a cold expression. \"Li Chenglan was the first person to meet Ye Jian. She almost became in-laws with Ye Jian’s uncle. If I didn’t say it, the old man wouldn’t have believed me.\"","This meant Ye Jian had been found out by the Li family.","Taking a deep breath, Li Jinnian opened the door. \"I’ll rest for a while. See yourself out.\"","Li Ronghuan walked to the door, but he was unwilling to give up. He suddenly turned around and glared at Li Jinnian before leaving angrily.","This kid had the ability to make people explode in anger.","Li Jinnian closed the door and called Commander Xia, telling him everything he knew. Commander Xia also told him that Li Jun had already taken a plane and left the country. It was very likely that Old Master Li knew that he didn’t have much time left and sent Li Jun off in advance.","Li Jun, who had left the country, was already sitting in an extended Lincoln. The person who picked him up was a young lady whose facial features were highly similar to his. She was dressed sweetly like a girl next door.","She sized up her brother, who was born two minutes earlier than her, and took out the lollipop in her mouth. She smiled and asked in fluent English, \"Now that we know who killed Dad, why are you still unhappy? You should smile to show your happiness.\"","\"Ye Jian. It’s a very simple Chinese name. It’s so interesting. Her name is two words. Our names are two words too. We’re fated. Dad killed her mother, and she killed Dad. Next, we’ll kill her. Hehe, in the end, we’ll win.\"","The person who spoke was Li Chuhai’s daughter, Li Qin. She and Li Jun were twins. Their biological mother was unknown. They were secretly raised by Li Chuhai. Li Qin was a ruthless person who could stab people with a knife at the age of three.","The expressionless Li Jun peeled a lollipop for himself and placed it in his mouth. When he tasted the sweetness, he suppressed the ruthlessness in his heart. \"She’s a Chinese soldier. It’s very difficult to kill her.\"","\"You’re so stupid. You haven’t even thought of a way to kill her. But you’re right. It’s a little difficult to kill her, but we can kill other people.\"","Li Qin said with a smile. Killing people was as simple as harvesting crops."]},{"number":5281,"title":"Chapter 5281: Sick","paragraphs":["Li Jun, who had left the country, did not contact the Li family. He did not have any feelings for the Li family. Whether Old Master Li was dead or alive had nothing to do with him. The only thing that surprised him was that when the half-dead old man on the bed opened his eyes and saw him, he only said the word ’go’.","Hence, he left.","At first, he didn’t plan to go far. After all, he came to China because he wanted to know who his father’s murderer was. Before he knew who the real murderer was, he didn’t plan to return to China.","Li Jun was not Chinese. He was born and raised in Molaban. He had never thought of himself as a Chinese national. As for his hometown, he only recognized Molaban.","He was unlike the deceased Li Chuhai, who would occasionally mutter about the country and talk about his childhood.","If Li Chuhai hadn’t returned to China and died in the country, Li Jun wouldn’t have been able to step into China’s territory for the rest of his life. It wasn’t that he didn’t want to but that Li Chuhai didn’t want him to.","Li Jun and Li Qin both knew. The siblings knew that their father actually hated their dead grandpa.","Li Qin, who came to fetch him happily, saw that Li Jun wasn’t interested in what she had to say. After thinking for a moment, she smiled and said, \"Be happier now that you’re back. Dad said that he didn’t have any feelings for that place. Since that very bad old man is dead, there’s no need for you to go to China in the future.","\"Now that we know who killed Dad, you don’t have to go to China anymore. Why are you still unhappy? I’m happy. You should be happy too.\"","The stretch Lincoln drove past the flat asphalt road. The scenery on both sides retreated all the way. What entered his eyes was the scenery that Li Jun was most familiar with.","He tilted his head and stared outside without blinking. There was no expression on his face, but the air around him was so cold that the driver couldn’t help but grip the steering wheel tightly.","Li Qin, who was holding a lollipop in her mouth, looked around. She couldn’t see anything. She pursed her lips and bit the round lollipop until it seemed to break.","Then, Li Jun bit the lollipop in his mouth until it made a crisp sound. The siblings exuded the same cold aura.","\"I’m thinking about how we can lure the Chinese soldier who killed Dad out. We definitely won’t have a chance to take revenge if she stays in the Chinese military unit. We only have a chance if she comes out.\"","Li Jun opened his mouth. His voice was like the hiss of a venomous snake. \"Is there a way to let her leave Chinese territory? If she leaves Chinese territory, we’ll have a chance.\"","As soon as he finished speaking, Li Qin giggled as if she had heard a huge joke. \"If I remember correctly, Chinese soldiers can’t leave Chinese territory casually. You’re too naive. If Dad knew, he would be so angry that he wouldn’t give you food for three days.\"","After she finished speaking, she placed her hands on her cheeks. Her clear and bright eyes were like black grapes glistening with water. \"Don’t be too anxious. We need to take it slow. We’ll definitely have a chance to kill that woman.\"","The pink tip of her tongue licked a sharp canine tooth in her mouth. Li Qin’s eyes flickered with a cold light. \"I’ve never killed a Chinese soldier before. I think it’ll feel wonderful.\"","She giggled again. Her appearance was beautiful and sweet. Even her laughter was sweet. It was so sweet that people couldn’t help but laugh with her. However, her eyes were cold and sinister. There was a sickly madness in them.","Li Jun tilted his head and glanced at her. After a long time, he revealed a faint smile. It was also cold and sinister."]},{"number":5282,"title":"Chapter 5282: Heartbreak","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, whom the siblings were talking about, was still training hard. She trained with the male soldiers until she no longer looked like an army soldier. She had completely become an air force soldier.","The Li family made Old Master Li’s funeral solemn and grand. The guests who came to pay their respects were all famous people in the capital city, including the guests from other provinces. After three days, Old Master Li was cremated and buried. During this period of time, Second Old Madam Li would faint and wake up repeatedly.","In the late autumn in the capital city, the fallen leaves were rustling. The wind blowing along the ground would pick up a few yellow leaves, which were then blown away once more.","Old Master Li’s fame and fortune were all gone after he died. Old Master Li, who had been obsessed with power his entire life, had become a pile of dust. From then on, no one would be able to see Old Master Li through the cold tombstone.","Staff Officer Du placed the white chrysanthemums in front of the tombstone and knelt down to kowtow three times. His heart, which had been tense since Li Chuhai was killed, finally relaxed. It was so relaxed that he couldn’t help but heave a sigh of relief.","His sigh was loud enough for Madam Li, who was kneeling, to hear. When Madam Li, who had a sorrowful facial expression, heard this, she turned her head fiercely and looked at him angrily. \"You’ve been hoping for my father to die early. Now, your wish has finally come true, right? You’re finally relieved, right?","She lowered her voice as she questioned him. Her voice was distorted as she was gritting her teeth.","Staff Officer Du frowned. \"Are you crazy? Do you want everyone to see you as a joke?\"","\"My father is dead. As his son-in-law, you knelt in front of my father’s grave and heaved a sigh of relief. Who’s the one who will be laughed at?\" If not for the fact that she was afraid of being laughed at, based on Madam Li’s personality, she would have roared.","Du Kaiwei, who was kneeling behind her, felt the veins on his forehead twitching. \"Mom, do you want to speak up? There are guests waiting to send Grandpa off. If you speak louder, they can hear you too.\"","With Old Master Li gone, not to mention Staff Officer Du, even Du Kaiwei heaved a sigh of relief.","In the future, his mother, who had been doing stupid things ever since his uncle left... should be able to sober up.","Madam Li shut up when her eldest son spoke. When she got up, she saw Li Jinnian standing in front of her. Her eyes, which were red and swollen from crying, flashed with a hint of maliciousness.","In the past few days, everyone had seen Li Jinnian. As the eldest grandson of the Li family, he carried Old Master Li’s photo all the way into the cemetery. No matter how Second Old Madam Li tried to stop Li Jinnian from coming out to meet guests, she couldn’t stop Li Jinnian from not showing his face today.","Li Jinnian was known as Old Master Li’s eldest grandson. However, other than the guests who came to talk to him on the first day, no one else came to connect with him.","He used the simplest and most effective method to tell everyone that he had been chased out of the Li family by Old Master Li a few years ago and refused to admit that he was a descendant of the Li family. He told these people very clearly that he would not get involved in the Li family’s matters in the future.","His declaration made the Li family worried, but made Second Old Madam Li happy.","After the funeral, before Li Ronghuan could have a good chat with Li Jinnian, Du Kaiwei saw with his own eyes that his cousin, who had never relied on the Li family, left the Li residence overnight with the travel bag issued by the navy unit.","Du Kaiwei stood in a daze for a while before returning to the Li family’s old residence. His mother asked the four of them to guard against Li Jinnian from scheming against the Li family’s assets. He thought that Li Jinnian really wanted to monopolize the Li family.","In the end, Li Jinnian didn’t take the family to heart at all and left just like that!"]},{"number":5283,"title":"Chapter 5283: Heartless","paragraphs":["After entering the living room, he heard Du Jiayi talking about how bad Li Jinnian was while leaning against Second Old Madam Li. He probably came back thinking about the Li family’s assets. Du Kaiwei’s expression darkened as he rushed in and scolded Du Jiayi, \"Li Jinnian has left the Li residence with his bag, but you, someone with the surname Du, hasn’t left the Li residence. I think you’re the scum with ulterior motives!\"","Du Jiayi’s face turned pale. She did not dare to speak for a long time.","Li Jinnian used his actions to tell everyone that he was not interested in anything in the Li family. Everything in the Li family had nothing to do with him.","Li Ronghuan flicked the cigarette butt between his fingers, and the red ash fell to the ground. He turned to look at the man standing beside him. He sneered, \"The father and son are at odds with each other. Heh, you deserve it. That year, your mistress used some small tricks, and you really thought that Jinnian was my son.","\"I really want Jinnian to be my son. If he were my son, I’d give him the stars if he wanted them!\"","The man standing beside Li Ronghuan was none other than Li Jinnian’s biological father, Li Rongtian.","Li Rongtian retracted his gaze coldly and glanced at Li Ronghuan. He said calmly, \"Go and ask him if he wants to be your son. As long as he agrees, I have no objections.\"","After he finished speaking, Li Rongtian left. There were two people waiting for him in front.","One was his mistress, and the other was the son he had with his mistress. He was 17 years old this year and had outstanding results. There was no need for Li Rongtian to think about a son who had fallen out with him and hated him since he was young.","The wind blew, and the leaves on the branches rustled. The shadows of the branches on the wall were like monsters that crawled out of cracks. They could pounce on people at any time.","Another day passed, and the chaos in the Li family had just begun.","When the capital city welcomed the first snow of winter, Ye Jian, who was training in the southwest, had already trained herself into an airborne soldier. She didn’t look like an army soldier anymore.","Now, she was part of the female soldier class of the air force. She was also the only female soldier who could suppress the male soldiers.","She was already a famous person in the military unit. Everyone knew that there was a powerful female soldier in the female soldier class. After being transferred from the army for less than a year, she suppressed the real airborne soldiers. The soldiers didn’t feel good about it.","The consequences they faced were not good either. Captain Lei had trained them until their muscles were bulging.","At this moment, the male and female soldiers were completing their airborne search in the snow. The commander at the foot of the mountain raised his binoculars and looked for figures in the pure white world. He put down his binoculars and looked at the person beside him. His heart ached.","\"Major General Yang, do you have to take Little Ye away now? What’s the situation? Why are you in such a hurry?\"","If it wasn’t urgent, he would never let her go.","Major General Yang, who came to fetch Ye Jian, looked at Commander Kong of a certain division in the air force. He saw Commander Kong’s expression that said, ’How dare you snatch her from me? I’ll fight you to the death.’ Major General Yang smiled. \"Commander Kong, Little Ye is a female soldier of my army. Isn’t it normal for me to bring her away? Is it that unless there’s something urgent, I can’t bring Little Ye away?\"","It was clearly a temporary loan, but now, he seemed to be declaring that Major General Yang shouldn’t try to snatch Ye Jian back from him... It was really infuriating!"]},{"number":5284,"title":"Chapter 5284: Fight","paragraphs":["Major General Yang didn’t really rush over from the capital city. He just happened to be on an official mission in a certain Army Aviation regiment in the southwest. He wasn’t far from Ye Jian’s airborne military unit and planned to visit Ye Jian after his work ended.","The work wasn’t over yet. Ye Jian, who had received the military’s order to enter the air force, had to immediately go abroad for a high-risk mission. Her return date was uncertain.","Major General Yang immediately called Ye Jian’s military unit. He found out that Ye Jian wasn’t in the military unit now. She had gone to a low altitude mountain area for winter training. It was inconvenient to tell him her exact location.","She was his soldier, but in the end, she said that it was inconvenient for her to tell him. Major General Yang’s heart was in turmoil. He felt extremely aggrieved.","After contacting Division Commander Kong and knowing the exact location, Major General Yang asked the regimental commander of the Army Aviation. The regimental commander pointed at the military map. Coincidentally, it was two mountains away. It was especially close!","Major General Yang rushed over immediately. When Commander Kong saw Major General Yang, he was shocked.","The first thing he said when they met was, \"Major General Yang, did you get blown over by the wind?\"","The moment he said that, Major General Yang was shocked.","Major General Yang, who was brought here by the wind, felt even more aggrieved. From Commander Kong’s tone, he clearly had other plans!","Commander Kong, who had ’other plans’ but had never gotten what he wanted, coughed and replied seriously, \"That’s right. If it’s not urgent, I really can’t let Little Ye leave. After all, Little Ye is still a member of the female soldier class of the air force. She has training missions. How can she leave so easily?\"","Alas, how good would it be if Little Ye’s file was transferred to the air force with her? Now, he admired Little Ye more and more. He couldn’t bear to let her go. He even secretly hoped that the army would forget to transfer Ye Jian back to their unit.","Would the army forget about Little Ye? Never!","Major General Yang was so angry that he smiled. \"Commander Kong, Little Ye is only here to cooperate with your work. If there’s an emergency in the army, we have the right to transfer Little Ye back at any time. You should keep your thoughts to yourself. Don’t always think about things that you shouldn’t think about.\"","Commander Kog also gave a fake smile and said, \"I suddenly remembered that you used to be a veteran of the Army Aviation regiment in the southwest. I suddenly feel like sparring with you.\"","The Army Aviation was a unit in the army. Major General Yang used to be a soldier of the Army Aviation. Back then, the Xueyu unit was limited to land combat. Later, Major General Yang took over and upgraded the Xueyu unit’s combat area to air combat. He asked every special forces soldier in the Xueyu unit to know how to pilot attack helicopters, transport helicopters, and all kinds of service helicopters. Gradually, even the special forces of the company’s Xueyu unit could operate them.","Major General Yang, who had returned to the old military unit for a business trip, didn’t want to waste time. He flicked the snowflakes on his shoulder and smiled politely. \"Next time. Time is a little tight this time. I need to bring Ye Jian away immediately. I welcome you to find me anytime.\"","Commander Kong was about to crack his teeth from gritting so hard. He really wanted to put a gunny sack on this infuriating major general and bury him in snow. Out of sight, out of mind."]},{"number":5285,"title":"Chapter 5285: Won’t Let Her Go","paragraphs":["Ye Jian, who received the order to go down the mountain, wore a white snow camouflage uniform and carried her disguised rifle down the mountain. Before she reached the two chiefs, she could already feel that the atmosphere between the two chiefs standing side by side in front of her was not very harmonious. It was a subtle tension.","Ye Jian’s footsteps paused for a moment before she quickened her pace and walked over. She stood still and straightened her back. She saluted the soldier. \"Greetings, chiefs!\"","The two chiefs returned the greeting at the same time. Before Commander Kong could speak, Major General Yang, who hadn’t seen Ye Jian for a long time, raised his hand naturally and adjusted Ye Jian’s helmet. His eyes were filled with smiles. \"Not bad, you’re getting more and more energetic.\"","\"Of course. Think about whose military unit she’s in now. How can she not be energetic?\" Commander Kong said with a smile. This was all thanks to their air force .","Ye Jian immediately knew that it wasn’t an illusion that she detected something amiss between the two chiefs just now. The two chiefs had probably finished arguing before she came.","They couldn’t resume their argument. She wouldn’t even know who to help. She might choose to watch silently...","Major General Yang finished adjusting Ye Jian’s helmet. When he turned to look at Commander Kong, his smile instantly faded. \"Old classmate, if something happens to my soldier, I’ll fight you to the death.\"","Old classmate?","The major general and the commander were old classmates?","How were an air force soldier and an army soldier old classmates?","Ye Jian blinked before feeling at ease. So, they were old classmates. No wonder they had a deep relationship.","Commander Kong chuckled at his old classmate who came over to argue with him. He turned his gaze to Ye Jian. His facial expression changed drastically, becoming extremely amiable. \"Little Ye, there’s an urgent mission in the army, and they need to borrow you for a few days. I’ve seen your winter training for the past half a month. Your results are not bad. Your standard is already on par with the male soldiers. You’re much better than the female soldiers. You won’t fall behind even after going out for a few days.","\"After you return your equipment, take a ride with Major General Yang. I won’t send you off. I’ll wait here for you to return to the team.\"","Major General Yang couldn’t help but twitch his eyebrows when he heard that. What did he mean? Lend her for a few days? Wait for her to return to the team? Did he really think that Little Ye was a soldier who came from the air force?","Major General Yang couldn’t be bothered to say anything else. He said to Ye Jian, \"Little Ye, let’s go. I’ll send you to see your comrades from the old military unit.\"","Huh? Huh? Comrades from the old military unit?","Captain Xia?","The comrades of the Xueyu unit?","Ye Jian’s eyes lit up. She nodded vigorously. \"Yes, I’ll return the equipment immediately! Please give me three minutes!\"","\"Okay, hurry up and go!\" Ye Jian’s expression made Major General Yang laugh heartily. See that? She was a female soldier from the army. She had nothing to do with the air force.","Major General Yang was elated while Commander Kong’s heart ached. \"Little Ye, this is your old military unit too. Your comrades are here too. Don’t forget that they’ll be waiting for you to come back.\"","\"You’re a division commander, after all. Why are you acting like a child? Little Ye, quickly return the equipment. I’ll have a good chat with Commander Kong.\"","Ye Jian held back her laughter. She held her gun firmly and shouted, \"Yes.\" She immediately turned around and ran on the pure white snow. Her white back was the same color as the snow, like a white crane dancing in the snow. Her entire body was filled with spiritual energy.","When Ye Jian got into the car, Commander Kong, who was standing outside, didn’t forget to say, \"Little Ye, return to the team early.\"","The expressionless Major General Yang ordered the automobile soldier to roll up the car window. He didn’t want to listen to Commander Kong’s ’nonsense’ anymore."]},{"number":5286,"title":"Chapter 5286: Huge Surprise","paragraphs":["The car left with a bang. Commander Kong stood in the snow with the towering mountains in the background and watched the female soldier, Ye Jian, leave.","Although the air force wasn’t her old military unit, as long as she came back, there would always be a place for her here. The bed she slept in would always be reserved for her.","In the car, Ye Jian’s facial expression was bright. She whispered, \"Major General, were you coaxing me just now? Am I really meeting my comrades?\"","With the automobile soldiers around, Ye Jian couldn’t mention the Xueyu unit.","Major General Yang saw her expectant expression and couldn’t help but smile again. \"I wasn’t coaxing you. You’re indeed meeting your old comrades. Besides them, there’s a group of special comrades who will accompany you.\"","Ye Jian was so happy that she wanted to sing. \"Special comrades? Who?\"","She was happy to see Captain Xia and her comrades from the Xueyu unit again. She was really happy. Her heart felt sweet.","\"You’ll know who they are when you reach the airport. After you arrive, you have to take care of them.\" Major General Yang deliberately didn’t say who the ’special comrades’ were. Ye Jian thought about it for a long time but couldn’t guess who they were.","The car met up with two military Jeeps. After driving for 12 hours, they arrived at the airport at 9:15 pm.","A group of special comrades saw the car coming from the front. One of them was so excited that he said, \"It’s coming, it’s coming, it’s coming. Hurry! Stand properly!\"","\"Look to the right! Attention, at ease!\" A clear and dignified voice pierced through the cold wind and entered the ears of the first female soldier in line.","The neat formation and valiant figures immediately attracted the attention of the tourists who came and went. They didn’t stop to watch. They thought that it was the staff in charge of security at the airport.","The passengers passing by took a few glances and smiled at their friends. \"They’re all female security guards. It’s quite interesting.\"","\"Female security guards are not bad either. They seem quite strong.\"","\"That’s true. If I see them around, I’ll definitely grow more cautious.\"","\"Hahaha, that just means you’re lecherous.\"","\"Hahaha, this is a man’s demeanor. Who would argue with a woman? If it were a man, then it’d be different.\"","They just talked about it casually and didn’t pay much attention to it. Smiling, they walked away as they pushed their luggage.","Ye Jian, who was sitting in the back of the car, couldn’t see what was happening in front. When she pushed the door open and got out of the car, she suddenly felt something. She raised her head abruptly and froze.","They... They...","The car door was half-open. Ye Jian, who didn’t expect the sight in front of her at all, stepped on the ground. One of her feet was still in the car. She didn’t expect her ’special comrades’ to be them.","\"Are you surprised?\" Major General Yang’s smiling voice came from behind. \"They knew that you were the one who’d be leading them and were so happy when they received the order. Unfortunately, only ten of them are here. The ten female soldiers who were left behind were said to be in a bad mood.\"","\"The special comrades you arranged for have really surprised me...\" Ye Jian laughed softly. She pushed open the car door and strode out of the car. The moment she appeared, the ten female soldiers looked at her with tears in their eyes.","\"Salute!\" The squad leader, Yang Zhen, shouted loudly. The female soldiers raised their hands and saluted Instructor Ye, who had trained them and led them to become qualified female special forces soldiers.","Although there were only ten people, their aura was majestic. The moment they saluted, the tourists stopped to watch.","This aura was enough to make people raise their eyebrows."]},{"number":5287,"title":"Chapter 5287: Reunion","paragraphs":["Those who had a little military knowledge would know that the figures standing in the cold wind were saluting. The ten of them moved in unison. All of them were upright and did not lose to men. The cold aura of a soldier was displayed at this moment.","This was how soldiers of a great country should be!","The passengers stopped in their tracks and looked at the identity of the person who got out of the car. A group of female soldiers was standing in the cold wind and saluting.","Those who were closer could tell that the person who got out of the car was a female soldier. Those who were farther away couldn’t tell. They specially walked closer to watch and didn’t dare to get too close. They watched silently from a few meters away and discussed softly.","\"It’s a woman too. She’s probably their leader.\"","\"She’s quite tall. She’s almost 1.7 meters.\"","\"She’s probably very powerful. She’s the one leading the troops.\"","\"They’re all female soldiers. They look quite fresh. Their aura is not bad. They’re not inferior to male soldiers.\"","The sound of discussion rose and fell slightly. After getting out of the car, Ye Jian tightened her abdomen and raised her hand in return.","She looked at their faces one by one. Yang Zhen, Gao Xiao, Qiu Tong, Ding Yue’e, Liu Yizhi, Guan Long, Li Wenqing, Xu Sucheng, Li Xia, and Li Qi. After almost a year, she saw them again.","They were the first batch of female soldiers in the special forces. They were the female soldiers she groomed!","When the female soldiers saw Ye Jian returning the salute, their tense expressions collapsed. They bit their lower lips as tears flowed out.","Yang Zhen walked to Ye Jian’s side. She suppressed her excitement and took a deep breath to calm herself down. \"Reporting, instructor. The female soldier class has gathered. Please give your instructions!\"","Time seemed to have never passed. They were still lined up like before, waiting for their instructor’s instructions.","Ye Jian nodded slightly and silently adjusted her breathing. She looked at them with a gaze that could calm the female soldiers. \"All of you are very good. I don’t have any instructions anymore. All of you are very, very good now.\"","No matter how calm she was, her voice was trembling now.","Special comrades... It was an absolute surprise. She really didn’t expect it to be them. She never thought that she would see them again and lead them again.","Ye Jian was happy, and so were the female soldiers. They hugged her one by one until Ye Jian’s shoulder was wet. Those were the female soldiers’ tears.","\"Alright, alright. Why is everyone crying? Don’t cry anymore. My head hurts the most when you cry.","\"Yang Zhen, as the squad leader, you can’t take the lead and cry.","\"Stop crying and wipe your tears.","\"Everyone, pay attention. You have to be careful when you’re outside. You’re a soldier. You can’t cry even when you’re bleeding. It’s the same in the team, and it’s even more so when you’re outside.\"","Ye Jian, who had always been afraid of crying, felt her eyes turning red. She couldn’t cry. If she cried, this group of female soldiers would cry.","Major General Yang didn’t get out of the car immediately. When he got out of the car, the female soldiers had to salute again. It was better to let them calm down.","They didn’t stay for long and didn’t leave a bad impression on the surrounding passengers. But their genuine emotions were heartbreaking.","They wiped their tears and walked through the special passageway while being led by the airport staff. When they reached the waiting room, everyone wanted to hold Instructor Ye’s hand and talk to her.","Far away in Libya, Xia Jinyuan walked back and forth in the temporary tent of the peacekeeping force. He still wasn’t sure and asked the colonel in charge of the peacekeeping force, \"Are you sure that a female soldier called Ye Jian is leading a team over? Are you sure?\""]},{"number":5288,"title":"Chapter 5288: Excited","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan, who was still in Libya, had just returned from patrol ten minutes ago. He was drenched in sweat. The moment he entered the camp, he was called to the tent by the colonel in charge of the work arrangements of the Chinese peacekeeping camp. Before the colonel could start speaking, a call came from the country, and a communication soldier entered to report.","It wasn’t a secret that the country sent peacekeeping soldiers to Libya. Xia Jinyuan listened at the side and knew that 50 peacekeeping soldiers would come to Libya this time. Among them, 40 were male soldiers and 10 were female soldiers.","This was the first time China had sent female soldiers for peacekeeping. In the past, they were all male soldiers. Even if there were female soldiers accompanying them, they were mostly doctors and nurses.","The female soldiers were led by Ye Jian. When Xia Jinyuan heard the name ’Ye Jian’, he was stunned for a while. After the soldier left, he asked the colonel.","The colonel smiled and asked, \"Yes, I’ve confirmed it. She’ll bring the female soldiers into the camp the day after tomorrow. Do you know her? Your girlfriend?\"","The last sentence was an unintentional joke. The lieutenant colonel was quite interesting. A doctor in the camp wanted to act as a matchmaker and introduce him to a nurse from the medical team. As a result, the lieutenant colonel started avoiding the doctor and the nurse from then on.","The nurse’s self-esteem was hurt a little. She cried secretly a few times. The nurse only felt better when the lieutenant colonel told the doctor who wanted to be a matchmaker that he had a girlfriend.","Xia Jinyuan’s eyes were filled with smiles. He admitted readily, \"That’s right, she’s my girlfriend. I haven’t contacted her for almost a year. It’s a huge surprise that she suddenly came over.\"","The colonel was shocked. \"She’s really your girlfriend! What a coincidence.\"","\"Yes, it’s indeed a coincidence.\" Xia Jinyuan wanted to maintain his reserved smile, but the surprise was too huge. The joy in his heart was uncontrollable. He couldn’t stop laughing.","He was on cloud nine. It was unreal.","The lieutenant colonel couldn’t help but smile when he saw this. \"It’s been a year since you last contacted each other. Why don’t you pick her up the day after tomorrow?\"","He paused for a moment before asking, \"Does she know that you’re here?\"","After thinking for a while, Xia Jinyuan shook his head. \"I’m not sure.\"","He and his comrades didn’t receive the peacekeeping mission in advance. They were informed that night and joined the peacekeeping force that left the team the next day. He didn’t even have time to inform Ye Jian.","Hence, he was sure that his little fox didn’t know that he was in Libya too.","\"That’s good! I’ll arrange for you to pick her up the day after tomorrow. You can give your girlfriend a surprise. How about that? Do you accept the arrangement?\"","He was very happy with the arrangements!","Xia Jinyuan tucked his blue helmet into his arm and saluted the colonel who was reasonable and took care of the soldiers’ well-being. \"I resolutely obey the arrangements and will complete the mission!\"","At this moment, he really hoped that the day after tomorrow would arrive quickly. He hoped that he would be able to see his girlfriend, whom he had not seen for nine months and only occasionally contacted on the phone.","The colonel had given him a huge surprise. As for him, he wanted to give the little fox a huge surprise too.","Lieutenant Colonel Xia strode out of the tent. After taking a few steps, the smile on his handsome face disappeared a little. There was a hint of darkness in his eyes, but he quickly suppressed it. His thin lips curled up again.","His thin lips kept curling up. Fortunately, there was a blue helmet covering his head. Coupled with his sharp footsteps, no one paid much attention to him. At least, the peacekeeping soldiers wouldn’t pay special attention to him.","However, it was different for the comrades of the Xueyu unit."]},{"number":5289,"title":"Chapter 5289: Provocative","paragraphs":["The moment Z7 saw Xia Jinyuan, he said to his comrades, \"Do you smell it? There’s a smell coming from afar.\" He was afraid that his comrades didn’t understand what he meant, so he pouted his lips in Xia Jinyuan’s direction.","His comrades understood instantly. Even K7, who was born with a mild personality and lived like a monk without any desires, understood.","Something was fishy!","\"Come, come, come. Let’s make a bet. Let’s see who can guess why he’s so troublesome!\" T6 quickly formed a team and hugged his rifle tightly. \"We’ll take turns washing the socks of whoever guesses it right.\"","G3 immediately said, \"He must have contacted Azure Bird just now.\"","\"That’s impossible. Phone use is prohibited,\" T6 retorted firmly. \"I’m guessing he received a letter from Azure Bird.\"","Z7 stretched out a finger and shook it with a smile. \"Definitely not. It’s obvious that he’s in heat. He must have heard a piece of good news that has to do with Azure Bird. Could it be that... he can successfully give up his virginity after returning to the country?\"","\"If that were the case, he’d start acting like that after returning to the country. He wouldn’t have started now,\" V8 retorted. He then explained in detail, \"He can control his emotions so well. Would he start acting like this because of something he can only do after returning to the country? Definitely not.\"","It was very convincing.","White Crane thought for a moment and deliberated before saying, \"In other words, this good thing is happening soon and here? And it has something to do with Azure Bird?\"","This was because Q King, whom no one could understand, would only act this way when it had to do with Azure Bird.","K7 looked at the tall figure that was getting closer and closer to them. His cold voice was calm as he said, \"Azure Bird is here.\"","Everyone looked at him. That was impossible.","Azure Bird was now a whittling knife in the air force. How could she leave so easily? It was impossible.","However, there were no absolutes.","Xia Jinyuan saw that his comrades were gathered together and discussing something. He retracted his expression and walked over to announce the good news that Ye Jian would come the day after tomorrow.","\"F*ck, she’s really coming over? You’re not lying to us, right?\"","\"K7 guessed correctly? No way! She’s really coming?\"","T6 and Z7 had the biggest reaction. T6, who initiated the bet, started the bet because he didn’t want to wash his own socks. As for Z7, he felt that he knew Xia Jinyuan well.","In the end, both of them didn’t guess correctly. Instead, K7, who usually didn’t speak much, guessed correctly.","Thinking that they still had to wash K7’s socks, the two of them felt hopeless.","Not only did Xia Jinyuan tell his comrades that Ye Jian would come the day after tomorrow, but he also threw the question of why Ye Jian came to his comrades. After saying that, he asked if they had any thoughts and waited for his comrades to answer.","The comrades who felt that Q King was arrogant just now instantly retracted their expressions. There was a serious look on their faces.","\"Azure Bird was temporarily transferred to the airborne military unit but is now leading a female soldier team to Libya for peacekeeping. There has to be a connection between the two. The female soldiers can be led by the female soldier class’ squad leader or captain. There’s no need for Azure Bird to appear.\"","G3 analyzed calmly before asking, \"Is there something else going on?\"","\"So far, I haven’t received any insider information. The colonel only knows that the female soldiers are coming to Libya for peacekeeping with the male soldiers.\" Xia Jinyuan sat down and pondered. \"Have you thought about why we suddenly joined the peacekeeping force?\""]},{"number":5290,"title":"Chapter 5290: Insider","paragraphs":["Was there a need to think about this question?","\"Don’t we need to participate in peacekeeping?\" T6 was dumbfounded. \"We came at the end of July. It’s November now. Isn’t it about peacekeeping?\"","V8 glanced at T6, who wasn’t as calm. He whispered, \"It’s not that simple. Think about it.\"","\"They won’t send peacekeeping soldiers at the last minute. All the soldiers who come out for peacekeeping will have three to six months of special training. We joined at the last minute. There’s already a problem here,\" G3 said slowly. His gaze landed on Xia Jinyuan. \"Q King, are you trying to say that our peacekeeping isn’t real peacekeeping? There’s something else?","\"Is accompanying the peacekeeping force just a cover?\"","G3’s analysis made his comrades look at Xia Jinyuan again. Since Q King suddenly asked, did it mean that he had figured something out?","\"Don’t look at me. If I knew, would I have asked you?\" Facing his comrades’ gazes, Xia Jinyuan raised his eyebrows and smiled casually. \"Azure Bird came a little suddenly, so I thought about it. You also feel that there’s a problem with them mobilizing us at the last minute, right?\"","\"Before you asked us, I didn’t feel that there was anything wrong.\" White Crane rubbed his temples and was a little worried. \"Now that you’ve asked, I feel that there’s really a problem.\"","Their captain never played by the rules. He often made his comrades run around in circles while he crossed his arms and watched the commotion.","Sometimes, he liked to complicate simple problems and throw traps at them. He would smile and watch them until they had a headache.","A captain who liked to play pranks was really troublesome sometimes.","Just like now...","White Crane sighed. \"Q King, if you have any doubts, just say them. We’ll listen and stop guessing.\"","This time, Xia Jinyuan didn’t have any doubts. He asked his comrades because he couldn’t figure it out. Unexpectedly, his comrades were also confused.","Since no one could guess, they would let nature take its course. If anything really happened, they would definitely be informed in advance.","Just then, a black shadow fell from the sky and kicked K7 directly. The comrades sitting on both sides of him reacted quickly and rolled away. K7 opened his hands and hugged the black shadow that fell from the sky... It was a football.","\"You scared me to death. I thought it was mortars.\" T6 quickly patted his chest. There was no fear on his face.","They were in the peacekeeping camp now. If there were mortars, they would have to fire first.","The other person who dodged quickly was G3. He looked at the football in K7’s arms and then at the group of small figures running toward them. There was a smile in his eyes. \"These little fellows are getting more and more energetic.\"","\"They’re smiling more now,\" Z7 added. He turned his head and asked K7, \"Shall we go over and play with them?\"","K7 weighed the football in his hand and stood up.","K7, who was a cold person, surprisingly liked to play with the children. He played soccer with them and taught them how to speak Mandarin. He also told them how to escape and hide when they encountered danger. The patience he displayed shocked the comrades of the Xueyu unit, including Xia Jinyuan.","That was because they never knew that K7 liked children so much!","\"Let’s go and bring them to play football.\" Xia Jinyuan stood up too. \"This is the first time I’m playing football with a gun on my back.\"","With the captain’s words, the other comrades were all excited."]},{"number":5291,"title":"Chapter 5291: Who Will Compensate Them?","paragraphs":["These were the children who played football that day. T6 kicked their football until it exploded. Before he could find a brand new football to compensate them, the rebels of Libya started a war. These children were then sent to the Chinese peacekeeping camp.","These naturally dark-skinned children were very happy to play with the soldiers. When K7 suddenly kicked the football into the net, one of the children was so excited that he shouted, \"Gosh, he can do what Vimay can do. If Vimay could see it, he’d be overjoyed.\"","After clapping, the child suddenly fell silent. The rest of the children fell silent too.","That was because their little friend, Vimay, would never be able to see them again. He was killed by a bomb that day, and they couldn’t find his body.","T6’s eyes were red. Vimay was the person who ran over to take the football that he kicked away. He even told him that there was no need to compensate. His mother would stuff some things inside and sew it up again.","After rescuing all the reporters from Wanhai, they saw these children in the camp and found out that Vimay would never have the chance to play football again. They also knew that Vimay’s biggest wish was to see a new football one day.","Vimay, who had died under the gunfire, would never be seen again.","Libya was a good place with a blue sky, a vast land, and abundant rare mines. Before the war broke out, although the lives of the people here were not rich, they were comfortable and happy enough.","After the war broke out, this place became hell on earth.","The female soldiers who were on the transport plane stepped into the territory of another country. The sky was as blue as a mirror. When they saw the airport building that had been blown up and hadn’t been rebuilt, the female soldiers’ hearts tightened. This was the first time they saw the battlefield with their own eyes.","\"This is a peaceful zone that the rebels, government forces, and militants have agreed on. In the entire country, only this airport is a peaceful zone. No firepower is allowed to spread here.\"","The person in charge who entered the airport to welcome the soldiers said in a deep voice. His expression was especially serious. It was so serious that all the soldiers’ hearts sank.","Ye Jian looked into the distance and sighed in her heart.","\"Our truck is parked outside the airport. After we leave the airport, everyone must remember not to let go of the rifles in your hands. You must hold them tightly at all times because you might need them at any time.","\"After entering the war zone, there’s no need to be nervous. If anything happens, we’ll settle it immediately. You might also need to enter combat immediately. The rifle in your hand is your life-saving weapon.\"","The peacekeeping soldiers who had just entered a war-torn country tightened their grip on their rifles, and their facial expressions turned colder.","From this moment on, they were real peacekeeping soldiers. They were peacekeeping soldiers who could die here at any time.","The squad leader, Yang Zhen, secretly glanced at Instructor Ye who was standing beside her. She saw that Instructor Ye’s expression was calm and even the way she held her gun was relaxed and natural. She couldn’t help but lament in her heart, ’As expected of Instructor Ye. Her mental fortitude is exceptionally good.’","As the squad leader, she couldn’t help but feel a little nervous when she heard that they might enter combat at any moment. But Instructor Ye was still as calm and composed as before. She still had many things to learn from her.","Yang Zhen took a deep breath secretly and tried her best to relax. When they left in formation, she heard her comrades panting softly.","Xia Jinyuan, who was supposed to be picking up Ye Jian, raised his wrist and looked at his watch. His slender fingers, which were holding the steering wheel, bounced up from time to time. It could be seen that he was not very calm."]},{"number":5292,"title":"Chapter 5292: Life And Death Is Not A Choice","paragraphs":["Yang Zhen heard her comrades panting softly. Her heart turned cold. She was the squad leader. If even she showed fear, how could she calm her comrades down?","No, she couldn’t be afraid. No matter how afraid she was, she couldn’t let her comrades realize it. She had to hold on, like Instructor Ye, and be calm at all times.","Here, life and death was not a choice they could make. They either lived or died. It was just that cruel and simple.","She took a deep breath again and detected the faint smell of gunpowder in the air. Yang Zhen said to the female soldier beside her, \"Adjust your breathing and calm down. Don’t be too anxious.\"","\"Yes, squad leader.\" The female soldier, Ding Yue’e, secretly adjusted her breathing. She held the rifle in her hand tightly and adjusted her emotions until there was no fear in her eyes anymore. She looked forward with determination. Every step she took was exceptionally stable.","They were already far away from the peaceful country. They had come to a war country that was in dire straits. They were peacekeeping soldiers who watched over the dawn in the dark and spread peace amidst the turmoil.","The planes at the airport were all from the United Nations. Not far from the airport was the United Nations super camp. There were peacekeeping soldiers from other countries stationed in the camp, including the Chinese peacekeeping soldiers.","The camp that Ye Jian and the rest were going to wasn’t the United Nations super camp. It was the patrol area that Xia Jinyuan was in charge of. It was an area that protected the refugees and was also the most dangerous area. Sometimes, the rebels or anti-government militants would infiltrate the area as refugees and create chaos.","To ensure the safety of the residents, the peacekeeping soldiers needed to patrol every corner every day, including the ruins destroyed by the flames of war.","Besides the fact that the female soldiers didn’t need to go out for routine patrols, many other things that required females to do were left to the female soldiers.","There were many female refugees in the refugee camp. They would have all kinds of problems. Sometimes, the male soldiers couldn’t solve them at all. The female nurses needed to take care of the patients and couldn’t solve those problems in time. Hence, the female soldiers were here to solve those problems.","As the leader of the female soldier class, Ye Jian walked with the first lieutenant and the leader of the male soldiers. The first lieutenant smiled and sighed at Ye Jian. \"Ever since the higher-ups arranged for the female soldiers to come and do peacekeeping, we’ve been looking forward to it. As long as it didn’t happen, we wouldn’t be able to feel at ease. Even when you boarded the plane, we secretly prayed that you wouldn’t change your minds.","\"Only when the ten female soldiers walked out of the transport plane did I feel at ease.\"","The lieutenant was looking forward to the arrival of the female soldiers. They really needed the female soldiers to be stationed here.","\"When the time comes, we need to remind the female soldiers that there will be fights in the refugee area. They’re especially fierce. Once, two female nurses who tried to stop the fight were hit by bricks, and their bones were injured. As a result, when they fought later, the soldiers had to isolate the nurses first.","\"The male soldiers can stop the fight in time. However, gender differences make things inconvenient. Every time something like that happens, we’d hope that you’d arrive sooner.\"","The lieutenant was good at chatting. It was the first time they met, but he didn’t feel unfamiliar with Ye Jian. The captain of the male soldiers was also very talkative. On the other hand, Ye Jian didn’t talk much. However, she kept smiling and listening, making them feel that she was listening attentively."]},{"number":5293,"title":"Chapter 5293: My Love","paragraphs":["After knowing that the female soldiers wouldn’t go out to patrol, the men heaved a sigh of relief. However, they felt that it was a pity.","There was no war in the country, and the female soldiers lacked real combat experience. If they stayed in the camp, it would probably be very difficult for them to encounter crossfire. Hence, they wouldn’t be improving and training themselves in actual combat.","They still hoped that the female soldiers would have real combat experience. Special forces soldiers had to be special. After experiencing the flames of war, they would become stronger.","But it was no small matter to go to the battlefield. Even if they had any thoughts, they couldn’t decide immediately. They needed to consider everything.","Ye Jian thought about it as she walked. Occasionally, she would say a few words. She led the female soldiers out of the airport maintained by the United Nations. The open trucks for the 50 soldiers were in front.","There was no bus arranged for them. The windows and pillars of the bus would be affected by their vision. They might not be able to discover the abnormalities around them in time. Sitting in the open trucks, their vision would not be blocked. It would be safer as they could immediately set up their guns and retaliate.","Xia Jinyuan, who was standing beside a military Jeep, immediately saw the person he missed. There was no need to look for her as he could immediately spot her.","His gaze was burning with undisguised passion. He looked at the person who was getting closer and closer to him without blinking. She was wearing the blue helmet of the peacekeeping soldiers and the camouflage combat uniform of the same color. He would always be able to find her among dozens of people.","Ye Jian didn’t notice Xia Jinyuan immediately. She didn’t know that her boyfriend was in Libya too. She didn’t expect to meet him here. She glanced at the five trucks and suddenly felt a gaze that made her heart jump. She looked at a figure in front of her, and her clear eyes froze.","Captain... Captain Xia?","Why did she see Captain Xia?","Was she seeing things?","She couldn’t believe it. She blinked hard and widened her eyes. She didn’t see wrongly. She didn’t see wrongly! The tall figure standing beside the door of the Jeep was her Captain Xia!","Her mood instantly became elated. Her eyes, face, and entire body were consumed with joy. If she hadn’t been with the lieutenant and the captain of the male soldiers, she would have run all the way over and thrown herself into her boyfriend’s arms.","Ye Jian, who was very excited, controlled her urge to run over. The surprise didn’t make her lose her composure. She quickly stabilized her expression and looked the same as before.","Only her hands, which were holding the rifle tightly, revealed how excited and happy she was.","Their gazes met, sending electric currents and sparks through the air.","Unfortunately, the two of them were able to control their emotions very well. No matter how happy they were, they wouldn’t let other people see it. They already knew each other’s feelings.","’Long time no see, my little fox.’","’Long time no see, Captain Xia.’","White Crane, who was driving the Jeep, stood beside the driver’s door. As Ye Jian walked closer, he recognized Ye Jian from a group of blue helmets. It had been almost three years since they last separated. The aura of the only female special forces soldier in the Xueyu unit was even sharper than before.","He didn’t know if it was his illusion, but he felt that... Azure Bird’s temperament was very similar to Q King’s. Could it be that after being lovers for a long time, even their temperaments became similar?","Ye Jian saw White Crane too. She nodded slightly and smiled. White Crane smiled and nodded at her too."]},{"number":5294,"title":"Chapter 5294: Arrest","paragraphs":["Although Xia Jinyuan and White Crane were tasked to pick her up, all matters were arranged by the lieutenant. The lieutenant didn’t know that the captain of the female soldier team was Lieutenant Colonel Xia’s girlfriend. A couple who had not seen each other for a long time couldn’t hold hands and express their love immediately. They had to settle everything before they had time for that.","The Jeep stopped in front of the five trucks. 50 peacekeeping soldiers lined up in the empty space in front of the jeep. Xia Jinyuan’s gaze was like a woven net that enveloped Ye Jian, who had her back facing him. As he listened to her command and watched her move like a knife, the darkness in his black eyes became darker and darker. She was clearly within reach, but his longing for her was deeper and stronger than before.","Ye Jian, who was standing among the team, felt Xia Jinyuan’s strong and intense longing. Her heart trembled.","\"Attention, at ease, get ready!\" Ye Jian’s heart was trembling as she faced the female soldiers calmly. Even though the gaze behind her was so intense that it seemed to be imprinted in her heart, she didn’t look back. She just... sped up and arranged for the female soldiers to get on the trucks.","\"Squad leader!\"","\"Here!\"","\"Arrange for boarding!\"","\"Yes!\"","The clear and crisp voices of the female soldiers were like larks. The ten female soldiers boarded the truck at a speed not inferior to the male soldiers.","They ran past the Jeep and brushed past Xia Jinyuan. None of them recognized Instructor Xia, who once taught male soldiers in the battalion.","In the end, Ye Jian ran past as well. She heard Captain Xia say in a low voice, \"You look so good that I want to press you down and kiss you.\"","Ye Jian’s entire heart was trembling. This fellow was starting it again!","She ran past quickly. Xia Jinyuan confirmed that she must have heard what he said. His thin lips curled up slightly. He was like a cheetah that was slowly crossing the prairie. He was elegant while exuding a strong sense of danger.","There seemed to be a faint fragrance left behind by her when she ran past. Xia Jinyuan narrowed his dark eyes and said to White Crane, who was sitting in the Jeep, \"I’ll go look for her. I have to catch her and bring her into my car.\"","If not, she would definitely be sitting in a truck with the female soldiers. He came here to fetch her. He wanted to bring her to his side and sit with her.","White Crane made a ’go ahead’ gesture.","If the flirtatious fellow didn’t catch her by his side today, he might be in a bad mood. Once he was in a bad mood, the unlucky ones would be his comrades.","Ye Jian did plan to sit in the same truck as the female soldiers. Yang Zhen got into the truck, and Ye Jian was about to get into the truck too. Just then, a man’s voice came from the side with a faint smile. It was mellow and cold. \"Long time no see, Instructor Ye.\"","Yang Zhen, who hadn’t gotten into the truck, heard this voice. Why did it sound so familiar?","She immediately turned her head and looked to the side. Her face was filled with surprise. \"Instructor Xia!\"","The female soldiers sitting in the open truck were all stunned. They found the voice familiar just now. They didn’t expect to meet Instructor Xia here!","\"It’s really Instructor Xia. I didn’t expect to meet you here!\" The female soldiers were surprised and happy. Their uneasiness toward the unfamiliar environment dissipated.","Meeting an old friend in a foreign land would indeed make people feel better.","Xia Jinyuan didn’t greet the female soldiers warmly. He had a cold personality, so he wouldn’t be enthusiastic even when he met people he knew. He just nodded slightly."]},{"number":5295,"title":"Chapter 5295: Bachelor Critical Hit","paragraphs":["Seeing that the female soldiers had all stood up, he glanced over with a cold gaze. He frowned slightly and said in a low voice, \"Take your guns and sit properly. You have to be prepared to fight at any time.\"","Before the female soldiers could retract their smiles, they were stunned by Xia Jinyuan’s cold gaze. They held their breaths and sat upright. They didn’t dare to say anything else.","Instructor Xia had always been serious. He was even able to scare the male soldiers. How did they have the guts to smile and greet Instructor Xia just now?","Only their instructor wasn’t afraid of him.","The moment he spoke, the female soldiers were so stunned that they didn’t dare to make a sound. Xia Jinyuan just wanted to ask Ye Jian to leave with him. He said seriously, \"Instructor Ye, I have some things to discuss with you. Let’s talk in the Jeep.\"","Ye Jian really thought that something had happened. She gave a couple of reminders to the female soldiers before leaving with Xia Jinyuan.","White Crane, who saw the two of them through the rearview mirror, gave the captain a thumbs-up. Impressive! He really took Azure Bird away under the eyes of the female soldiers.","As Xia Jinyuan walked, his shoulder touched Ye Jian’s from time to time. White Crane covered his eyes silently. Q King, who had been in heat all the way here, couldn’t control himself anymore. He blatantly harassed Azure Bird in front of everyone.","It was just three to five meters, but Xia Jinyuan had touched Ye Jian’s shoulder at least five times!","What else could Ye Jian say? Yes, she didn’t want to say anything. She lowered her head and smiled silently.","After not seeing him for more than nine months, she couldn’t help but want to hold his hand. She wanted to throw herself into his arms and hug him. She had to restrain herself.","White Crane, who was sitting in the car and bearing witness to their PDA, wanted to cover his eyes. Love was indeed sweet. He could feel the sweetness even when he was sitting in the car.","White Crane opened the car door and greeted, \"Long time no see, Azure Bird.\"","Ye Jian smiled until her eyes curved. \"White Crane, long time no see.\"","\"You didn’t smile like this when you saw me just now.\" Xia Jinyuan, who hadn’t gotten into the Jeep, was ’jealous’. \"You even glared at me.\"","He was ’jealous’, but Ye Jian’s face turned red. \"Don’t we have something to discuss? Hurry up and get in the car.\"","If he continued, he would definitely say many things that made her blush.","Xia Jinyuan, who had nothing to discuss, was not embarrassed. He bent down and got into the car. He said to White Crane, \"The person in front, please lower your head.\"","Ye Jian didn’t understand. White Crane suppressed his laughter and quickly lowered his head. Soon, he heard a kiss that made him sweat.","He made a mistake!","He made a huge mistake!","Why did he volunteer to be the driver? There must have been something wrong with his brain!","The kiss was so loud. Couldn’t they be more considerate?","Ye Jian, who was kissed, was dumbfounded. She was so dumbfounded that it made it convenient for Xia Jinyuan to barge in directly. He grabbed her soft tongue and sucked it. It wasn’t a gentle kiss. It was even aggressive. However, she could feel the deep love in his actions. The overwhelming longing made Ye Jian fall for him, and she couldn’t bear to push him away.","The scorching kiss didn’t last long. It didn’t even last a minute. It lasted for about 30 seconds.","There were no more kissing sounds that made the bachelor sweat. White Crane, who only dared to raise his head now, slowly turned his head and looked at the two of them with a hurt expression. \"Guys, I’m still young and growing. I’m still developing my morals, intelligence, and body. My heart is still young. Can’t you be more considerate of me?\"","Fortunately, the time was short. If it were longer, he would have gone on strike and changed cars!"]},{"number":5296,"title":"Chapter 5296: Interlocked Fingers","paragraphs":["At this moment, Ye Jian’s entire body was burning up. She didn’t dare to raise her head at all. She didn’t even listen carefully to what White Crane said. Perhaps... she was so embarrassed that she blocked all her emotions and rejected all information from the outside world.","Xia Jinyuan licked his lips and recalled the kiss just now. Hearing that, he replied to his comrade lazily, \"You can do this in front of me in the future. You don’t have to mind me.\"","White Crane chuckled. He thought to himself, ’I’d first need a girlfriend before you could mind it!’","Ye Jian, who was too embarrassed to speak, secretly pinched Xia Jinyuan’s thigh and warned her man to shut up. She used a little too much strength, causing Xia Jinyuan’s mouth to twitch. It hurt!","\"Pinch gently. It hurts.\" Xia Jinyuan naturally held the hand that was pinching his thigh. He held it tightly and slowly closed his fingers. The two of them went from holding hands to interlocking fingers.","Xia Jinyuan, who had been a virgin for many years, was extremely satisfied.","Their fingers were interlocked so tightly that they seemed to have become one. Their warm palms were pressed tightly against each other. The veins in fingers were connected to hearts. Now that their fingers were interlocked tightly, that meant their hearts were also close.","White Crane looked at them silently through the rearview mirror. There was a warm smile in his eyes.","Q King and Azure Bird’s love didn’t wear down their relationship even after endless waiting. Every time they separated, they would work hard to reunite. Every time they waited, they would wait silently. Every time they reunited, their relationship would be deeper and more stable.","This kind of love made people yearn for it.","The 40 male soldiers all boarded the trucks. The lieutenant in charge of welcoming them jogged over. Xia Jinyuan rolled down the window of the back seat in advance and placed his elbow on the window. He smiled at the lieutenant who ran over and said, \"Lieutenant, I’ll invite the captain of the female soldiers to sit with us. I’ll have to trouble you to sit in front.\"","The lieutenant wiped the sweat that flowed to the corner of his eyes and smiled. \"No trouble at all.\"","The lieutenant opened the car door and got in. He turned his head and said to Ye Jian, \"Captain Ye, the camp is an hour and a half away from the airport. If you’re tired, you can sleep.\"","The two of them had let go of their hands when the lieutenant ran over. Ye Jian, whose face was still a little red, smiled and replied, \"I’ve been sleeping. I’m not tired now.\"","\"I see. Let me talk about some things in our camp, then.\" The lieutenant saw that Ye Jian’s face was indeed rosy and she didn’t look tired. Hence, he decided to talk about some things in the camp.","Ye Jian’s face only turned red from the kiss. As she listened attentively, slowly, the shy look on her face disappeared.","The vehicle drove with a clang. The country that was ravaged by the flames of war slowly appeared in front of the female soldiers like a dilapidated painting. They saw the deep pit created by the mortars and the black cars that had been burned to ashes. There were even tanks among them.","Here, there were attacks almost every day. Cars getting bombed, gun fire, landmine detonation, taking hostages, kidnapping... There were unexpected terrorist incidents every day.","Such dangers would also happen to the United Nations peacekeeping soldiers, including soldiers from various countries. The militants would point their guns at them and shoot at them at any time.","All the restrictions had no effect on the Libyan militants.","The land near the northern edge of the desert was so desolate that the female soldiers’ hearts were extremely heavy.","Libya was the most dangerous peacekeeping mission area.","But the soldiers who came here for peacekeeping never cowered in the face of danger. They used their guns to protect the refugees in this war-torn country."]},{"number":5297,"title":"Chapter 5297: Following Like A Shadow","paragraphs":["The lieutenant treated Ye Jian as a female soldier who was entering a war-torn country for the first time. In order to let Ye Jian be mentally prepared, he picked some key points and told Ye Jian.","\"Last year, there were 14 car bombings here. The militants drove the vehicles containing the remote bombs into the camp and detonated them quickly. Last year, a few huge pits were blown up at the entrance of our camp.","\"This year, the attacks escalated again, with indirect fire and reverse slope fire attacks. A hole was blasted in the northern camp. Fortunately, we intercepted it in time. If not, the consequences would’ve been unimaginable.","\"Apart from the fear of violence, the environment is also a hurdle we have to overcome. In the rainy season, the average temperature is still 40 degrees Celsius. The growth of mosquitoes is quite rapid. Infectious diseases like malaria and yellow fever are unavoidable. The refugee camps will suffer the most.\"","On the way to the camp, the lieutenant told Ye Jian about the difficulties and the dangers they might encounter at any time. He treated Ye Jian as a newbie who had just entered a war-torn country. As he spoke, he secretly observed Ye Jian. He was afraid that if he said too much, the female soldier would be afraid.","The lieutenant didn’t see any fear on Ye Jian’s face. When he saw her face, he was surprised. This was the first time she had entered a war-torn country. No matter who it was, they would be more or less afraid. However, the expression of the female soldiers’ captain was so calm as if she had seen such an environment many times. There were no emotions on her face.","This was the first time the lieutenant saw such confidence on the face of a female soldier who had just arrived in a war-torn country.","White Crane drove steadily. He was overjoyed.","Q King, who was sitting at the back, had a serious expression on his face. His eyes were cold as if he was using his expression to echo everything the lieutenant said.","Actually... White Crane felt that he just looked depressed.","Q King, who came to fetch Ye Jian, couldn’t find a chance to talk to her. How could he not be depressed?","However, he couldn’t tell the lieutenant directly that Ye Jian, who was sitting at the back, was a female soldier who had experienced countless wars and fights. He didn’t have to worry that she would be afraid.","The lieutenant had good intentions. No matter how depressed Q King was, he could only bear it.","Of course, now was not the time to talk about love. It was already good enough that they could meet. He could not ask for too much anymore. It was enough to reunite in a foreign country after more than nine months of separation.","Xia Jinyuan’s expression wasn’t serious because the lieutenant kept talking and he couldn’t chat with Ye Jian. He was wondering why Ye Jian came to Libya for peacekeeping.","The more he thought about it, the more he felt that there was something strange about this matter. There was a problem. He needed to think about it and see if he could come up with any clues.","If he really couldn’t do it, he might as well call the country and ask the major general what his arrangements were.","The car quickly entered the city. Ye Jian vaguely heard sporadic gunshots in the city. She looked out of the car window and said to Xia Jinyuan, \"Southeast, about eight kilometers away. There are sporadic firefights.\"","\"Yes, the situation here is complicated. It’s a characteristic of the most dangerous peacekeeping area. It’s abnormal not to hear any gunshots for a day.\" Xia Jinyuan, who also heard the gunshots, frowned slightly and opened the map he carried with him.","Just as he pointed at their approximate location, Ye Jian, who had come over to look at the map, reached out her hand and pointed at another spot with her slender fingers. \"It should be in this area.\"","\"This place is about 14 kilometers away from our camp. The camp will be prepared.\" Xia Jinyuan nodded. \"We need to take a detour.\""]},{"number":5298,"title":"Chapter 5298: Relations","paragraphs":["It was a map of the entire city in his hand, and Xia Jinyuan knew it very well. Xia Jinyuan and the other peacekeeping soldiers, who were often arranged to patrol, had a copy of it so that they could immediately know their location and make adjustments in time if there was danger.","This kind of sporadic exchange of fire was like a test. There wouldn’t be any real damage. The other party wanted the bullets to whiz past ordinary civilians to show off their power. Under normal circumstances, they just needed to wait for this wave to pass. There was no need to take a detour.","However, that wouldn’t happen this time. There were 50 peacekeeping soldiers in the five vehicles. They had to take care of them.","In that case, they would choose to take a detour.","The lieutenant also agreed to take a detour. He turned around and saw the two young soldiers sitting at the back. They had such a tacit understanding that he couldn’t interrupt them. He was surprised. \"You know each other?\"","\"We’re comrades,\" White Crane replied concisely. \"The three of us are comrades and have known each other for many years.\"","The lieutenant was speechless. How could he have been so blind?","\"Attention, attention. There are sporadic exchanges of fire in front. To ensure safety, we’ll take a detour. There are sporadic exchanges of fire in front. To ensure safety, we’ll take a detour. Please answer when you receive it. Please answer when you receive it.\"","\"Vehicle One, copy. Vehicle One, copy!\"","\"Vehicle Two, copy. Vehicle Two, copy!\"","Soon, all five vehicles received the message. The Jeep led the way and the five trucks took a detour to avoid the crossfire. Under normal circumstances, the peacekeeping forces wouldn’t participate in this crossfire.","The situation in Libya was especially complicated because of the rebels. In addition, a few large ethnic groups were secretly playing cheap tricks, making the government forces unable to split up. The militants would also come out to cause trouble. They not only targeted the government but also a few large ethnic groups.","There might even be a secret alliance. The complicated situation also made the peacekeeping forces sent by the United Kingdom more cautious to avoid encountering minefields.","When the female soldiers heard the gunshots, they instinctively hugged the rifles in their hands and turned their heads to look in the direction of the gunshots. They couldn’t see anything.","\"Did they get into a firefight?\" Gao Xiao asked Qiu Tong in a low voice. After hashing out their issues, their relationship got better and better. They became good friends and comrades who told each other everything.","Qiu Tong tightened her grip on her rifle and lowered her voice. \"I don’t know. If it was a firefight, they would’ve asked us to prepare. But... they didn’t.\"","\"So, it’s not a firefight?\" Gao Xiao wasn’t sure. She looked around nervously. \"Why does it feel like a firefight? We should be driving toward the city. We seem to be coming off the main road.\"","There was a straight yellow road leading to the city. Now, the truck turned and took another road.","\"It doesn’t matter if it’s a firefight or not. We’ll be vigilant regardless. If anything happens, we’ll deal with it immediately.\" Qiu Tong was very calm. If they really encountered a firefight, they would still have rifles in their hands. \"Hold on to your rifles. Don’t be so nervous that you can’t even pull the safety catch later.\"","Gao Xiao rolled her eyes. \"Would I make such a mistake?\"","\"Nothing is certain,\" Qiu Tong replied with a smile. Gao Xiao pouted.","Yang Zhen looked at the two of them whispering to each other and reminded them, \"Be careful. Don’t keep talking. Take note of your surroundings.\"","\"Yes!\" The two of them quickly replied and stopped talking.","Gao Xiao was sure to start talking later again. Yang Zhen smiled lightly and didn’t criticize her."]},{"number":5299,"title":"Chapter 5299: Worry","paragraphs":["In the Jeep, the lieutenant was very interested in the three of them being comrades. \"I really couldn’t tell that the three of you were comrades just now. But when Lieutenant Colonel Xia took out the map and Captain Ye joined the discussion, the chemistry between the two of them made me feel a little strange. I really didn’t expect you to be comrades.","\"Including Captain Ye, eight of your comrades are in Libya. Captain Ye, what’s your identity in the team?\"","He didn’t ask which military unit the three of them came from. The peacekeeping soldiers came from several military units, and the three people in front of him weren’t from the same military unit as him.","Ye Jian didn’t hide anything. \"Sniper.\"","The woman was a sniper, which was rare across all the different military units in the country. At least the lieutenant didn’t have a female sniper in his unit. Hence, the lieutenant was so surprised that his eyes widened. \"Sniper? You’re that powerful?","\"Even the sniper is here. Not bad, it’s a good combination!\"","A sniper was here. Oh right! Xia Jinyuan pursed his lips when he thought of the crux of the matter. Even the sniper was sent over. They would probably do something soon.","Just as he thought about this, three pairs of eyes silently looked at each other in the rearview mirror. White Crane, who was smiling slightly, quickly caught Xia Jinyuan’s gaze and drove the vehicle seriously.","Ye Jian retracted her gaze and smiled at Xia Jinyuan. The three of them didn’t need to talk to know what they were thinking.","They had been comrades for many years and had gone through life and death many times. Their chemistry was extraordinary.","In the camp, G3 watched as K7 led a group of Libyan children to play soccer while waiting for his comrades to return. Just now, he received a notice that there were sporadic exchanges of fire on the way back. The team had chosen to take a detour and return to the camp. They would be back half an hour later.","It was very dangerous to stay outside for one more minute. G3 was a little worried when he learned that they would take half an hour longer.","As the most dangerous peacekeeping area, G3’s worries were not unfounded. Before returning to the camp, everything was uncertain.","It could be considered a test for the peacekeeping soldiers sent by China. The 50 peacekeeping soldiers who passed through a village did encounter trouble.","In front of them, there was a wire fence that led to the city. Sandbags were piled behind the wire fence. The first lieutenant put down his binoculars and said with a serious and cold expression, \"There are guns lying in ambush behind the sandbags. The village where the Walla people live has always been close to the government forces. Their village has its own armed forces. They have always been secretly supporting the government forces. It’s unlikely that they’d block the road to the city.\"","In terms of actual combat experience, the first lieutenant had to stand aside in front of the three people in the car. He was still analyzing when Ye Jian pulled down the safety catch twice and entered combat mode in a second.","White Crane, who was driving, passed the intercom to Xia Jinyuan behind him. Xia Jinyuan took the intercom and informed the relevant personnel in a cold voice, \"Prepare for combat. Unidentified people are lying in ambush in front. Everyone, prepare for combat.\"","They were at least 800 meters away from the wire fence ambush. Including the Jeep, all six vehicles turned off their engines.","Ye Jian said in a low voice, \"The atmosphere is not right. Change combat preparation to entering combat. I’ll go over and meet up with the female soldiers.\"","She needed to lead the female soldiers. The male soldiers definitely wouldn’t be able to send people out to command the female soldiers to fight. She wasn’t at ease handing the female soldiers to the male soldiers either.","They had not been given enough time to get to know each other. They lacked chemistry."]},{"number":5300,"title":"Chapter 5300: First Time","paragraphs":["When the car stopped, the female soldiers subconsciously carried the rifles in their hands to the front. The ten female soldiers were divided into four directions. Before the peacekeeping soldiers in the trucks could jump down, they had already entered combat preparations.","The female soldiers from the first female special forces unit in the country were more sensitive to their surroundings than the male soldiers could imagine.","Xia Jinyuan got off the Jeep. When he saw the female soldiers setting up their guns and entering combat, he nodded slightly. He was very satisfied with their mobility.","The soldier who came to inform the female soldiers was a little surprised when he saw this. He heaved a sigh of relief and raised his head to inform the squad leader of the female soldiers, Yang Zhen, \"Yang Zhen, there’s a situation in front. Lead the team down.\"","\"Yes!\" Yang Zhen put away her rifle. The female soldiers in charge of guarding the sides of the truck got down first. After they got down, the two female soldiers in charge of guarding the back of the truck jumped down. Then, the two female soldiers in charge of guarding the front of the truck got down.","Ye Jian, who was walking over, happened to see the two female soldiers in charge of guarding the front of the truck getting out. She had been paying attention to the female soldiers’ reactions since she got out of the Jeep. When she saw them getting out of the truck in an orderly and planned manner, she walked closer and praised all the female soldiers, \"Not bad. You’re very calm when you encounter trouble. You’ve given me a huge surprise.\"","They didn’t panic. Ye Jian only saw the calmness and composure a soldier should have on the battlefield. This allowed Ye Jian to have more confidence in the female soldiers.","\"There’s a situation ahead. The road to the city is blocked by unknown people. It’s still being confirmed. If there’s a problem, we’ll either choose to retreat or fight.","\"The possibility of choosing to retreat is high. Here, we won’t exchange fire with either side easily, including the militants. As long as they don’t confront us head-on, we won’t take the initiative to exchange fire.\"","After Ye Jian finished speaking, Gao Xiao immediately raised her question. \"Since the possibility of us choosing to retreat is very high, why didn’t we just reverse and leave just now? Why did we get down?\"","Gao Xiao had always been a smart person in the team. She was a little impatient, but with the patient Qiu Tong by her side, the two of them cooperated well.","The female soldiers looked at Ye Jian.","That was right. Why did they have to get down?","Ye Jian pointed at the small village in front of her. \"Because there are residents of Libya there. Before the situation is clear, we need to stay and confirm. If there are no problems, we’ll retreat. If there are problems, we need to negotiate.","\"Qiu Tong, keep an eye on Gao Xiao.\"","\"Yes!\" Qiu Tong held her rifle and replied in a deep voice. Gao Xiao was daring. She was able to go all out on the training ground. If something really happened later, Ye Jian was worried that Gao Xiao would go all out.","The ten female soldiers used the truck as a cover to prepare for battle. After more than a year of training, this group of female soldiers was no longer the same as before. Even their gazes were several times sharper than before. Under the sunlight, their young faces were much rougher than their peers. They had a tenacity that their peers didn’t have. They were like cacti growing in the desert. No matter how bad the environment was, they could face the sand and cold.","15 minutes later, the lieutenant finally contacted the government forces stationed not far away from the village. He received a piece of news that made the lieutenant’s expression turn serious.","\"Lieutenant Colonel Xia, the village in front was suddenly sealed off three days ago. As there were no gunshots, the government forces didn’t pay attention to it. The current situation in the village is unknown. The government forces can’t provide any useful information. They said that if the situation allows, they hope that we can send soldiers in to take a look.\""]}]);
